# libretranslate
msgid "**Advanced openresty load-balancing strategies.** v1 uses default round-robin in the per-app `upstream` block. Weighted distribution, least-connections, sticky sessions (`ip_hash` / cookie-based), and active HTTP healthchecks are out of scope. Adding them is a follow-up requirement and only becomes load-bearing once a service is regularly run with replicas > 1, which itself depends on shared storage being NFS-backed for that service."
msgstr "**Avancerede openresty loading-balancering strategier.** v1 bruger standard round- Robin i per- app `upstream` Block. Vægtet fordeling, least-forbindelser, klistrede sessioner (`ip_hash` / madlavning-baseret), og aktive HTTP sundhedstjek er ude af rækkevidde. Tilføjelse af dem er en opfølgning-up krav og kun bliver load- bærende, når en tjeneste er regelmæssigt kører med kopier > 1, som selv afhænger af delt opbevaring er NFS- bakkes op for denne tjeneste."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Agent dashboards are public behind proxy + Keycloak OIDC.** `web-app-hermes` and `web-app-openclaw` follow the standard `web-app-*` contract: own canonical domain, reverse-proxy routing, SSO enforced via [`web-app-keycloak`](../../roles/web-app-keycloak/). Hermes uses its native self-hosted OIDC support. OpenClaw's native OIDC is unverified upstream: if absent, the dashboard sits behind the platform's standard auth-proxy pattern (SSO enforced at the proxy, OpenClaw's own token auth staying internal-only). No unauthenticated public surface either way."
msgstr "**Agent dashboards er offentlige bag proxy + Keycloak OIDC.** `web-app-hermes` og `web-app-openclaw` følge standarden `web-app-*` kontrakt: eget kanonisk domæne, reverse- proxy routing, SSO håndhæves via [`web-app-keycloak`](../../roles/web-app-keycloak/). Hermes bruger sin egen egen støtte fra OIDC. OpenClaw 's indfødte OIDC er uverificeret opstrøms: hvis fraværende, dashboardet sidder bag platformens standard auth- proxy mønster (SSO håndhæves på proxy, OpenClaws egen token auth opholder sig internt-kun)Ingen uautoriseret offentlig overflade."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Agent gateway:** The container runs the OpenClaw gateway bound to the LAN interface on port 18789, with an HTTP health check against `/healthz`."
msgstr "**Agent gateway:** Beholderen kører OpenClaw gateway bundet til LAN interface på port 18789, med en HTTP sundhed check mod `/healthz`."

