msgid "**All changed paths under `roles/<role>/...`**: the changed roles become the seed set, and the whitelist is the transitive closure of those seeds expanded upwards over `run_after`, `dependencies`, and shared services. In other words, every role whose prerequisite set as defined by [combined resolver](../../../../cli/meta/roles/applications/resolution/combined/resolver.py) contains one of the seeds is included, together with the seeds themselves."
msgstr "**Alle ændrede stier under `roles/<role>/...`**: de ændrede roller bliver frø sæt, og whitelist er den transitive lukning af disse frø udvidet opad over `run_after`, `dependencies`, og fælles tjenester. Med andre ord enhver rolle, hvis forudsætning er defineret ved [kombineret resolver](../../../../cli/meta/roles/applications/resolution/combined/resolver.py) indeholder en af frøene er inkluderet, sammen med frøene selv."

