# libretranslate
msgid "**Backup and disaster recovery.** *svc-bkp-container-2-local* is superseded by *svc-bkp-volume-2-local*, making backup policy explicit per volume. The role prefers filesystem snapshots when available and can prepare btrfs hosts for snapshot-based backups itself. New *svc-bkp-nfs-2-local* protects the shared NFS export, *svc-bkp-secrets-2-local* captures secret material, and *svc-bkp-local-2-device* synchronizes backups to mounted external media. A unified *recover* CLI drives restores, while Compose recovery checks and a full Swarm disaster-recovery drill continuously verify the path. Rsync no longer retains superseded files as *~* copies."
msgstr "**Backup og katastrofe opsving.** *Svc- bkp- container-2- lokal* erstattes af *svc-bkp-volume-2-local*, gør backup politik eksplicit per volumen. Rollen foretrækker filsystem snapshots, når de er tilgængelige, og kan forberede btrfs værter til snapshot- baserede sikkerhedskopier selv. Ny *svc-bkp-nfs-2-local* beskytter den fælles NFS-eksport *svc-bkp-secrets-2-local* fanger hemmeligt materiale, og *svc-bkp-local-2-device* synkroniserer sikkerhedskopier til monterede eksterne medier. En samlet *inddrive* CLI-drev genopretter, mens komponér gendannelseskontrol og en fuld Swarm disaster- recovery boremaskine løbende kontrollere stien. Rsync ikke længere bevarer erstattede filer som *#* kopier."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Backup integration:** Backup Docker Volumes snapshots the model volume when that role is present, without stopping the container."
msgstr "**Backup integration:** Backup Docker Volumes snapshots modellen volumen, når denne rolle er til stede, uden at stoppe beholderen."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Backup user SSH access was hardened:** backup keys are wrapped with a forced command wrapper and written via the shared user role; config is now users.backup.authorized_keys."
msgstr "**Backup bruger SSH adgang var hærdet:** backup nøgler er pakket ind med en tvungen kommando wrapper og skrevet via den delte brugerrolle; config er nu users.backup.authorized_keys."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Backup/cleanup services are more reliable:** run-once flags execute earlier, user-backup is an explicit dependency, and cleanback now uses a configurable backups root and keeps the newest backups by default (force-keep=3)."
msgstr "**Backup / oprydning tjenester er mere pålidelige:** run- når flag udføres tidligere, user-backup er en eksplicit afhængighed, og cleanback bruger nu en konfigurerbar sikkerhedskopi rod og holder den nyeste sikkerhedskopi som standard (power- keep =3)."

