# libretranslate
msgid "**Deploy iteration.** [deploy/cli.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/deploy/cli.py) re-derives the same plan via `plan_dev_inventory_matrix` (the planner is a pure function shared between init and deploy) and runs one deploy per folder. **Every round deploys its full variant-aware include set.** Round R starts from a clean host (the previous round's include is purged before round R begins, see point 5), so every dep that round R needs MUST be redeployed."
msgstr "**Udsæt iteration.** [deploy/cli.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/deploy/cli.py) får den samme plan via `plan_dev_inventory_matrix` (planlæggeren er en ren funktion delt mellem init og deployering) og kører en implementering per mappe. **Hver runde udsender sin fulde variant- bevidste omfatte sæt.** Runde R starter fra en ren vært (den forrige runde er inkluderet er renset før runde R begynder, se punkt 5), så hver dep, at runde R har brug for skal omfordeles."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Deploy on an Encrypted Server** You SHOULD install Infinito.Nexus on an encrypted server to prevent hosting providers from accessing end-user data. For a practical guide on setting up an encrypted server, refer to the [Hetzner Arch LUKS repository](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/hetzner-arch-luks) 🔐. (Learn more about [disk encryption](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Disk_encryption) on Wikipedia.)"
msgstr "**Deploy på en krypteret server** Du skal installere Infinito.Nexus på en krypteret server for at forhindre hostingudbydere i at få adgang til slutbrugerdata. For en praktisk guide til opsætning af en krypteret server henvises til [Hetzner Arch LUKS-arkiv](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/hetzner-arch-luks) 🔐. (Læs mere om [diskkryptering](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Disk_encryption) på Wikipedia.)"

