# libretranslate
msgid "**Enable state defaults to off; deliberately-wired integrations auto-enable with their partner.** `enabled` is optional and defaults to `false` unless `required: true` is set. An addon that bridges a service MUST derive its effective enablement from that service's `enabled` flag (never a duplicated group-membership expression), so a deliberately-wired cross-role integration activates automatically whenever its partner role is co-deployed (`services.<target>.enabled` is true) and stays off otherwise. Any credential an addon needs is declared in `meta/secrets.yml` `credentials:` and read via `lookup('config', application_id, 'secrets.credentials.<name>')` (Decision 4): auto-generated where possible, or supplied through the same credentials mechanism's manual-entry path where the operator must enter the secret. There is no separate opt-in exception: auto-enable-with-partner holds, and an operator-entered credential resolves through `credentials` like any other. This auto-enable-with-partner rule is distinct from update-automation-discovered addons (Decision 10), which are added hard-off."
msgstr "**Aktivér tilstand standard til at slukke; configationly-wired integration auto-aktivere med deres partner.** `enabled` er valgfri og standard til `false` medmindre `required: true` Er klar. En addon, der broer en tjeneste SKAL udlede sin effektive mulighed fra denne tjeneste s `enabled` flag (aldrig en duplikeret gruppe-medlemskab udtryk), så en diskussion-wired cross-rolleintegration aktiveres automatisk, når dens partner rolle er sam- (`services.<target>.enabled` er sandt) og holder sig fra andre. Enhver kredit en addon behov er angivet i `meta/secrets.yml` `credentials:` og læs via `lookup('config', application_id, 'secrets.credentials.<name>')` (Afgørelse 4): autogenereret, hvor det er muligt, eller leveret via samme legitimationsmekanismes manuelle indgangsvej, hvor operatøren skal indtaste hemmeligheden. Der er ikke nogen særskilt mulighed, bortset fra: auto-enhancement-within-partner holder, og en operator-indtastet kreditmæssig løsning gennem `credentials` Som alle andre. Denne automatisk-mulig- med-partner regel er forskellig fra update- automation- opdaget addons (Afgørelse 10), som tilføjes hard- off."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Enabled by this:** The allow list uses the broad wildcard `Bash(*)` without maintaining narrow path lists. The single source of truth for writable paths is `sandbox.filesystem.allowWrite` in [sandbox.md](sandbox.md)."
msgstr "**Aktiveret af dette:** Tilladelseslisten bruger det brede wildcard `Bash(*)` uden at opretholde smalle kanallister. Den eneste kilde til sandhed for skriftbare stier er `sandbox.filesystem.allowWrite` til [sandbox.md](sandbox.md)."

