msgid "**Fail-closed on drift:** A tool contract whose hash no longer matches its pinned `schema_sha256` refuses to start."
msgstr "**Fejl - lukket ved drift:** En værktøjskontrakt, hvis hash ikke længere passer til dens fastspændt `schema_sha256` nægter at starte."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Fails gracefully** with an optional debug message if the Git repository is unreachable."
msgstr "**Fejler nådigt** med en valgfri fejlretningsmeddelelse, hvis Git-lageret ikke kan nås."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Failure Notification**"
msgstr "**Fejlmeddelelse**"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Failure Notification**   Triggers service on failure."
msgstr "**Fejlmeddelelse** Triggers service på fiasko."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Failure Notification:** Integrated with ``sys-ctl-alm-compose`` for alerting on failures."
msgstr "**Fejlmeddelelse:** Integreret med ``sys-ctl-alm-compose`` for at advare om svigt."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Failure Notification:** Integrated with `sys-ctl-alm-compose` for alerting on failures."
msgstr "**Fejlmeddelelse:** Integreret med `sys-ctl-alm-compose` for at advare om svigt."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Failure Notifications:** Leverages **sys-ctl-alm-telegram** to push alerts when the script exits with an error."
msgstr "**Fejlmeddelelser:** Gennemsnit **sys-ctl-alm-telegram** at skubbe advarsler, når scriptet forlader med en fejl."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Fast Access**: Automatic cache management ensures lightning-fast load times."
msgstr "**Hurtig adgang**: Automatisk cache management sikrer lys- hurtig belastning gange."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Faster gates.** Per-host setup runs once per host instead of once per application, a role's volumes are answered from its own file instead of a whole-tree build, the Keycloak RBAC root group resolves once rather than once per app, the Playwright fixture copy the tree copy already made is dropped, logout helpers wait for a control instead of sleeping, and the OIDC login helper stops waiting out probes that cannot match. Onion timeouts scale by tor flavor instead of a flat multiplier, and every Playwright timeout has one source."
msgstr "**Hurtigere porte.** Per- host setup kører én gang pr. vært i stedet for én gang pr. program, en rolles mængder besvares fra sin egen fil i stedet for en heltræ build, Keycloak RBAC root gruppe løser én gang i stedet for én gang pr. app, Playwright stativ kopiere træet kopi allerede lavet er droppet, logout hjælpere venter på en kontrol i stedet for søvn, og OIDC login hjælper stopper venter prober, der ikke kan matche. Løg timeouts skala af tor smag i stedet for en flad multiplikator, og hver Playwright timeout har en kilde."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Feature:** Describe a capability."
msgstr "**Anledning:** Beskriv en evne."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Features:**"
msgstr "**Funktioner:**"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Federated Chess Matches:** Challenge and play with others across the Fediverse."
msgstr "**Federated Chess Matches:** Udfordre og lege med andre på tværs af Fediverse."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Federated Communication:** Designed to operate within a federated network, enabling seamless sharing and interconnection with other PeerTube instances."
msgstr "**Federated Communication:** Designet til at operere inden for et føderalt netværk, der muliggør problemfri deling og sammenkobling med andre PeerTube tilfælde."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Federated Social Network:** Connects with other BookWyrm instances and ActivityPub platforms."
msgstr "**Federated Social Network:** Forbinder med andre BookWyrm instanser og ActivityPub platforme."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Federated User Lookup:** Invitee search resolves through the Keycloak admin Web API, so any user federated from OpenLDAP into Keycloak becomes findable inside OpenTalk."
msgstr "**Federated User Lookup:** Invitee søgning løser gennem Keycloak admin Web API, så enhver bruger federated fra OpenLDAP til Keycloak bliver findable inde OpenTalk."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Federation Ready:** The rendered ``socialhome.toml`` publishes the instance’s external URL, which is what QR pairing hands to peer households."
msgstr "**Føderation klar:** Den afleverede ``socialhome.toml`` publicerer instansens eksterne URL, som er, hvad QR parrede hænder til peer husstande."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Federation Ready:** The rendered `socialhome.toml` publishes the instance's external URL, which is what QR pairing hands to peer households."
msgstr "**Føderation klar:** Den afleverede `socialhome.toml` publicerer instansens eksterne URL, som er, hvad QR parrede hænder til peer husstande."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Fediverse & ActivityPub Support** 🌐 Seamlessly integrate Mastodon, Peertube, Matrix and other ActivityPub apps out of the box."
msgstr "**Fevarious & ActivityPub Support** 🌐 Seamless integrate Mastodon, Peertube, Matrix og andre ActivityPub apps ud af boksen."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Fediwall** is a self-hosted *media wall* for the Fediverse: it follows hashtags or accounts on Mastodon-compatible servers and shows the most recent public posts in a screen-filling, self-updating masonry grid."
msgstr "**Fediwall** er en selv-hosted *medievæg* for Fevarious: det følger hashtags eller konti på Mastodon- kompatible servere og viser de seneste offentlige indlæg i en screen- påfyldning, selvopdaterende murværk gitter."

msgid "**Fewer “mysterious” errors:** Path, working-directory, and virtualenv issues that previously caused random CI or local failures are fixed."
msgstr ""

# libretranslate
msgid "**File creation via shell heredoc is FORBIDDEN. ⛔** You MUST NOT use `cat > file <<EOF … EOF` or any variant (`tee > file <<EOF`, `printf \"…\" > file`, `echo \"…\" > file` for multi-line content) to create or overwrite files. Use the **Write tool**. For editing an existing file, use **Edit**, not `sed -i`/`awk -i`. Reason: Write/Edit land structured in the transcript and diff; heredoc + redirect shapes also fall out of the auto-allow heuristic and drop into ask."
msgstr "**Filoprettelse via shell heredoc er FORBIDDEN. ⛔** De må ikke bruge `cat > file <<EOF … EOF` eller en variant (`tee > file <<EOF`, `printf \"…\" > file`, `echo \"…\" > file` for flerlinjens indhold) at oprette eller overskrive filer. Brug **Skriv værktøj**. Ved redigering af en eksisterende fil, skal du bruge **Redigér**, ikke `sed -i`/`awk -i`. Årsag: Skriv / Redigér jord struktureret i udskrift og diffs; heredoc + omdirigere figurer også falde ud af auto-tillade heuristisk og falde i spørge."

# libretranslate
msgid "**File-based model list:** The model list is mounted as a read-only config file, with database-stored model entries turned off."
msgstr "**Filebaseret modelliste:** Modellisten er monteret som en read- only config fil, med database- lagrede modelindgange slået fra."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Filter by host**: ``journalctl -u NGINX -f | grep \"{{ inventory_hostname }}\"``"
msgstr "**Filtrér efter vært**: ``journalctl -u NGINX -f | grep \"{{ inventory_hostname }}\"``"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Filter by host**: `journalctl -u NGINX -f | grep \"{{ inventory_hostname }}\"`"
