# libretranslate
msgid "**Queue clock.** GitHub cancels a job that sat queued for ``INFINITO_CI_QUEUE_HOURS``. With ``INFINITO_CI_CONCURRENCY`` runners free and every job assumed to burn its full ``timeout-minutes``, a chunk drains in waves, and the last wave that still starts inside the queue window is ``floor(queue_hours / job_timeout)``. A chunk therefore holds at most ``concurrency * waves`` jobs. Assuming every job runs to its timeout is deliberately pessimistic -- no job can outlast it -- so the drain estimate can only overshoot, never undershoot."
msgstr "**Kvæleur.** GitHub annullerer et job, der sad i kø for ``INFINITO_CI_QUEUE_HOURS``. Med ``INFINITO_CI_CONCURRENCY`` Løbere gratis og alle job antages at brænde sin fulde ``timeout-minutes``, En klump dræner i bølger, og den sidste bølge, der stadig starter inde i køens vindue, er ``floor(queue_hours / job_timeout)``. Et stykke holder derfor højst ``concurrency * waves`` job. Hvis hvert job løber til sin timeout er bevidst pessimistisk -- intet job kan overleve det -- så afløbet skøn kan kun overskyde, aldrig underskyde."

