msgid "**Restore verified against real dumps.** The *recover* CLI replays a generation's database and cluster dumps, reads the generation's own layout instead of guessing it, and places each dump by the engine the backup observed rather than by name alone. The *svc-bkp-volume-2-local* drill now empties every volume it claims to test, fails on a database that was never dumped, and stops the backup timers before it goes destructive. Baudolo is pinned per host, its contract read from baudolo itself."
msgstr "**Gendan bekræftet mod rigtige lossepladser.** Den *inddrive* CLI genspiller en generations database og klynge dumps, læser generationens eget layout i stedet for at gætte det, og placerer hver dumpning ved motoren backup observeret snarere end ved navn alene. Den *svc-bkp-volume-2-local* bore nu tømmer hver volumen, det hævder at teste, mislykkes på en database, der aldrig blev dumpet, og stopper backup timere, før det går destruktivt. Baudolo er fastspændt per vært, dens kontrakt læses fra baudolo selv."

