# libretranslate
msgid "**Reverse-proxy trust:** Renders a ``configuration.yaml`` with ``default_config``, ``use_x_forwarded_for``, and the project-wide trusted-proxy CIDRs listed in ``trusted_proxies``. In swarm the hub joins the proxy’s own overlay, so the forwarded request arrives from that network rather than from the hub’s, and trusting only the hub’s subnet makes Home Assistant answer every proxied request with HTTP 400."
msgstr "**Reverse- proxy- tillid:** Renders a ``configuration.yaml`` med ``default_config``, ``use_x_forwarded_for``, og de projektvide trusted-proxy CIDR er anført i ``trusted_proxies``. I sværm hub slutter sig til proxyens egen overlay, så den videresendte anmodning ankommer fra dette netværk snarere end fra hubben, og tillid kun hubs subnet gør Home Assistant besvare hver proxyed anmodning med HTTP 400."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Reverse-proxy trust:** Renders a `configuration.yaml` with `default_config`, `use_x_forwarded_for`, and the project-wide trusted-proxy CIDRs listed in `trusted_proxies`. In swarm the hub joins the proxy's own overlay, so the forwarded request arrives from that network rather than from the hub's, and trusting only the hub's subnet makes Home Assistant answer every proxied request with HTTP 400."
msgstr "**Reverse- proxy- tillid:** Renders a `configuration.yaml` med `default_config`, `use_x_forwarded_for`, og de projektvide trusted-proxy CIDR er anført i `trusted_proxies`. I sværm hub slutter sig til proxyens egen overlay, så den videresendte anmodning ankommer fra dette netværk snarere end fra hubben, og tillid kun hubs subnet gør Home Assistant besvare hver proxyed anmodning med HTTP 400."

