# libretranslate
msgid "**SSO authentication:** Access is protected by Keycloak via oauth2-proxy."
msgstr "**SSO-godkendelse:** Adgang er beskyttet af Keycloak via oauth2- Proxy."

# libretranslate
msgid "**SSO flavor is `oauth2`** (oauth2-proxy sidecar → Keycloak), NOT native OIDC — because Checkmk Raw has no OIDC. The oauth2-proxy authenticates against Keycloak and passes `X-Remote-User`; Checkmk's site Apache trusts it via `auth_by_http_header`. This mirrors [`web-app-openproject`](../../roles/web-app-openproject/)'s header-SSO bridge (`OPENPROJECT_AUTH__SOURCE__SSO_HEADER` + LDAP-gated header trust)."
msgstr "**SSO smag er `oauth2`** (oauth2-proxy sidevogn → Keycloak), IKKE indfødte OIDC - fordi Checkmk Raw ikke har nogen OIDC. Den oauth2-proxy autentificerer mod Keycloak og passerer `X-Remote-User`; Checkmk websted Apache stoler på det via `auth_by_http_header`. Dette spejl [`web-app-openproject`](../../roles/web-app-openproject/)Hoved- SSO bro (`OPENPROJECT_AUTH__SOURCE__SSO_HEADER` + LDAP-gated header trust)."

# libretranslate
msgid "**SSO round-trip test:** ``test-oidc-login.js`` drives ``/sso/key/generate`` through the Keycloak login form and asserts the UI no longer falls back to its own password gate."
msgstr "**SSO-rundkørselsprøvning:** ``test-oidc-login.js`` Drivaksler ``/sso/key/generate`` gennem Keycloak login form og hævder, at UI ikke længere falder tilbage til sin egen adgangskode gate."

# libretranslate
msgid "**SSO round-trip test:** `test-oidc-login.js` drives `/sso/key/generate` through the Keycloak login form and asserts the UI no longer falls back to its own password gate."
