# libretranslate
msgid "**[Hermes Agent](https://hermes-agent.nousresearch.com/)** (Nous Research, MIT). Self-hostable with `local`, `Docker`, `SSH`, `Singularity`, `Modal` backends plus container hardening. Ships an official web dashboard with **self-hosted OIDC** auth (fits the platform SSO), delegates work through **isolated subagents**, has persistent memory, scheduling, vision web browsing, and MCP support (**client since v0.2.0, server since v0.6.0**). Deployed as `web-app-hermes`."
msgstr "**[Hermes Agent](https://hermes-agent.nousresearch.com/)** (Nous Research, MIT)Self-hostable med `local`, `Docker`, `SSH`, `Singularity`, `Modal` bagende plus container hærdning. Skibe et officielt web instrumentbræt med **selvhostede OIDC** auth (passer til platformen SSO), delegerede arbejder gennem **isolerede substoffer**, har vedvarende hukommelse, planlægning, vision web browsing, og MCP støtte (**klient siden v0.2.0, server siden v0.6.0**). Anvendt som `web-app-hermes`."

# libretranslate
msgid "**[OpenClaw](https://openclaw.ai/)** (open-source, npm/pnpm). Built-in Gateway web dashboard (default port `18789`) plus CLI/TUI, browser control, filesystem sandbox, persistent memory, skills/plugins, and native MCP (`@modelcontextprotocol/sdk`, both client and server). Deployed as `web-app-openclaw`."
msgstr "**[OpenClaw](https://openclaw.ai/)** (open- source, npm / pnpm). Bygge- i Gateway web instrumentbræt (standard port `18789`) plus CLI / TUI, browser kontrol, filsystem sandkasse, vedvarende hukommelse, færdigheder / plugins, og indfødte MCP (`@modelcontextprotocol/sdk`, både klient og server). Anvendt som `web-app-openclaw`."

# libretranslate
msgid "**`--full-cycle` (async update pass).** When set (or `full_cycle=true` on `make compose-deploy`), the wrapper runs each round's deploy TWICE: first the regular sync pass, then immediately a second pass with `-e ASYNC_ENABLED=true` overriding the host_var, against the SAME variant's folder, BEFORE moving to the next round. The two passes are therefore always co-located on the same host state; the async pass never accidentally targets a host that a previous round's variant left behind."
msgstr "**`--full-cycle` (async update pass).** Når sat (eller `full_cycle=true` om `make compose-deploy`), wrapper kører hver runde 's implementering TWICE: først den regelmæssige sync pass, derefter straks en anden pass med `-e ASYNC_ENABLED=true` Domstolen besvarede de forelagte spørgsmål således: host_var, mod Same variantens mappe, før du går videre til næste runde. De to pas er derfor altid co-placeret på samme værtsstat; async pass aldrig uheld mål en vært, at en tidligere rundes variant efterladt."

