# libretranslate
msgid "**`no_remote_surface` (24):** `svc-ai-ollama`, `svc-ai-robot`, `web-app-chess`, `web-app-dashboard`, `web-app-docs`, `web-app-fediwall`, `web-app-hugo`, `web-app-littlejs`, `web-app-mig`, `web-app-mini-qr`, `web-app-navigator`, `web-app-roulette-wheel`, `web-opt-rdr-domains`, `web-opt-rdr-www`, `web-svc-asset`, `web-svc-cdn`, `web-svc-coturn`, `web-svc-css`, `web-svc-file`, `web-svc-html`, `web-svc-legal`, `web-svc-logout`, `web-svc-mirror`, `web-svc-simpleicons`. These roles have no independently useful authenticated remote action contract at the pinned implementation. Static published content MAY later be consumed through one owning application's bounded `resource_readonly` adapter, but a new MCP sidecar that merely reimplements a static site's behavior does not count as integration. Model tool calling in Ollama does not by itself make Ollama an MCP client or server."
msgstr "**`no_remote_surface` (24):** `svc-ai-ollama`, `svc-ai-robot`, `web-app-chess`, `web-app-dashboard`, `web-app-docs`, `web-app-fediwall`, `web-app-hugo`, `web-app-littlejs`, `web-app-mig`, `web-app-mini-qr`, `web-app-navigator`, `web-app-roulette-wheel`, `web-opt-rdr-domains`, `web-opt-rdr-www`, `web-svc-asset`, `web-svc-cdn`, `web-svc-coturn`, `web-svc-css`, `web-svc-file`, `web-svc-html`, `web-svc-legal`, `web-svc-logout`, `web-svc-mirror`, `web-svc-simpleicons`. Disse roller har ingen uafhængigt nyttige autentificerede fjernbetjening kontrakt på fastlåst implementering. Statisk offentliggjort indhold MAJ senere forbruges gennem en ejer ansøgning er afgrænset `resource_readonly` adapter, men en ny MCP sidevogn, der blot reimplementerer et statisk site adfærd tæller ikke som integration. Model værktøj kalder i Ollama gør ikke i sig selv Ollama en MCP-klient eller server."

# libretranslate
msgid "**`privileged_control_plane` (25):** `svc-bkp-local-2-device`, `svc-bkp-nfs-2-local`, `svc-bkp-remote-2-local`, `svc-bkp-secrets-2-local`, `svc-bkp-volume-2-local`, `svc-dns-unbound`, `svc-net-firewall`, `svc-net-tor`, `svc-net-wireguard-core`, `svc-net-wireguard-firewalled`, `svc-net-wireguard-plain`, `svc-opt-keyboard-color`, `svc-opt-ssd-hdd`, `svc-opt-swapfile`, `svc-prx-openresty`, `svc-registry-cache`, `svc-registry-docker`, `svc-runner`, `svc-storage-nfs-client`, `svc-storage-nfs-server`, `svc-swarm-manager`, `svc-swarm-node`, `svc-virt-kata`, `update`, `web-app-openbao`. These roles can recover secrets, alter routing or host state, run code, change deployment state, or reach storage/control-plane sockets; they require a separate audited operations gateway and human approval rather than general-purpose application MCP."
msgstr "**`privileged_control_plane` (25):** `svc-bkp-local-2-device`, `svc-bkp-nfs-2-local`, `svc-bkp-remote-2-local`, `svc-bkp-secrets-2-local`, `svc-bkp-volume-2-local`, `svc-dns-unbound`, `svc-net-firewall`, `svc-net-tor`, `svc-net-wireguard-core`, `svc-net-wireguard-firewalled`, `svc-net-wireguard-plain`, `svc-opt-keyboard-color`, `svc-opt-ssd-hdd`, `svc-opt-swapfile`, `svc-prx-openresty`, `svc-registry-cache`, `svc-registry-docker`, `svc-runner`, `svc-storage-nfs-client`, `svc-storage-nfs-server`, `svc-swarm-manager`, `svc-swarm-node`, `svc-virt-kata`, `update`, `web-app-openbao`. Disse roller kan gendanne hemmeligheder, ændre routing eller værtsstat, køre kode, ændre deployering stat, eller nå opbevaring / kontrol-plane sockets; de kræver en separat reviderede operationer gateway og menneskelig godkendelse snarere end generelle formål ansøgning MCP."

