# libretranslate
msgid "A failing pre-state snapshot aborts the deploy (no `suppress_flush`): no update proceeds without a successful backup of the state it is about to change. `svc-bkp-local-2-device` is never started at deploy time (no device present); it stays plug-triggered via its `.mount` unit."
msgstr "Et svigtende napshot afbryder deployeringen (ng `suppress_flush`): ingen opdatering overskud uden en vellykket backup af den tilstand, det er ved at ændre. `svc-bkp-local-2-device` er aldrig startet på implementeringstidspunktet (ingen anordning til stede); det forbliver plug- udløst via sin `.mount` enhed."

