# libretranslate
msgid "A role declares `meta/mcp.yml` when it actually serves or consumes MCP. The file is a capability descriptor, not a service entry: no single role provides MCP, so the service registry cannot pair provider and consumer, and the `mcp_consumer` flag in `meta/services.yml` does it instead. Vocabulary lives in [`utils/roles/applications/mcp.py`](../../../../../utils/roles/applications/mcp.py); the hard lint is [`test_mcp_schema.py`](../../../../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_schema.py)."
msgstr "En rolle erklærer `meta/mcp.yml` når det rent faktisk tjener eller forbruger MCP. Filen er en kapacitetsdeskriptor, ikke en tjenesteindgang: ingen enkelt rolle giver MCP, så serviceregistret kan ikke parre udbyder og forbruger, og `mcp_consumer` flag i `meta/services.yml` Gør det i stedet. Ordforråd [`utils/roles/applications/mcp.py`](../../../../../utils/roles/applications/mcp.py); den hårde flint er [`test_mcp_schema.py`](../../../../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_schema.py)."

