# libretranslate
msgid "Agent token restricted by Zammad groups; redact sensitive articles; no ticket, article, user, role, or configuration mutation"
msgstr "Agent token begrænset af Zammad grupper; redigerede følsomme artikler; ingen billet, artikel, bruger, rolle, eller konfiguration mutation"

# libretranslate
msgid "Agent-specific changes limited to `AGENTS.md` or `docs/agents/*`"
msgstr "Agent- specifikke ændringer begrænset til `AGENTS.md` eller `docs/agents/*`"

# libretranslate
msgid "Agents MUST edit role-local meta sources, not recreate repository-wide generated application dictionaries."
msgstr "Agenter SKAL redigere role- lokale meta kilder, ikke genskabe repository- bred genererede program ordbøger."

# libretranslate
msgid "Agents MUST operate in **`/caveman lite`** mode by default. Lite keeps grammar and readability intact while still reducing output size."
msgstr "Agenter SKAL operere i **`/caveman lite`** tilstand som standard. Lite holder grammatik og læsbarhed intakt, mens stadig reducere output størrelse."

# libretranslate
msgid "Agents MUST read deploy logs by extracting the field they need (`msg`, `stderr`, a probe result). Printing a raw task block, `argv` list, or environment dump is **FORBIDDEN ⛔**, including via a line-range `sed`/`head` over one."
msgstr "Agenter SKAL læse deployere logfiler ved at udtrække det felt, de har brug for (`msg`, `stderr`, et sonderesultat). Udskrivning af en rå opgaveblok, `argv` liste, eller miljø dump er **FORBIDEN ⛔**, herunder via et line- range `sed`/`head` Over en."

# libretranslate
msgid "Agents MUST write all transient files (downloaded logs, intermediate output, scratch artefacts) to `/tmp`. The set of writable paths is defined by `sandbox.filesystem.allowWrite` in [`.claude/settings.json`](.claude/settings.json); of those entries, `/tmp` is the designated path for agent scratch data. Other entries are reserved for their respective tooling and MUST NOT be repurposed for agent temp data. The repository working tree MUST NOT hold transient files."
msgstr "Agenter SKAL skrive alle forbigående filer (downloadede logfiler, mellemliggende output, ridseartefakter) til `/tmp`. Sættet af skriftlige stier er defineret af `sandbox.filesystem.allowWrite` til [`.claude/settings.json`](.claude/settings.json); af disse angivelser `/tmp` er den udpegede sti for agent ridse data. Andre indgange er reserveret til deres respektive værktøjer og må ikke genbruges til agent temp data. Lageret arbejder træ SKAL IKKE holde forbigående filer."

# libretranslate
msgid "Agents plugin"
msgstr "Comment"

# libretranslate
msgid "Agents whose runtime does not consult `.claude/settings.json` MUST still enforce the above procedurally: check each command against these rules before execution."
msgstr "Agenter, hvis driftstid ikke konsulterer `.claude/settings.json` SKAL stadig håndhæve ovenstående procedure: Kontrollér hver kommando mod disse regler før udførelse."

# libretranslate
msgid "Aggregate handlers (one helper call resolves several keys at once) MUST take the singular topic name without a key suffix. Example: `infinito/inventory.py` resolves `INFINITO_INVENTORY_DIR`, `INFINITO_INVENTORY_FILE`, and `INFINITO_INVENTORY_HOST_VARS_FILE` from one `scripts/inventory/resolve.sh` invocation."
msgstr "Aggregerede håndterende virksomheder (et helperopkald løser flere nøgler på én gang) SKAL tage det ental emne navn uden en nøgle suffiks. Eksempel: `infinito/inventory.py` resolves `INFINITO_INVENTORY_DIR`, `INFINITO_INVENTORY_FILE`, og `INFINITO_INVENTORY_HOST_VARS_FILE` fra en `scripts/inventory/resolve.sh` Invacation."

# libretranslate
msgid "Aggregate installers (one helper covers a tightly coupled command pair) take the topic name without a key suffix. Example: `ansible/commands.py` installs both `ansible-playbook` and `ansible-galaxy` via the same system-package candidates."
msgstr "Aggregerede installatører (En hjælper dækker et tæt koblet kommandopar) tage emnet navn uden en nøgle suffiks. Eksempel: `ansible/commands.py` installerer begge `ansible-playbook` og `ansible-galaxy` via det samme system-pakke kandidater."

# libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Aggregate one or more inventory bundles into a single `apps` list and run a deploy against the resulting application set. Bundles live under `inventories/bundles/{servers,workstations}/<name>/inventory.yml` and declare the role groups they activate."
msgstr "Aggregér en eller flere lagerbundter til en enkelt `apps` liste over og køre en implementering mod det resulterende programsæt. Bundler lever under `inventories/bundles/{servers,workstations}/<name>/inventory.yml` og erklære de rollegrupper, de aktiverer."

# libretranslate
msgid "Aggregate per-consumer service extensions across all running roles."
msgstr "Aggregerede per- forbruger service udvidelser på tværs af alle kørende roller."

# libretranslate
msgid "Aggregate the per-mode states into the ``total`` column: green only when every mode that actually ran is green. A mode the role has no job for is N/A (a host driver never deploys in swarm) and does NOT fail the total; ``parse_role_statuses`` only lists roles with at least one deploy job, so there is always a present mode to judge."
msgstr "Aggregere per- mode stater ind i ``total`` kolonne: grøn kun, når hver tilstand, der faktisk kørte er grøn. En tilstand som rollen ikke har noget job for er N / A (en vært driver aldrig anvender i sværm) og svigter IKKE det samlede antal ``parse_role_statuses`` kun lister roller med mindst ét deployeringsjob, så der er altid en nuværende tilstand at dømme."

# libretranslate
msgid "Aggregates multiple GNOME-related roles into one cohesive setup."
msgstr "Aggregerer flere GNOME- relaterede roller i én sammenhængende opsætning."

# libretranslate
msgid "Aggregates the role groups from one or more [inventories/bundles/](../../../inventories/bundles/) entries into `apps` and runs the reinstall flow. Set `full_cycle=true` for the async update pass."
msgstr "Aggregerer rollegrupperne fra en eller flere [Lagerbeholdninger / bundter /](../../../inventories/bundles/) angivelser i `apps` og kører geninstallere flow. Sæt `full_cycle=true` for async update pass."

