msgstr "Alle scripts kort `*.infinito.test` → `127.0.0.1` så lokale installationer kan nås via deres forventede værtsnavne."

# libretranslate
msgid "All services are deployed behind a reverse proxy and share a unified authentication layer where applicable. The inventory defines a single default host named 'server' and activates roles declaratively via group names."
msgstr "Alle tjenester er placeret bag en omvendt proxy og deler en samlet autentificering lag, hvor det er relevant. Opgørelsen definerer en enkelt standard vært navngivet 'server' og aktiverer roller deklarativt via gruppenavne."

# libretranslate
msgid "All services are expected to be exposed behind a reverse proxy role where applicable."
msgstr "Alle tjenester forventes at blive eksponeret bag en omvendt proxy-rolle, hvor det er relevant."

# libretranslate
msgid "All services run behind a reverse proxy and share centralized identity management. The inventory defines a single host and activates roles declaratively."
