# libretranslate
msgid "Biber is blocked by `$wgPluggableAuth_EnableAutoLogin`, which this role sets to true in `vars/main.yml`: every anonymous request is bounced straight back into the identity provider, so the verified unauthenticated landing after in-app logout that the persona contract demands can never be observed here. The path back to the generic personas is either auto-login off, or a deploy step that promotes the OIDC-provisioned administrator account to sysop."
msgstr "Biber er blokeret af `$wgPluggableAuth_EnableAutoLogin`, som denne rolle gør til virkelighed i `vars/main.yml`: hver anonym anmodning sendes direkte tilbage til identitetsudbyderen, så den verificerede ubekræftede landing efter in- app logout, at persona kontrakt krav aldrig kan overholdes her. Vejen tilbage til de generiske personas er enten auto- login off, eller et deployeringstrin, der fremmer OIDC- provied administrator konto til sysop."

