# libretranslate
msgid "Both authenticated Playwright personas are blocked while ``services.sso.enabled`` is false. The dashboard’s entire Keycloak integration is the browser-side ``oidc.js`` bundle, and ``DASHBOARD_JS_FILES`` in ``vars/main.yml`` ships that file only when SSO is enabled, so with SSO off the page renders neither a Login link nor a logout control."
msgstr "Begge godkendte Playwright personas er blokeret, mens ``services.sso.enabled`` er falsk. Dashboardet er hele Keycloak integration er browser- side ``oidc.js`` bundt og ``DASHBOARD_JS_FILES`` til ``vars/main.yml`` skibe, der kun fil, når SSO er aktiveret, så med SSO fra siden gør hverken en Login link eller en logout kontrol."

# libretranslate
msgid "Both authenticated Playwright personas are blocked while ``services.sso.enabled`` is false. Without SSO, ``files/configure-sso.sh`` skips the ``auth_by_http_header`` snippet, so the OMD site falls back to its own login form."
msgstr "Begge godkendte Playwright personas er blokeret, mens ``services.sso.enabled`` er falsk. Uden SSO, ``files/configure-sso.sh`` springer ``auth_by_http_header`` snuppet, så OMD site falder tilbage til sin egen login form."

# libretranslate
msgid "Both authenticated Playwright personas are blocked while `services.sso.enabled` is false. The dashboard's entire Keycloak integration is the browser-side `oidc.js` bundle, and `DASHBOARD_JS_FILES` in `vars/main.yml` ships that file only when SSO is enabled, so with SSO off the page renders neither a Login link nor a logout control."
msgstr "Begge godkendte Playwright personas er blokeret, mens `services.sso.enabled` er falsk. Dashboardet er hele Keycloak integration er browser- side `oidc.js` bundt og `DASHBOARD_JS_FILES` til `vars/main.yml` skibe, der kun fil, når SSO er aktiveret, så med SSO fra siden gør hverken en Login link eller en logout kontrol."

# libretranslate
msgid "Both authenticated Playwright personas are blocked while `services.sso.enabled` is false. Without SSO, `files/configure-sso.sh` skips the `auth_by_http_header` snippet, so the OMD site falls back to its own login form."
msgstr "Begge godkendte Playwright personas er blokeret, mens `services.sso.enabled` er falsk. Uden SSO, `files/configure-sso.sh` springer `auth_by_http_header` snuppet, så OMD site falder tilbage til sin egen login form."

