# libretranslate
msgid "Both bring their own agent logic and internal sandboxing. This requirement adds the **isolation and scaling substrate** around them plus a **Flowise supervisor** for cross-agent coordination. Model routing is the [031](031-llm-gateway-model-backends.md) gateway; the MCP tool contract is [025](025-mcp-role-integration.md)."
msgstr "Begge bringer deres egen agent logik og intern sandboksning. Dette krav tilføjer **isolations- og skaleringssubstrat** omkring dem plus en **Flowise Projektleder** for koordinering på tværs af agenter. Model routing er [031](031-llm-gateway-model-backends.md) gateway; MCP-værktøjskontrakten er [025](025-mcp-role-integration.md)."

