# libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Cross-service probes (biber denied at prometheus, biber denied at matomo, dashboard tile reachability) are NOT part of the per-role biber persona. They live in the provider's own spec (`web-app-{prometheus,matomo,dashboard}/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`), parameterised once over the provider's `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest. For the dashboard, the parameterised scenario delegates to `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/dashboard-card-flow.js::runDashboardCardScenario(page, context, target)`, which owns the tile visibility / iframe-embed / \"Tab\" pop-out assertions in one SPOT."
msgstr "Krydstogtprober (biber nægtet på prometheus, biber nægtet på matomo, dashboard flise adgang) er IKKE en del af perrollebiber persona. De bor i udbyderens eget spec (`web-app-{prometheus,matomo,dashboard}/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`), parameterised once over the providers `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` Åbenbart. For instrumentbrættet uddelegerer parameterscenariet til `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/dashboard-card-flow.js::runDashboardCardScenario(page, context, target)`, som ejer flisesigtbarhed / iframemed / \"Tab\" pop- out påstande i en SPOT."

# libretranslate
msgid "Cross-service probes are NOT part of the per-role administrator persona. Dashboard tile reachability is owned by `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`, which delegates the per-target body to the `runDashboardCardScenario` helper in `dashboard-card-flow.js` (tile visible → click loads in `#main iframe` → header \"Tab\" button pops the embed into a fresh browser tab). That helper is the SPOT for dashboard-tile mechanics; consumer specs MUST NOT reimplement any of those assertions. Prometheus admin-reach and scrape parity are owned by `web-app-prometheus/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Matomo admin-reach and tracker presence are owned by `web-app-matomo/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Each provider parameterises the assertion over its `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest."
msgstr "Cross- service prober er IKKE en del af perrolleadministrator persona. Dashboard flise adgang er ejet af `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`, som uddelegerer per-target organ til `runDashboardCardScenario` medhjælper `dashboard-card-flow.js` (flise synlig → klik på belastninger i `#main iframe` → header \"Tab\" knappen popper indlejret i en frisk browser fane). Den hjælper er SPOT for dashboard- tille mekanik; forbruger specs SKAL IKKE genimplementere nogen af disse påstande. Prometheus admin- reach og skrabe paritet ejes af `web-app-prometheus/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Matomo admin- reach og tracker tilstedeværelse er ejet af `web-app-matomo/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Hver udbyder parameterises påstanden over sin `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` Åbenbart."

# libretranslate
msgid "Cross-service surface assertions (dashboard tile reachability, prometheus admin-reach and scrape parity, matomo admin-reach and tracker presence, biber-denied-at-prometheus, biber-denied-at-matomo) are owned by the provider's own spec. Each provider parameterises the assertion over its `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest, rendered via `lookup('roles_with_service', '<svc>')`. Consumer roles' personas MUST NOT duplicate these probes."
msgstr "Angivelse af overflade på tværs af serviceområder (dashboard flise evne, prometheus admin- reach and scrape paritet, matomo admin- reach and tracker tilstedeværelse, biber- denied-prometheus, biber- denied-at- matomo) er ejet af udbyderens egen spec. Hver udbyder parameterises påstanden over sin `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest, afgivet via `lookup('roles_with_service', '<svc>')`. Forbrugerrollernes personer må ikke duplikere disse sonder."

