# libretranslate
msgid "Deploys one chunk of the sweep. Every matrix row is a single `role#variant` carrying the deploy mode, onion state, distro and filesystem the rotation assigned it: `swarm` rows get a simulated 3-node DinD cluster with an NFS server plus a drain/reschedule state-survival assertion, `compose` and `host` rows run the single-node drill. When `whitelist` is empty, the discover job derives one from the branch's diff vs `origin/main`; see the \"Diff-driven app selection\" subsection in [pipeline.md](../../../artefact/git/pipeline.md). A row marked 📖 -- the role's smallest variant, see [instructions.md](instructions.md) -- replays the role README's `### Production` block on the same runner once the deploy has released it."
msgstr "Deploys et stykke af gennemsøgningen. Hver matrix række er en enkelt `role#variant` bærer deployeringstilstand, løg tilstand, distro og filsystem rotation tildelt det: `swarm` rækker får en simuleret 3-node DinD klynge med en NFS server plus en dræn- / genstart state- overlevelse påstand, `compose` og `host` rækkerne kører en- node boret. Hvornår `whitelist` er tom, opdagelsen job stammer en fra filialens diffs vs `origin/main`; se \"Valg af diff- drevet app\" Undersektion i [pipeline.md](../../../artefact/git/pipeline.md). En række markeret 📖 -- rollens mindste variant, se [instructions.md](instructions.md) -- genoptager rollen som README 's `### Production` blokere på samme løber, når deployeringen har frigivet det."

