# libretranslate
msgid "Derived from the ca_trust_paths SPOT plus SOFTWARE_NAME (group_vars); consumed by scripts/system/tls/trust/*.sh so the path never lives in shell literals. SOFTWARE_NAME is line-parsed instead of yaml-loaded: the env generator runs on the bare bootstrap python before any dependency (PyYAML) is installed."
msgstr "Afledt af ca_trust_paths SPOT plus SOFTWARE_NAME (group_vars); forbruges af scripts/system/tls/trust/*Så vejen aldrig lever i skallitteraler. SOFTWARE_NAME er line- fortolket i stedet for yaml- loaded: env generatoren kører på bare bootstrap python før nogen afhængighed (PyYAML) er installeret."

# libretranslate
msgid "Derived from the host's default-route interface MTU so the compose bridge never exceeds the path MTU (TLS handshakes silently drop fragments otherwise). When no default route is readable (agent sandboxes run in a network namespace whose /proc/net/route is empty, while /sys/class/net still shows the host NICs), falls back to the minimum MTU across UP physical interfaces; only if that finds nothing either does the static default from ``default.env`` apply."
msgstr "Afledt fra værtens default- route interface MTU så komponér broen aldrig overstiger stien MTU (TLS håndtryk, der ellers falder i stilhed). Når ingen standardrute er læsbar (agent sandkasser kører i et netværk navnerum, hvis / proc / net / route er tom, mens / sys / klasse / net stadig viser værten NIC 'er), falder tilbage til minimum MTU på tværs af UP fysiske grænseflader; kun hvis det finder intet enten gør den statiske standard fra ``default.env`` ansøge."

# libretranslate
msgid "Derived from the paths SPOT (utils.paths, backed by group_vars/all/05_paths.yml). This uniform layout is what lets a recovery target a host by name alone: every host restores into these same paths."
msgstr "Afledt fra stierne SPOT (utils.paths, støttet af group_vars/all/05_paths.yml). Denne ensartede layout er, hvad der lader en inddrivelse mål en vært ved navn alene: hver vært genopretter i disse samme stier."

