# libretranslate
msgid "Designed for Arch Linux systems, this role leverages the ``pacman`` module to install Git. It uses a fact (``run_once_dev_git``) to control task execution, ensuring that the Git installation is performed only once per run."
msgstr "Designet til Arch Linux-systemer, denne rolle læsser ``pacman`` modul til at installere Git. Det bruger en kendsgerning (``run_once_dev_git``) at kontrollere udførelsen af opgaver, idet det sikres, at Git-installationen kun udføres én gang pr. kørsel."

# libretranslate
msgid "Designed for Arch Linux systems, this role leverages the `pacman` module to install Git. It uses a fact (`run_once_dev_git`) to control task execution, ensuring that the Git installation is performed only once per run."
