#, python-brace-format
msgid "Documents a `services.matomo.track: false` opt-out in `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml`. The role keeps `services.matomo.{enabled,shared}: true` (so the role-wiring contract stays satisfied) but `roles_with_service('matomo')` drops it from `MATOMO_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` and the matomo tracker e2e contract. Reserved for static-file (autoindex) and 301-redirect vhosts that carry no user-facing HTML page worth a `_paq` tracker. The marker accompanies the `track:` data flag the lookup honors."
msgstr "Dokumenter a `services.matomo.track: false` Opt- out in `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml`. Rollen holder `services.matomo.{enabled,shared}: true` (så role- ledninger kontrakt forbliver tilfreds) men `roles_with_service('matomo')` falder det fra `MATOMO_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` og matomo tracker e2e kontrakt. Reserveret til statisk fil (autoindeks) og 301-omdirigere vhosts, der bærer ingen bruger- vender HTML-side værd en `_paq` Tracker. Markøren ledsager `track:` data flag lookup ærer."

# libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Documents a `services.prometheus.scrape: false` opt-out in `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml`. The role keeps `services.prometheus.{enabled,shared}: true` (so the role-wiring contract stays satisfied) but `roles_with_service('prometheus')` drops it from `PROMETHEUS_TARGET_ROLES_JSON`. Reserved for 301-redirect-only vhosts that never serve a request through lua-resty-prometheus, so they emit no `app=\"<role>\"` label and have no scrape target. The marker accompanies the `scrape:` data flag the lookup honors."
msgstr "Dokumenter a `services.prometheus.scrape: false` Opt- out in `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml`. Rollen holder `services.prometheus.{enabled,shared}: true` (så role- ledninger kontrakt forbliver tilfreds) men `roles_with_service('prometheus')` falder det fra `PROMETHEUS_TARGET_ROLES_JSON`. Reserveret til 301-redirect- kun vhosts, der aldrig tjene en anmodning gennem lua- resty- prometheus, så de udsender `app=\"<role>\"` mærke og har ingen skrabe mål. Markøren ledsager `scrape:` data flag lookup ærer."

# libretranslate
msgid "Documents an `unsafe-*: true` flag in `roles/*/meta/csp.yml`. MUST be paired with a `Reason:` on the same line naming what breaks without the relaxation. `unsafe-inline` re-admits the inline execution an XSS needs and `unsafe-eval` re-admits string-to-code, so the flag has to be verified against the running app, not copied from another role."
msgstr "Dokumenter `unsafe-*: true` flag i `roles/*/meta/csp.yml`. SKAL parres med en `Reason:` på samme linje navngivning hvad bryder uden afslapning. `unsafe-inline` re- indrømmer inline udførelse en XSS behov og `unsafe-eval` re- indrømmer string- to- kode, så flaget skal verificeres mod den kørende app, ikke kopieret fra en anden rolle."

