msgstr "Hver applikationsrolle svarer til en Keycloak gruppe, hvis sti er hierarkisk:"

# libretranslate
msgid "Every apt suite exists twice, once per upstream mirror. Nexus has no group repository type for `apt` (only maven, raw, docker, yum, npm, pypi, rubygems, go and friends), so the failover lives in the frontend: a request that the primary repo answers with `502`/`503`/`504` is re-run against the `-mirror` repo, which proxies a different host. `404` deliberately does not retry, because a missing file is missing on both mirrors and apt probes for missing files often. The frontend waits at most 8 s for a primary before it re-runs the request against the mirror; the `-mirror` locations keep the global 300 s."
msgstr "Hver apt suite eksisterer to gange, en gang per opstrøms spejl. Nexus har ingen type grupperegister til `apt` (Kun maven, rå, docker, yum, npm, pypi, rubygems, go og venner), så failover lever i frontend: en anmodning om, at den primære repo svar med `502`/`503`/`504` er re-køre mod `-mirror` repo, som udtrykker en anden vært. `404` bevidst ikke prøve igen, fordi en manglende fil mangler på både spejle og apt prober for manglende filer ofte. Den frontend venter højst 8 s for en primær, før den igen kører anmodningen mod spejlet; `-mirror` steder holde den globale 300 b."

# libretranslate
msgid "Every archive file is named `<padded-semver>-<release-date>.md`, where each numeric component of the semver is zero-padded to three digits and the date is the `YYYY-MM-DD` value parsed from the original entry's header. Padded names sort lexicographically in the same order as the underlying versions, so a directory listing is already in chronological order."
msgstr "Hver arkivfil er navngivet `<padded-semver>-<release-date>.md`, hvor hver numerisk komponent i semveren er nulstillet til tre cifre, og datoen er `YYYY-MM-DD` værdi fortolket fra den oprindelige indgang header. Polstrede navne sortere leksikologisk i samme rækkefølge som de underliggende versioner, så en mappe liste er allerede i kronologisk rækkefølge."

# libretranslate
msgid "Every call returns a flat dict with the following keys. Each key MAY be overridden from inventory by setting the matching `SYSTEM_EMAIL_<KEY>` variable (uppercase, with the `SYSTEM_EMAIL_` prefix)."
msgstr "Hvert opkald returnerer en flad dict med følgende nøgler. Hver nøgle KAN tilsidesættes fra beholdningen ved at indstille matching `SYSTEM_EMAIL_<KEY>` variabel (i uppercase, med `SYSTEM_EMAIL_` prefix)."

# libretranslate
msgid "Every candidate row of the sweep, axes assigned, in global order."
msgstr "Hver kandidat række af sweep, økser tildelt, i global rækkefølge."

# libretranslate
msgid "Every cell carries both directions of one pair, row-to-column above column-to-row, because a bond is declared on the consumer's side and the two need not agree. Brightness is the bond: black for none, white for 1."
msgstr "Hver celle bærer begge retninger af et par, row- to- kolonne over column- to- række, fordi en obligation er erklæret på forbrugersiden, og de to behøver ikke at være enige. Lysstyrke er båndet: sort for ingen, hvid for 1."

# libretranslate
msgid "Every chunk of the sweep, priority blocks first."
msgstr "Hver klump af gennemsøgningen, førsteprioritet blokke først."

# libretranslate
msgid "Every client connection MUST map to exactly one provider group named `roles/<provider-application-id>/mcp`. The deployment MAY create or locate the corresponding client-local group by name after startup and then use the identifier assigned by the client API; it MUST NOT predict a generated group UUID."
msgstr "Hver klient forbindelse SKAL map til præcis én udbyder gruppe navngivet `roles/<provider-application-id>/mcp`. Implementeringen MAJ oprette eller lokalisere den tilsvarende klient- lokale gruppe ved navn efter opstart og derefter bruge den identifikator tildelt af klienten API; det SKAL IKKE forudsige en genereret gruppe UUID."

# libretranslate
msgid "Every collector is best-effort: a missing source must never abort the capture. ``INFINITO_RESCUE_DIAGNOSTICS_DIR`` and ``INFINITO_DNS53_SAMPLER_LOG`` are required and never defaulted here, so ``group_vars/all/05_paths.yml`` stays the one source. Prints one summary and ALWAYS exits 1 so a failure stays a failure."
msgstr "Hver samler er bedst-indsats: en manglende kilde må aldrig afbryde fangsten. ``INFINITO_RESCUE_DIAGNOSTICS_DIR`` og ``INFINITO_DNS53_SAMPLER_LOG`` er påkrævet og aldrig misligholdt her, så ``group_vars/all/05_paths.yml`` forbliver den eneste kilde. Udskriver et resumé og ALTID udgange 1 Så en fiasko forbliver en fiasko."

# libretranslate
msgid "Every consumer mints its own key and runs the gateway contract"
msgstr "Hver forbruger hugger sin egen nøgle og kører gateway-kontrakten"

# libretranslate
msgid "Every consumer of the legacy oauth2 / oidc service sub-trees, the **OAUTH2_PROXY_\\*** env / Jinja vars, **OAUTH2_SERVICE_ENABLED**, **OIDC_SERVICE_ENABLED**, *oauth2_proxy_cookie_secret*, *oauth2_proxy_application_id*, *ports.local.oauth2*, the dedicated oauth2-proxy provider role, or the legacy *oidc* / *oauth2* Playwright gating helper service names must migrate to the unified **sso** shape. Full plan and decisions are archived under req 21."
msgstr "Alle forbrugere af arven2 / oidc service sub- træer, **OAUTH2_PROXY_\\*** env / Jinja vars **OAUTH2_SERVICE_ENABLED**, **OIDC_SERVICE_ENABLED**, *oauth2_proxy_cookie_secret*, *oauth2_proxy_application_id*, *ports.local.oauth2*, den dedikerede oauth2-proxy udbyder rolle, eller arven *oidc* / *oauth2* Playwright gating hjælper service navne skal migrere til den forenede **sso** form. Fuld plan og beslutninger arkiveres under req 21."

# libretranslate
msgid "Every consumer speaks only the gateway `/v1`; the gateway is the single place backends are wired."
msgstr "Alle forbrugere taler kun porten `/v1`; gateway er et enkelt sted bagende er kappet."

# libretranslate
msgid "Every declared backend has a `model_list` branch"
msgstr "Hver erklæret motor har en `model_list` gren"

# libretranslate
msgid "Every declared distro id, in declaration order."
msgstr "Alle erklærede distro id, i deklarationsrækkefølge."

# libretranslate
msgid "Every deploy mode a role's primary entity may toggle. ``compose``/``swarm`` target stack roles (own container stack); ``host`` targets invokable roles that configure the host instead of shipping a stack."
msgstr "Hver deployeringstilstand en rolles primære enhed kan skifte. ``compose``/``swarm`` target stack roller (egen containerstak); ``host`` mål uovervindelige roller, der konfigurerer værten i stedet for at sende en stak."

# libretranslate
msgid "Every discovered endpoint authenticates through a header. A provider that keys its session by URL segment instead cannot scope that segment per consumer or revoke it, so it is fronted by an adapter and the segment stays between the adapter and its upstream."
msgstr "Hvert opdaget endepunkt autentificerer gennem en header. En udbyder, der taster sin session med URL-segment i stedet kan ikke se dette segment per forbruger eller tilbagekalde det, så det er fronted af en adapter og segmentet forbliver mellem adapteren og dens opstrøms."

# libretranslate
msgid "Every embodiable agent runs the admission checks"
msgstr "Hver enkelt agent kører adgangskontrollen"

# libretranslate
msgid "Every emoji used as a STRUCTURED marker across the project (complexity-matrix columns, lifecycle stages, deploy modes, boolean/state cells) is defined here exactly once, so a glyph means the same thing everywhere it appears. Emojis are unique: the module fails to import if two words share a glyph."
msgstr "Hver emoji anvendes som en STRUKTURERET markør på tværs af projektet (komplekse matrixkolonner, livscyklusstadier, deployeringstilstande, booleske / stateceller) er defineret her præcis én gang, så en glyf betyder det samme overalt det vises. Emojis er enestående: modulet importerer ikke, hvis to ord deler en glyf."

# libretranslate
msgid "Every env variable the spec reads MUST be exposed in the role's `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Names MUST match exactly."
msgstr "Hver env variabel spec læser SKAL være udsat i rollens `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Navne skal passe præcist."

# libretranslate
msgid "Every exposed provider remains a separate logical MCP server even when a common proxy implementation serves it. This preserves the mapping between `roles/<provider-application-id>/mcp`, the client connection, the upstream credential, the tool allowlist, and the audit record."
msgstr "Hver udsat udbyder forbliver en separat logisk MCP-server, selv når en fælles proxy implementering tjener det. Dette bevarer kortlægningen mellem `roles/<provider-application-id>/mcp`, klientforbindelsen, den opstrømskreditantielle, redskabslisten og revisionsposten."

# libretranslate
msgid "Every external CI trigger MUST route through one of the entry workflows. Each entry translates its event into a call to the orchestrator; the catalog of triggers and inputs lives in [workflows.md](../../tools/github/actions/workflows.md)."
msgstr "Hver ekstern CI-udløser SKAL føres gennem et af indgangsarbejdsgangene. Hver indgang oversætter sin begivenhed til et opkald til orkester; kataloget af udløsere og input lever i [workflows.md](../../tools/github/actions/workflows.md)."

# libretranslate
msgid "Every external test directory MUST contain `__init__.py` so repository-wide test structure checks keep passing."
msgstr "Hver ekstern testmappe SKAL indeholde `__init__.py` Så repository- bred test struktur kontrol bliver ved med at passere."

# libretranslate
msgid "Every failure is fixed at its root. A lint hit is resolved by deleting the offending construct, not by a `nocheck` marker, a loosened rule, or a target dropped from the gate — any suppression needs the operator's explicit approval and a stated reason."
msgstr "Enhver fiasko er rettet mod dens rod. En flint hit løses ved at slette den krænkende konstruktion, ikke ved en `nocheck` markør, en løsnet regel, eller et mål faldt fra porten - enhver undertrykkelse har brug for luftfartsforetagendets udtrykkelige godkendelse og en angivet årsag."

# libretranslate
msgid "Every failure raises AnsibleError with an actionable message."
msgstr "Hver fejl hæver AnsibleError med en aktiverbar besked."

msgid "Every file here is declared as an addon under [meta/addons/](../../meta/addons/) with `mechanism: mu_plugin` and `source: vendored`, and the addon id is the file stem. [04_mu_plugins.yml](../../tasks/04_mu_plugins.yml) loops over those declarations and copies `<addon_id>.php` into the container on every deploy; a new file therefore needs its `meta/addons/<addon_id>.yml` entry and a Playwright spec before it is installed."
msgstr ""

# libretranslate
msgid "Every handler module MUST expose the same surface so the registry can call it uniformly:"
msgstr "Hvert betjeningsmodul SKAL udsætte den samme overflade, så registret kan kalde den ensartet:"

# libretranslate
msgid "Every input the run named *title* records, keyed by input name."
msgstr "Alle indgange, der kaldes *titel* rekorder, der er præget af inputnavn."

# libretranslate
msgid "Every input the source run was dispatched with, except the selection."
msgstr "Alle input, kilden kørte blev afsendt med, undtagen udvælgelsen."

# libretranslate
msgid "Every install is best-effort and per-command: cross-distro tools are often unavailable, and ``scripts/lint/packages.sh`` skips absent ones, so a failed candidate MUST NOT break the lint bootstrap. The validators are intentionally kept out of the install stamp's required-tool set so a non-Debian environment never loops trying to install a tool it cannot. This group is installed explicitly by the ``lint-packages`` make target (an explicit group bypasses the stamp), so the commands are provisioned every run rather than only on the first all-mode install."
msgstr "Hver installation er best- indsats og per- kommando: cross-ditro værktøjer er ofte utilgængelige, og ``scripts/lint/packages.sh`` Skips fraværende dem, så en mislykket kandidat IKKE må bryde lint bootstrap. Validatorerne holdes bevidst ude af installeringsfrimærkets kravs- tool, så et ikke-Debian miljø aldrig loops forsøger at installere et værktøj, det ikke kan. Denne gruppe er installeret eksplicit af ``lint-packages`` mål (en eksplicit gruppe omgår stemplet), så kommandoerne er afsat hver kørsel snarere end kun på den første all- mode installation."

# libretranslate
msgid "Every installable package is declared exactly once, in one of two places:"
msgstr "Hver pakke, der kan installeres, deklareres præcis én gang, på et af to steder:"

# libretranslate
msgid "Every invokable role in the tested lifecycle envelope, with its upstream homepage, an introduction video, the roles it integrates with, and a one-command local install."
msgstr "Hver usårlig rolle i den testede livscyklus kuvert, med sin opstrømshjemmeside, en introduktion video, de roller, det integrerer med, og en one-kommando lokal installation."

# libretranslate
msgid "Every key MUST be the fully qualified form :func:`override_key` builds; a short form is rejected rather than guessed at, because the same short key names different credentials on different apps."
msgstr "Hver nøgle SKAL være den fuldt kvalificerede formular :func:`override_key` bygger; en kort form afvises snarere end gættet på, fordi de samme korte nøglenavne forskellige legitimationsoplysninger på forskellige apps."

# libretranslate
msgid "Every line of the file named by ``ANSIBLE_LOG_PATH`` carries ``<ts> p=<pid> u=<user> n=<name> <LEVEL>| `` in front of the message that also went to stdout. Left unstripped, that prefix defeats every line-anchored matcher a reader applies, so a reader that mixes an anchored match with an unanchored one silently sees an empty log instead of failing."
msgstr "Hver linje i filen navngivet af ``ANSIBLE_LOG_PATH`` cars ``<ts> p=<pid> u=<user> n=<name> <LEVEL>| `` foran beskeden, der også gik til stdout. Venstre ubestridt, at præfikset besejrer hver linje-forankret matcher en læser gælder, så en læser, der blander en forankret kamp med en uforankret én lydløst ser en tom log i stedet for at svigte."

# libretranslate
msgid "Every literal a rendered segment can start with, so any of them ends the value before it."
msgstr "Hver bogstavelig en slået segment kan starte med, så nogen af dem ender værdien før det."

# libretranslate
msgid "Every mode is read; there is no scope to narrow to. A run that failed in swarm and in compose comes back as two tokens for the same role."
msgstr "Hver tilstand er læst; der er ingen rækkevidde at indsnævre til. Et løb, der mislykkedes i sværm og i komposition kommer tilbage som to tokens for den samme rolle."

# libretranslate
msgid "Every module here SHOULD expose a callable function for in-process use and a `__main__` shim so the same code path is reachable from shell orchestrators via `python -m utils.cleanup.<module>`."
msgstr "Hvert modul her SKAL udsætte en kaldelig funktion for in-process brug og en `__main__` shim så den samme kode sti er tilgængelig fra shell orkestratorer via `python -m utils.cleanup.<module>`."

# libretranslate
msgid "Every non-empty body line gets a ``- `` continuation prefix so rpm does not read a markdown ``*`` bullet at column 0 as a new changelog entry header (which makes ``rpmspec`` report ``bad date``). Blank lines stay blank. *footer_md* (the archived-releases notice) is folded into this entry's body for the same reason it is on the Debian side: trailing free text confuses the parser."
msgstr "Hver ikke-tom krop linje får en ``- `` fortsættelse præfiks så rpm ikke læser en markdown ``*`` kugle ved kolonne 0 som en ny changelog indgang header (hvilket gør ``rpmspec`` rapport ``bad date``). Blanke linjer forbliver blanke. *footer_md* (meddelelsen om arkivudgivelser) er foldet ind i denne indtastnings krop af samme grund som den er på Debians side: at følge fri tekst forvirrer parseren."

# libretranslate
msgid "Every non-empty line of the markdown body gets a two-space indent so Debian's parser accepts it: each change line MUST start with at least two spaces, otherwise dpkg treats it as a badly formatted line, loses the entry boundary and reports an empty maintainer. Blank lines stay blank."
msgstr "Hver ikke- tom linje i markdown-kroppen får et to-rums-led, så Debians parser accepterer det: Hver ændringslinje SKAL starte med mindst to rum, ellers behandler dpkg det som en dårligt formateret linje, mister indgangsgrænsen og rapporterer en tom vedligeholder. Blanke linjer forbliver blanke."

# libretranslate
msgid "Every one of them needs the same four things before it can call into :mod:`utils.networks.render`: the resolved variables, the deployment mode, a service registry built from the merged applications, and closures over the ``config`` and ``database`` lookups. Building that once means a change to how the registry or the closures are obtained cannot reach one lookup and miss another."
msgstr "Hver eneste af dem har brug for de samme fire ting, før det kan kalde ind :mod:`utils.networks.render`: de løste variabler, ibrugtagningstilstand, et serviceregister, der er bygget fra de sammenlagte applikationer, og lukninger over ``config`` og ``database`` Opslag. Opbygning, der engang betyder en ændring af, hvordan registret eller lukninger er opnået kan ikke nå et opslag og gå glip af en anden."

# libretranslate
msgid "Every other agent deployment in [032](032-agent-employees-firecracker.md) keeps the agent kernel-isolated. This role is the deliberate inverse defined by [032](032-agent-employees-firecracker.md) Decision #12 (embodied / dedicated-device mode): for a robot, the useful trust boundary is the **whole device**, because the agent's job is to drive that device's hardware (GPIO, I2C/SPI sensors, cameras, actuators, motors). A microVM around the agent would only get in the way of the very hardware it is meant to control."
msgstr "Alle andre agenter i [032](032-agent-employees-firecracker.md) Holder agent kernel- isoleret. Denne rolle er den bevidste inverse defineret af [032](032-agent-employees-firecracker.md) Afgørelse #12 (incorporated / dedicated-device mode): for en robot, den nyttige tillid grænse er **hel anordning**Fordi agentens job er at køre den enheds hardware (GPIO, I2C / SPI-sensorer, kameraer, aktuatorer, motorer)En mikroVM omkring agenten ville kun stå i vejen for den hardware, den skal kontrollere."

# libretranslate
msgid "Every page carries a version switcher in its sidebar. Switching keeps the current page and falls back to the start page of a version that lacks it."
msgstr "Hver side bærer en version conducher i sin sidebar. Skift holder den aktuelle side og falder tilbage til startsiden af en version, der mangler den."

# libretranslate
msgid "Every path either deploys on the assigned kind, reports the substitution, or fails. None of them substitutes in silence."
msgstr "Hver sti enten anvender på den tildelte art, rapporterer substitution, eller mislykkes. Ingen af dem erstatter i stilhed."

# libretranslate
msgid "Every per-tool module MUST expose the same surface so the dispatcher can call it uniformly:"
msgstr "Hvert per- værktøj modul SKAL udsætte den samme overflade, så afsenderen kan kalde det ensartet:"

# libretranslate
msgid "Every persona scenario MUST run the CSP injection assertion at least once on the role's canonical surface. When an injector service (`asset`, `cdn`, `css`, `javascript`, `simpleicons`, `matomo`) is enabled, the page's `Content-Security-Policy` header MUST list the injector's host. The assertion is centralised in [`personas/utils/csp.js`](../../../../../roles/test-e2e-playwright/files/personas/utils/csp.js) so every spec gets the check by default."
msgstr "Hver persona scenario SKAL køre CSP injektion påstand mindst én gang på rollens kanoniske overflade. Når en injektionstjeneste (`asset`, `cdn`, `css`, `javascript`, `simpleicons`, `matomo`) er aktiveret, siden er `Content-Security-Policy` Header SKAL liste injicatorens vært. Påstanden er centraliseret i [`personas/utils/csp.js`](../../../../../roles/test-e2e-playwright/files/personas/utils/csp.js) Så hver spec får kontrollen som standard."

# libretranslate
msgid "Every plugin and mu-plugin is declared in [`meta/addons/`](./meta/addons/) under the unified addon contract. The OIDC and WP-Discourse runtime config lives in each addon's `config:` block. Both install paths read those declarations: a `required` addon that fails to install stops the deploy, an optional one warns and is skipped."
msgstr "Hvert plugin og mu- plugin er erklæret i [`meta/addons/`](./meta/addons/) i henhold til den samlede addon-kontrakt. OIDC og WP-Discourse runtime config bor i hver addon 's `config:` Block. Begge installere stier læse disse erklæringer: en `required` addon, der undlader at installere stopper deployeringen, en valgfri advarer og er sprunget over."

# libretranslate
msgid "Every plugin and mu-plugin is declared in ```meta/addons/`` <./meta/addons/>`__ under the unified addon contract. The OIDC and WP-Discourse runtime config lives in each addon’s ``config:`` block. Both install paths read those declarations: a ``required`` addon that fails to install stops the deploy, an optional one warns and is skipped."
msgstr "Hvert plugin og mu- plugin er erklæret i ```meta/addons/`` <./meta/addons/>`__ under the unified addon contract. The OIDC and WP-Discourse runtime config lives in each addon’s ``config:`` block. Both install paths read those declarations: a ``required`` addon, der undlader at installere stopper deployeringen, en valgfri advarer og er sprunget over."

# libretranslate
msgid "Every probe here targets the container's own loopback, so a request that a proxy picks up is wrong by definition -- the Wget probe has said so with ``--proxy=off`` since it was written. Both spellings come from here so the exec form and the shell form cannot drift: the shell form needs the wildcard quoted and the exec form needs it bare, which is exactly the kind of difference that rots when it is written out three times."
msgstr "Hver sonde her er rettet mod beholderens egen smutvej, så en anmodning om at en proxy opfanger er pr. definition forkert -- Wget sonden har sagt det med ``--proxy=off`` siden det blev skrevet. Begge stavelser kommer herfra, så exec-formen og shell-formen ikke kan drive: skalformen har brug for jokertet citeret, og exec-formen har brug for det bare, hvilket er præcis den slags forskel, der rådner, når det er skrevet ud tre gange."

# libretranslate
msgid "Every push runs the same gate you can run locally:"
msgstr "Hvert push kører den samme gate, du kan køre lokalt:"

# libretranslate
msgid "Every reason the tokens of one input cannot deploy on this branch."
msgstr "Hver grund tokens af et input kan ikke anvendes på denne gren."

# libretranslate
msgid "Every rejected entry carries a stable `reason`: `consumer_not_allowed`, `transport_unsupported`, `auth_unsupported`, `credential_missing` or `endpoint_unreachable`."
msgstr "Hver afvist indgang bærer en stabil `reason`: `consumer_not_allowed`, `transport_unsupported`, `auth_unsupported`, `credential_missing` eller `endpoint_unreachable`."

# libretranslate
msgid "Every replica serves from the shared ``docs_sites`` volume. The replica holding ``builder.lock`` in that volume fetches and builds; the queue (``queue/``) and the build states (``states/``) are files beside the sites, so a new lock holder resumes the queue when the builder dies. Cross-node locking relies on NFSv4, the default of ``svc-storage-nfs-client``."
msgstr "Hver kopi tjener fra den delte ``docs_sites`` volumen. Replikata-bedriften ``builder.lock`` i dette volumen henter og bygger; køen (``queue/``) og bygge stater (``states/``) er filer ved siden af siderne, så en ny låseholder genoptager køen, når bygherren dør. Cross- node låsning er afhængig af NFSv4, misligholdelse af ``svc-storage-nfs-client``."

# libretranslate
msgid "Every replica serves from the shared `docs_sites` volume. The replica holding `builder.lock` in that volume fetches and builds; the queue (`queue/`) and the build states (`states/`) are files beside the sites, so a new lock holder resumes the queue when the builder dies. Cross-node locking relies on NFSv4, the default of `svc-storage-nfs-client`."
msgstr "Hver kopi tjener fra den delte `docs_sites` volumen. Replikata-bedriften `builder.lock` i dette volumen henter og bygger; køen (`queue/`) og bygge stater (`states/`) er filer ved siden af siderne, så en ny låseholder genoptager køen, når bygherren dør. Cross- node låsning er afhængig af NFSv4, misligholdelse af `svc-storage-nfs-client`."

