msgstr "Fritagelse a `requirements/requirements.galaxy.yml` indsamling fra kravet om også at bære en `type: git` indtastning i `requirements/requirements.git.yml`. Reserveret til samlinger, der offentliggør ingen brugbar git fjernbetjening; uden git indgang en `galaxy.ansible.com` udfald mislykkes `make install`, fordi faldet i `scripts/install/ansible.sh` kan heller ikke løse samlingen."

# libretranslate
msgid "Exempts a `roles/*/meta/services.yml` healthcheck flavor from the requirement that the role's `files/Dockerfile` install the binary the probe runs, when the service sits on a `-slim` image. MUST name where the binary comes from instead. A `-slim` tag carries the runtime and nothing around it, so `curl` is absent and the probe fails from the first beat; under swarm the task is then reaped with exit 137 and every deployment holding the service in its closure fails on the convergence wait, naming the service rather than the missing binary."
msgstr "Fritagelse a `roles/*/meta/services.yml` sundhed smag fra kravet om, at rollen er `files/Dockerfile` installere den binære sonden kører, når tjenesten sidder på en `-slim` billede. SKAL navngive, hvor binær kommer fra i stedet. A `-slim` tag bærer runtime og intet omkring det, så `curl` er fraværende og sonden fejler fra det første beat; under sværm opgaven er derefter høstede med udgang 137 og hver implementering bedrift tjenesten i sin lukning mislykkes på konvergens vente, navngivning tjenesten snarere end den manglende binære."

# libretranslate
#, no-python-format, python-brace-format
msgid "Exempts a `roles/*/templates/*compose.yml.j2` line, or the whole file (head marker), from the canonical compose skeleton: base-include header, `{{ service_name }}:` service keys each preceded by their `{% set service_name %}`, all per-service `{% set %}` knobs on two-space-indented dash-free lines above the key, `{% include %}` at four spaces inside the service body, and column-0 `compose_volumes` / `compose_networks` at the tail. The layout renders correctly because the `stack_host_template` action plugin sets `lstrip_blocks=True` for `compose.yml.j2`. Reserved for legitimate deviations that genuinely cannot follow the skeleton."
msgstr "Fritagelse a `roles/*/templates/*compose.yml.j2` linje, eller hele filen (hovedmarkør), fra det kanoniske komposition skelet: base- omfatter header, `{{ service_name }}:` service nøgler hver med deres `{% set service_name %}`, alle per- service `{% set %}` knapper på to-rum- indrykkede dash- frie linjer over nøglen, `{% include %}` i fire rum inde i servicekroppen, og kolumn-0 `compose_volumes` / `compose_networks` I halen. Layoutet gør korrekt fordi `stack_host_template` handlingsplugin sæt `lstrip_blocks=True` til `compose.yml.j2`. Reserveret for legitime afvigelser, der virkelig ikke kan følge skelettet."

# libretranslate
#, no-python-format, python-brace-format
msgid "Exempts a `when` / `failed_when` / `changed_when` / `until` value that legitimately carries `{{ }}` / `{% %}`. Reserved for genuine edge cases; the default path is a bare expression. Per-item render/apply data guards belong on a `condition:` data field (honored by the sys-svc-compose render helper and `LISTMONK_SETTINGS`), not `when:`."
msgstr "Fritagelse a `when` / `failed_when` / `changed_when` / `until` værdi, der lovligt bærer `{{ }}` / `{% %}`. Reserveret til ægte kanttilfælde; standardstien er et tomt udtryk. Per- element rende / anvende dataskærme hører til på en `condition:` datafelt (af sys-svc-compose gøre hjælper og `LISTMONK_SETTINGS`), ikke `when:`."

msgid "Exempts a database-backed `web-app-*` role from the requirement to declare a seaweedfs object-store service. Place in the head of `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml`. Use only when the application genuinely needs no object storage."
msgstr ""

# libretranslate
msgid "Exempts a deprecated `add_header` / `Header set/add` line for `X-Frame-Options` / `X-XSS-Protection` / `X-Download-Options` / `X-Permitted-Cross-Domain-Policies`. Prefer Content-Security-Policy via the role's `meta/server.yml` (`csp.flags` / `csp.whitelist`)."
msgstr "Fritager en forældet `add_header` / `Header set/add` linje for `X-Frame-Options` / `X-XSS-Protection` / `X-Download-Options` / `X-Permitted-Cross-Domain-Policies`. Foretag en oversigt over de vigtigste spørgsmål i denne forbindelse. `meta/server.yml` (`csp.flags` / `csp.whitelist`)."

msgid "Exempts a domain-serving role (`web-`/`svc-db-` prefix or explicit `domains.canonical`) from the \"must declare a `tor:` block in `meta/services.yml`\" contract. Reserved for roles with no onion surface, e.g. pure redirect helpers."
msgstr ""

# libretranslate
msgid "Exempts a server-capable `roles/<role>/meta/mcp.yml` from the \"must carry a `\"{{ '<client>' in group_names }}\"`-gated `services.<client-entity>` entry for every role declaring `mcp_consumer: true`\" check. Reserved for a provider that legitimately owns no co-deploy edge to its clients."
msgstr "Fritager en server- stand `roles/<role>/meta/mcp.yml` fra \"skal bære `\"{{ '<client>' in group_names }}\"`- Blandet `services.<client-entity>` angivelse af hver rolledeklaration `mcp_consumer: true`\" Tjek. Reserveret til en udbyder, der legitimt ikke ejer nogen samdeployeringskant til sine kunder."

# libretranslate
msgid "Exempts a server-capable `roles/<role>/meta/mcp.yml` from the \"must ship one `meta/variants.yml` entry enabling every admitted consumer, with `sso` pinned on, and pulling in a consumer variant that does not pin `sso: false`\" check. Reserved for a provider whose pairing is genuinely proven elsewhere."
msgstr "Fritager en server- stand `roles/<role>/meta/mcp.yml` fra \"must shipping one `meta/variants.yml` adgang, der gør det muligt for enhver indskrevet forbruger, med `sso` fast på, og trække i en forbruger variant, der ikke pin `sso: false`\" Tjek. Reserveret til en udbyder, hvis parring er bevist andetsteds."

# libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Exempts a top-level key in `roles/<role>/{vars,defaults}/main.yml` or `group_vars/**/*.yml` from the \"must be referenced\" check. Use when the consumer is non-YAML/Jinja (Python plugins, external tools)."
msgstr "Fritager en top-niveau nøgle i `roles/<role>/{vars,defaults}/main.yml` eller `group_vars/**/*.yml` fra \"skal refereres\" Tjek. Brug når forbrugeren ikke er YAML / Jinja (Python- plugins, eksterne værktøjer)."

# libretranslate
msgid "Exempts a top-level service in `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml` from the \"must be registered as `<NAME>_SERVICE_ENABLED=` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`\" check."
msgstr "Fritager en top-niveau service i `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml` fra \"skal være registreret som `<NAME>_SERVICE_ENABLED=` til `templates/playwright.env.j2`\" Tjek."

# libretranslate
msgid "Exempts an auth-isolated variant entry in `roles/*/meta/variants.yml` (one that enables exactly one of LDAP / OIDC / OAuth2) from the rule that every non-auth service-key in the role's variant union must be pinned to literal `false`. Place on the leading `- services:` line of the variant or on the line above. Use only when the broader closure is intentional."
msgstr "Fritager en auth- isoleret variant indgang i `roles/*/meta/variants.yml` (en, der muliggør præcis en af LDAP / OIDC / OAuth2) fra reglen om, at enhver ikke-auth service-nøgle i rollens variant union skal fastlåses til bogstavelig `false`. Sted på den førende `- services:` linje af varianten eller på linjen ovenfor. Anvendes kun, når den bredere lukning er tilsigtet."

# libretranslate
msgid "Exempts one `roles/*/meta/variants.yml` `services.<key>.shared: false` pin from the one-local-provider-variant limit for a service whose base `meta/services.yml` uses literal `enabled: true` and dynamic `shared`. Place on the extra `shared: false` line or service key line. Place above the service key in `meta/services.yml` to exempt the service."
msgstr "Fritager en `roles/*/meta/variants.yml` `services.<key>.shared: false` pin fra en-local-provider- variant grænse for en tjeneste, hvis base `meta/services.yml` bruger bogstavelig `enabled: true` og dynamisk `shared`. Place on the extra `shared: false` linje eller servicenøglelinje. Placer over servicenøglen i `meta/services.yml` at fritage tjenesten."

