# libretranslate
msgid "Fork [rpardini/docker-registry-proxy](https://github.com/rpardini/docker-registry-proxy) and teach the bundled nginx to handle GCP Artifact Registry redirect URLs (`/artifacts-downloads/namespaces/<ns>/repositories/<repo>/downloads/<token>`). Currently `gcr.io` blob pulls are bypassed via `NO_PROXY=…,gcr.io,storage.googleapis.com,googleusercontent.com` in [compose/registry-cache/proxy.conf](compose/registry-cache/proxy.conf), which is a workaround that disables caching for those registries. Long-term: rebase upstream's `proxy.conf` / `sub_filter` rules to recognise the new redirect shape, ship the fix in our fork, point `compose/registry-cache/Dockerfile` (or its image tag) at the fork, and drop the `NO_PROXY` bypass."
msgstr "Fork [rpardini / docker- registry- proxy](https://github.com/rpardini/docker-registry-proxy) og undervise i bundtet nginx til at håndtere GCP Artifact Registry omdirigere URL 'er (`/artifacts-downloads/namespaces/<ns>/repositories/<repo>/downloads/<token>`)I øjeblikket `gcr.io` blob træk er omgået via `NO_PROXY=…,gcr.io,storage.googleapis.com,googleusercontent.com` til [compose/registry-cache/proxy.conf](compose/registry-cache/proxy.conf), som er et arbejde omkring, der deaktiverer caching for disse registre. Langfristet: ombase opstrøms `proxy.conf` / `sub_filter` regler for at anerkende den nye omdirigeringsform, sende fix i vores gaffel, punkt `compose/registry-cache/Dockerfile` (eller dets billedmærke) ved gaflen, og slip `NO_PROXY` bypass."

# libretranslate
msgid "Fork `pull_request` runs always receive a read-only token (GitHub-enforced); the label never grants write tokens or secrets to the untrusted event."
msgstr "Fork `pull_request` kører altid modtage en read- only token (GitHub - håndhævet); etiketten aldrig giver skrive tokens eller hemmeligheder til den utroværdige begivenhed."

# libretranslate
msgid "Fork main-branch sync: the push entry workflow now synchronizes the current repository's *main* from a configured source repository (default *infinito-nexus/core*) before CI scope and deploy discovery run, so a fork branch push sees only its own changes against an up-to-date base. The source is overridable or disablable through the *CI_SYNC_MAIN_SOURCE_REPOSITORY* repository variable, and the sync force-overwrites *main*, so a synced repository must not be used as a working branch. See [the Actions configuration reference](docs/contributing/tools/github/actions/configuration.md)."
msgstr "Fork main- branch sync: push entry workflow synkroniserer nu det aktuelle datalagringssystem *vigtigste* fra et konfigureret kildearkiv (standard *Infinito- nexus / kerne*) før CI scope og implementere opdagelse køre, så en gaffel gren skubbe ser kun sine egne ændringer mod en up-to-date base. Kilden er overridabel eller invaliderende gennem *CI_SYNC_MAIN_SOURCE_REPOSITORY* depot variabel, og sync kraft- overskrifter *vigtigste*, så et synkroniseret arkiv må ikke anvendes som en arbejdsgren. Se [Aktionskonfigurationsreference](docs/contributing/tools/github/actions/configuration.md)."

# libretranslate
msgid "Fork, PR, release, or scheduled paths affected:"
msgstr "Fork, PR, release, eller planlagte stier påvirket:"

# libretranslate
msgid "Fork-PR CI hardening (follow-up to the 11.1.0 trusted-fork flow): the privileged *pull_request_target* image producer and mirror now set *allow-unsafe-pr-checkout* so *actions/checkout* stops refusing the merged fork ref it had begun rejecting. Untrusted fork builds run without organization secrets — they authenticate to GHCR with the per-job *GITHUB_TOKEN* only and mirror Docker Hub anonymously — while the maintainer-trusted path keeps full credentials and builds the raw PR head. The trust switch moved to the *🛡️ Trusted* label. See [the fork-PR pipeline](docs/contributing/artefact/git/pipeline.md) and [the GHCR authentication reference](docs/contributing/tools/ghcr/authentication.md)."
msgstr "Fork- PR CI hærdning (Opfølgning af 11.1.0 trusted- gaffelflow): De privilegerede *pull_request_target* billede producent og spejl nu indstillet *allo- unsafe- pr- checkout* så *foranstaltninger / kontrol* Stopper med at nægte den sammenlagte gaffel ref det var begyndt at afvise. Ubetroede gaffel bygger kører uden organisation hemmeligheder - de autentificerer til GHCR med per-job *GITHUB_TOKEN* kun og spejl Docker Hub anonymt - mens vedligeholderen-betroede sti holder fuld legitimation og bygger den rå PR hoved. Trust switch flyttet til *🛡️ Trusted* Etiket. Se [gaffelrørledningen](docs/contributing/artefact/git/pipeline.md) og [GHCR-godkendelsesreferencen](docs/contributing/tools/ghcr/authentication.md)."

