# libretranslate
msgid "Inside a play the process boundary is the task: Ansible forks a fresh worker per task, so `_MERGED_APPLICATIONS_CACHE` starts empty in every worker. `get_merged_applications` therefore also accepts the play-scoped carrier fact `_INFINITO_APPLICATIONS_RENDERED` (payload plus cache key, parked once by the constructor stage) and serves it when the key matches. See [applications.md](../../docs/contributing/artefact/files/plugins/lookup/applications.md) for the contract."
msgstr "Inde i et spil er procesgrænsen opgaven: Ansible gafler en frisk arbejder per opgave, så `_MERGED_APPLICATIONS_CACHE` starter tom i hver arbejdstager. `get_merged_applications` derfor også accepterer den afspilning- scoped carrier fact `_INFINITO_APPLICATIONS_RENDERED` (nyttelast plus cache nøgle, parkeret en gang ved konstruktionsscenen) og tjener det, når nøglen matcher. Se [applications.md](../../docs/contributing/artefact/files/plugins/lookup/applications.md) for kontrakten."

