# libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests for playbook-level wiring: `tasks/stages/**`, invokable-path coverage, and the dispatch between them."
msgstr "Integrationstest for playbook- niveau ledninger: `tasks/stages/**`, usårlig-sti dækning, og forsendelse mellem dem."

# libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests for the `cli/` package: subcommand discovery and `--help` smoke tests for every invokable CLI entrypoint."
msgstr "Integrationstests for `cli/` pakke: underkommando opdagelse og `--help` Røgprøver for alle uovervindelige CLI entrypoint."

# libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests for the `run_once_<role_name>` fact pattern: flag suffixes MUST match their role folder name, flags MUST be defined before use, and inclusion of `utils/once/flag.yml` MUST follow the schema."
msgstr "Integrationstests for `run_once_<role_name>` Fakta mønster: flag suffikser SKAL matche deres rolle mappenavn, flag SKAL defineres før brug, og medtagelse af `utils/once/flag.yml` Jeg må følge skemaet."

# libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests for the custom Ansible lookup plugins under `plugins/lookup/`: config-path validation against role schemas and runtime caching performance."
msgstr "Integrationstest for de brugerdefinerede Ansible lookupplugins under `plugins/lookup/`: Konfiguration-sti validering mod rolleskemaer og runtime caching ydeevne."

# libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests for the deployment substrate that every role shares: Docker Compose templates, Docker image consistency, container networks, the shared service registry, and the backups contract."
msgstr "Integrationstests for implementering substrat, som hver rolle deler: Docker Compose skabeloner, Docker billede konsistens, container netværk, den delte tjeneste registreringsdatabasen, og sikkerhedskontrakten."

# libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce contracts between tasks and handlers. One file per contract, no second opinion on the same rule:"
msgstr "Integrationstests, der gennemfører kontrakter mellem opgaver og håndterende virksomheder. En fil pr. kontrakt, ingen anden udtalelse om samme regel:"

# libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce every `include_tasks` / `import_tasks` / `include_role` / `import_role` target referenced from role tasks (and other project YAML) resolves to an existing file."
msgstr "Integrationstest, der håndhæver alle `include_tasks` / `import_tasks` / `include_role` / `import_role` mål for rolleopgaver (og andre projekter YAML) løser en eksisterende fil."

# libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce invariants of `galaxy_info.run_after` in each role's `meta/main.yml`: every referenced name MUST resolve to an existing role directory, no role MUST list itself in `run_after`, and the resulting ordering graph MUST be acyclic."
msgstr "Integrationstest, der håndhæver invariants af `galaxy_info.run_after` i hver rolles `meta/main.yml`: ethvert refereret navn SKAL løses til en eksisterende rollemappe, ingen rolle SKAL liste sig selv i `run_after`, og den resulterende bestillingsgraf SKAL være acyklisk."

# libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce invariants of each role's `meta/main.yml`: the file MUST exist for every role under `roles/`, and `galaxy_info` MUST carry the fields the Sphinx generator expects (non-empty `description`, no `None` values)."
msgstr "Integrationstest, der håndhæver invariants af hver rolles `meta/main.yml`: filen SKAL eksistere for hver rolle under `roles/`, og `galaxy_info` SKAL bære de felter, som Sfinx generatoren forventer (non- tom `description`, ng `None` værdier)."

# libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce invariants of each role's `meta/services.yml`: the dynamic-flag form (`\"{{ '<role>' in group_names }}\"`) MUST be used wherever a service entry depends on a sibling role's deployment, and a role's `services.yml` MUST NOT reference itself as a sibling provider."
msgstr "Integrationstest, der håndhæver invariants af hver rolles `meta/services.yml`: Dynamisk-flag form (`\"{{ '<role>' in group_names }}\"`) SKAL anvendes overalt, hvor en tjeneste indtastning afhænger af en søskende rolle, og en rolle `services.yml` MÅ IKKE henvise sig selv som søskende udbyder."

# libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce invariants of each role's `meta/variants.yml`: the matrix-deploy variant list MUST exercise every dynamic flag declared in the role's `meta/services.yml` on both polarities, every service key referenced under `services:` in a variant MUST exist in `services.yml`, and the auth matrix (`oidc` / `oauth2` / `ldap`) MUST cover the LDAP-only branch."
msgstr "Integrationstest, der håndhæver invariants af hver rolles `meta/variants.yml`: matrix- deployering variant liste SKAL udøve hvert dynamisk flag erklæret i rollens `meta/services.yml` på begge polariteter, hver service nøgle refereret under `services:` i en variant SKAL eksistere i `services.yml`, og auth matrix (`oidc` / `oauth2` / `ldap`) Skal dække LDAP-kun gren."

# libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce invariants of repository declarations in `roles/*/meta/services.yml`: every `git clone`-style URL referenced from a role MUST be declared as an entity with a `repository:` key, and any entity that declares `repository:` MUST also pin a `ref:`."
msgstr "Integrationstests, der håndhæver invariants af depoterklæringer i `roles/*/meta/services.yml`: Hver `git clone`-stil URL refereret fra en rolle SKAL erklæres som en enhed med en `repository:` nøgle og enhver enhed, der erklærer `repository:` SKAL også fastgøres `ref:`."

# libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce invariants of the `server:` block in `roles/*/meta/services.yml`: Content-Security-Policy structure (whitelist / flags / hashes), supported directives, valid URL / Jinja / wildcard entries."
msgstr "Integrationstests, der håndhæver invariants of the `server:` block in `roles/*/meta/services.yml`: Sammenhæng -Sikkerhed - Politisk struktur (whitelist / flag / hash), understøttede direktiver, gyldige URL / Jinja / wildcard poster."

# libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce invariants of the prometheus integration: every web-app/svc role declares the shared `prometheus` service entry, the prometheus role's own nginx + docker-health wiring is intact, and the native-metrics scrape contract (`services.prometheus.native_metrics.enabled` ⇔ `templates/prometheus.yml.j2`) holds across the roles tree."
msgstr "Integrationstest, der håndhæver invarianter af prometheus integration: hvert web- app / svc rolle erklærer den delte `prometheus` service entry, prometheus rolls egen nginx + docker-sundhed ledninger er intakt, og den indfødte-metrics skrabe kontrakt (`services.prometheus.native_metrics.enabled` I alt `templates/prometheus.yml.j2`) holder på tværs af rolletræet."

# libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce invariants of the role dependency graph expressed via `meta/main.yml`: declared `dependencies:` targets MUST exist, the `dependencies:` graph MUST be acyclic, and meta dependencies MUST NOT be declared when a guarded `include_role` / `import_role` would suffice."
msgstr "Integrationstest, der håndhæver invariant af rolleafhængighedsgrafen udtrykt via `meta/main.yml`: anmeldt `dependencies:` Målene skal findes, `dependencies:` Grafen skal være acyklisk, og meta afhængigheder må ikke angives, når en bevogtet `include_role` / `import_role` Det er nok."

# libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce per-role invariants of the unified ``services.sso`` block across roles, including normalization of ``allowed_groups`` paths and allocation of per-consumer SSO-proxy ports."
msgstr "Integrationstests, der håndhæver perrolleinvariants af det forenede ``services.sso`` blok på tværs af roller, herunder normalisering af ``allowed_groups`` stier og tildeling af per- forbruger SSO- proxy porte."

# libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce role naming conventions: folder names match the declared category prefix (`web-app-*`, `web-svc-*`, `sys-*`, …), and roles do not collide on canonical identifiers."
msgstr "Integrationstest, der håndhæver rollenavngivning konventioner: mappenavne matcher den erklærede kategori præfiks (`web-app-*`, `web-svc-*`, `sys-*`,...), og roller ikke kolliderer på kanoniske identifikatorer."

# libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce rules about roles which represent deployable applications: `web-app-*` roles MUST ship a `README.md` (required for the Web App Dashboard), every literal name compared against `group_names` in playbooks/roles MUST resolve to a real `application_id`, every `applications['…']` / `applications.get('…')` / `applications.name` / `get_domain('…')` reference MUST name an existing application, and roles MUST NOT reach into `applications[...]` by subscript; they MUST use `lookup('applications', …)` or `utils.roles.applications.config.get` instead."
msgstr "Integrationstests, der håndhæver regler om roller, der repræsenterer deployerbare applikationer: `web-app-*` roller SKAL sende en `README.md` (kræves til Web App Dashboard), hvert bogstavelige navn sammenlignet med `group_names` i spillebøger / roller SKAL løse til en reel `application_id`, hver `applications['…']` / `applications.get('…')` / `applications.name` / `get_domain('…')` reference SKAL navngive en eksisterende ansøgning, og roller SKAL IKKE nå ind `applications[...]` ved abonnent; de SKAL bruge `lookup('applications', …)` eller `utils.roles.applications.config.get` I stedet."

# libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce safe handling of secrets across roles: env-file values MUST be quoted, shell tasks MUST quote password expansions, and password *definitions* MUST NOT apply the `quote` filter (which corrupts the stored value)."
msgstr "Integrationstest, der håndhæver sikker håndtering af hemmeligheder på tværs af roller: env- fil værdier SKAL citeres, shell opgaver SKAL citere password udvidelser, og password *Definitioner* MÅ IKKE ANVENDES `quote` filter (som ødelægger den lagrede værdi)."

# libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce structural invariants of every role under `roles/`: folder-name conventions and `include_tasks` / `import_tasks` target existence."
msgstr "Integrationstests, der håndhæver strukturelle invarianter af enhver rolle under `roles/`: folder- navn konventioner og `include_tasks` / `import_tasks` Målets eksistens."

# libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce the contract between `group_vars/all/08_networks.yml` and the roles that require a container network: subnets MUST be valid, unique, and non-overlapping, network names MUST map to an `application_id`, and every role that ships a `compose.yml.j2` with an `application_id` MUST have a network entry under `defaults_networks.local`."
msgstr "Integrationstest, der gennemfører kontrakten mellem `group_vars/all/08_networks.yml` og de roller, der kræver et containernetværk: undernet SKAL være gyldigt, unikt og ikke-overlappende, netnavne SKAL kortlægge til en `application_id`, og enhver rolle, der sender en `compose.yml.j2` med `application_id` SKAL have en netindgang under `defaults_networks.local`."

