# libretranslate
msgid "Locally-built images are declared once, in the service's config: ``services.<key>.custom: true`` names the image ``<entity_name>_custom`` (where ``<entity_name>`` comes from ``utils.roles.entity.name.get_entity_name``) shared across an app's custom services, while a non-empty STRING names it ``<custom>_custom`` for a second, distinct custom image inside one app (where the shared ``<entity>_custom`` would collide). The compose template's ``build:`` directive does the actual building; this lookup only derives the name the build is tagged with. A ``custom=`` kwarg overrides the config declaration, and an ``image=`` override wins over both. ``services.<key>.image`` is ignored entirely in custom mode (the lookup never reads it)."
msgstr "Lokal-byggede billeder er deklareret én gang, i tjenestens config: ``services.<key>.custom: true`` navngiver billedet ``<entity_name>_custom`` (hvor ``<entity_name>`` kommer fra ``utils.roles.entity.name.get_entity_name``) delt på tværs af en app brugerdefinerede tjenester, mens en ikke-tom STRING navne det ``<custom>_custom`` for en anden, særskilt brugerdefineret billede inde i en app (hvor den delte ``<entity>_custom`` ville kollidere). Sammensæt skabelonens ``build:`` Dette opslag får kun det navn, som bygningen er mærket med. A ``custom=`` kwarg tilsidesætter config deklaration, og en ``image=`` Override vinder over begge. ``services.<key>.image`` ignoreres helt i brugerdefineret tilstand (Lookup aldrig læser det)."

