# libretranslate
msgid "Never attach a global MCP server to the shared engine or root credential. Instantiate one sidecar per consuming application with a database-scoped read-only principal and only schema/SELECT/SHOW/DESCRIBE tools. Otherwise record `shared_engine_isolation`."
msgstr "Vedhæft aldrig en global MCP-server til den delte motor eller root creditial. Instantiate one sidevogn per forbrugende anvendelse med en databank-scoped read- kun hovedstol og kun schema/SELECT/SHOW/DESCRIBE værktøjer. Ellers record `shared_engine_isolation`."

