msgid "Never. Both workflows declare the secret `required: false` and gate the login step on both values being non-empty."
msgstr "Aldrig. Begge arbejdsgange erklærer hemmeligheden `required: false` og gate login trin på begge værdier er ikke-tomme."

# libretranslate
msgid "Never. Unset leaves the route unpublished."
msgstr "Aldrig. Uafgjort efterlader ruten ikke offentliggjort."

# libretranslate
msgid "New *unit_name* lookup plugin for consistent versioned systemd unit generation"
msgstr "Ny *unit_name* lookup plugin til konsekvent versioneret systemd enhedsgeneration"

# libretranslate
msgid "New *web-app-n8n* role: n8n workflow automation (Community Edition). SSO is wired through a trusted-header edge hook that is copied and mounted only when SSO is enabled (native SSO is enterprise-only in CE), LDAP sign-in is supported, and per-scenario Playwright coverage exercises the CE edge-SSO model. Ships at lifecycle *alpha*; subnet and port collisions with the new *web-app-semaphore* role were resolved on the way in. See the [web-app-n8n README](roles/web-app-n8n/README.md)."
msgstr "Ny *web-app-n8n* rolle: n8n automatisering af arbejdsgange (Fællesskabsudgave). SSO er forbundet gennem en trusted- header kant krog, der er kopieret og monteret kun når SSO er aktiveret (native SSO er enterprise- kun i CE), LDAP sign-in er understøttet, og per- scenario Playwright dækning øvelser CE edge- SSO model. Skibe i livscyklus *alfa*; undernet og havnesammenstød med den nye *web-app-semaphore* I den forbindelse er det vigtigt at understrege, at det er vigtigt, at der findes en løsning på problemet. Se [web-app-n8n README](roles/web-app-n8n/README.md)."

# libretranslate
msgid "New Apps"
msgstr "Nye apps"

# libretranslate
msgid "New ERPNext role that ships the upstream Frappe Framework v15 stack as a web-app-erpnext role — backend, frontend, websocket, scheduler and two queue workers — wired into the central Keycloak via a built-in Keycloak Social Login Key and into the central OpenLDAP via the LDAP Settings doctype. The three-variant matrix (SSO plus LDAP, no auth, LDAP only) is exercised end-to-end and a repo-wide lint caps Ansible task names at 120 characters."
msgstr "Ny ERPNext rolle, der skibe opstrøms Frappe Framework v15 stack som en web-app-erpnext rolle - backend, frontend, websocket, scheduler og to kø arbejdstagere - forbundet ind i den centrale Keycloak via en bygning-in Keycloak Social login nøgle og ind i den centrale OpenLDAP via LDAP- indstillingsdoktype. Den tre-variant matrix (SSO plus LDAP, ingen aut, kun LDAP) er anvendt i slutningen og en repo- bred lint caps Ansible opgavelavne på 120 tegn."

# libretranslate
msgid "New Jitsi Meet role that adds an oauth2-proxy gated meeting surface plus matching LDAP-variant Playwright coverage. The spec layout is reorganised into a shared module and per-scenario test files so future scenarios can be added without touching the monolith."
msgstr "Ny Jitsi Meet rolle, der tilføjer en oauth2-proxy gated møde overflade plus matchende LDAP-variant Playwright dækning. Specielt layout er omorganiseret til et delt modul og per- scenario testfiler, så fremtidige scenarier kan tilføjes uden at røre monolith."

# libretranslate
msgid "New OUs SHOULD NOT be invented. Place users under `OU.USERS`, RBAC roles under `OU.ROLES`, and organizational groups under `OU.GROUPS`."
msgstr "Nye OUs må ikke blive opfundet. Placer brugere under `OU.USERS`, RBAC roller under `OU.ROLES`, og organisationsgrupper under `OU.GROUPS`."

# libretranslate
msgid "New Penpot role (web-app-penpot, requirement 235) that ships the upstream Penpot design platform comprising frontend, backend, exporter and Redis at image version 2.5.4, wired into the central Keycloak via OIDC and into the central OpenLDAP. Native local-password login is available as a toggle that is disabled automatically under OIDC, with the native-login and registration flags derived from the SSO flag. A custom JVM truststore imports the Infinito self-signed CA so OIDC over TLS succeeds, and the role is exercised end-to-end with Playwright covering OIDC login, logout and project creation. The local subnet was moved to 192.168.105.192/28 to avoid a collision with the ERPNext range."
msgstr "Ny Penpot rolle (web-app-penpot, krav 235) at skibe opstrøms Penpot designplatform bestående af frontend, motor, eksportør og Redis i billedversionen 2.5.4, anbragt i midten Keycloak via OIDC og ind i den centrale OpenLDAP. Indfødt local- password login er tilgængelig som et skifte, der er deaktiveret automatisk under OIDC, med den indfødte login og registrering flag afledt af SSO flag. En brugerdefineret JVM trustbutik importerer Infinito selvsignerede CA, så OIDC over TLS lykkes, og rollen udøves slut- til- end med Playwright dækker OIDC login, logout og projektskabelse. Den lokale subnet blev flyttet til 192.168.105.192/28 for at undgå kollision med ERPNext rækkevidde."

# libretranslate
msgid "New Pi-hole role (*web-app-pihole*) that ships the upstream Pi-hole DNS sinkhole and network-wide ad blocker, with its admin web interface gated behind *oauth2-proxy* and Keycloak RBAC and a native admin-password login (the *FTLCONF* web API password) available as a fallback variant. The upstream resolver and timezone are configurable, the role waits on the Pi-hole HTTP endpoint during deploy, and it is exercised end-to-end with Playwright covering the OAuth2, native-login and guest-access scenarios. The role ships at lifecycle beta."
msgstr "Ny Pi- hole rolle (*web-app-pihole*) at skibe opstrøms Pi- hul DNS synkehul og network- wide ad blocker, med sin admin web interface gated bag *oauth2- proxy* og Keycloak RBAC og en indfødt admin- password login (i *FTLCONF* web API adgangskode) fås som en fallback variant. Opstrøms resolver og tidszone er konfigurerbare, rollen venter på Pie-hul HTTP endpoint under implementering, og det udøves end-to-end med Playwright dækker OAuth2, natial- login og guest- access scenarier. Rollen skibe på livscyklus beta."

# libretranslate
msgid "New `--mirror` support for inventory generation"
msgstr "Ny `--mirror` støtte til lagerproduktion"

# libretranslate
msgid "New addon suggestions MUST include enough data for review: role id, addon id, upstream id, mechanism, source, catalog URL, and why the addon is considered relevant."
