# libretranslate
msgid "New centralized API single-point-of-truth: an *api* lookup plugin plus a global API dict so API tokens and endpoints (Cloudflare, the Nextcloud proprietary OAuth integrations) resolve from one place instead of scattered role lookups."
msgstr "Ny centraliseret API single- point- of- sandhed: en *api* lookup plugin plus en global API dict så API tokens og endepunkter (Cloudflare, Nextcloud proprietære OAuth integreringer) løse fra ét sted i stedet for spredt rolleopslag."

# libretranslate
msgid "New engine-agnostic object-store service (*web-app-seaweedfs*, backed by either *SeaweedFS* or *MinIO*) that exposes a shared S3 endpoint, now consumed across 14 web-app roles for media and asset storage. Nextcloud, Decidim, Shopware, PeerTube, Pixelfed, Taiga, Fider, Akaunting, Mobilizon and Matrix route their uploads to the central bucket, each exercised end-to-end with a SeaweedFS consumer check that requires a fresh object key per upload."
msgstr "Nyhed- agnostic object- store service (*web-app-seaweedfs*, støttet af enten *SeaweedFS* eller *MinIO*) der udsætter et delt S3 Endepunkt, nu forbrugt på tværs 14 web- app roller for medier og opbevaring af aktiver. Nextcloud Decidim, Shopware, PeerTube, Pixelfed, Taiga, Fider, Akaunting, Mobilizon og Matrix Rute deres uploads til den centrale spand, hver udøvet end-to-end med en SeaweedFS forbruger check, der kræver en frisk objektnøgle per upload."

