msgid "Pure function — reads role metadata via cached YAML helpers and emits ``PlanEntry`` tuples; no filesystem side effects. The include set per round is resolved by the ``CombinedResolver`` (see ``.legacy_resolver``): each role contributes its own pulled-in providers and the include is the union. A service-key is therefore pulled in as soon as ANY role in the round-aware closure says it should be (literal ``True`` OR the ``\"{{ '<role>' in group_names }}\"`` Jinja form, both accepted by ``utils.roles.applications.services.registry.is_explicit_truth``); if EVERY role marks it ``False`` it stays out of the include."
msgstr "Ren funktion - læser rollemetadata via cachet YAML hjælpere og udleder ``PlanEntry`` tuples; ingen filsystem bivirkninger. Inklusive sæt per runde er løst af ``CombinedResolver`` (Se ``.legacy_resolver``): hver rolle bidrager til sin egen pulle- i udbyderne, og inkluderer er fagforeningen. En service-nøgle er derfor trukket ind, så snart nogen rolle i rund- bevidste lukning siger, at det skal være (bogstaveligt ``True`` ELLER ``\"{{ '<role>' in group_names }}\"`` Jinja form, begge accepteret af ``utils.roles.applications.services.registry.is_explicit_truth``); hvis hver rolle markerer det ``False`` Det holder sig væk."

