# libretranslate
msgid "Run `make compose-playwright role=<role> keep=true`. You MAY pass `pw=\"--grep <pattern>\"` (or any other `npx playwright test` argument). Set `keep=true` on every inner-loop run regardless of the previous result; omit only when the user has explicitly opted out. For the full propagation chain see [Playwright Tests](../../../contributing/actions/testing/playwright.md#artefact-retention-)."
msgstr "Kør `make compose-playwright role=<role> keep=true`. Du kan passere `pw=\"--grep <pattern>\"` (eller andre `npx playwright test` argument). `keep=true` på hver inner- loop køre uanset det tidligere resultat; udelade kun, når brugeren udtrykkeligt har valgt. For den fulde formering kæde se [Playwright test](../../../contributing/actions/testing/playwright.md#artefact-retention-)."

# libretranslate
msgid "Run `make dotenv`."
msgstr "Kør `make dotenv`."

# libretranslate
