msgstr "Kør `make test` - alle test for linning og enhed skal bestå, inden de iværksættes."

# libretranslate
msgid "Run `python -m cli.contributing.network.diagnose` to print a structured DNS / TCP / TLS / PMTU report (IPv4 + IPv6) plus interface MTU, `/etc/resolv.conf`, `/etc/hosts`, proxy env vars, and CA bundle summaries from inside the running infinito container. Exposed as `make diagnose-network`."
msgstr "Kør `python -m cli.contributing.network.diagnose` at udskrive en struktureret DNS / TCP / TLS / PMTU-rapport (IPv4 + IPv6) plus interface MTU `/etc/resolv.conf`, `/etc/hosts`, proxy env vars, og CA bundt resuméer fra inde i infinito beholder. Udsendt som `make diagnose-network`."

# libretranslate
msgid "Run `python -m cli.contributing.update.source --dry-run` to list pending bumps; the `update-version-sources` job of `.github/workflows/cron-update.yml` opens the PRs, and `tests/external/update/source/` warns about them."
msgstr "Kør `python -m cli.contributing.update.source --dry-run` at opregne udestående bump `update-version-sources` job `.github/workflows/cron-update.yml` åbner PRs, og `tests/external/update/source/` Advar om dem."

