# libretranslate
msgid "Run the script; it first starts the role's deployed backup unit (a fresh differential `backup-nfs-to-local` generation of the live export), then mirrors the snapshot into the target (`rsync -a --delete`, with the shared `<state>/backup` root protected from deletion and never copied in). `--no-safety-backup` skips the unit run when the target holds nothing worth saving."
msgstr "Kør scriptet; det starter rollens indsat backup enhed (en frisk difference `backup-nfs-to-local` produktion af levende eksport), derefter spejle snapshot ind i målet (`rsync -a --delete`, med delt `<state>/backup` root beskyttet mod sletning og aldrig kopieret). `--no-safety-backup` springer enheden køre, når målet ikke har noget værd at redde."

# libretranslate
msgid "Run the script; it first starts the role's deployed backup unit (a fresh differential baudolo generation of every volume and database), resolves the volume's mountpoint and mirrors the snapshot into it (`rsync -a --delete`). `--no-safety-backup` skips the unit run when the target holds nothing worth saving."
msgstr "Kør scriptet; det starter rollens indsat backup enhed (en frisk differentialbaudolo generation af hver volumen og database), løser lydstyrkens stoppunkt og spejle snapshot ind i det (`rsync -a --delete`). `--no-safety-backup` springer enheden køre, når målet ikke har noget værd at redde."

# libretranslate
msgid "Run the script; it first starts the role’s deployed backup unit (a fresh differential ``backup-nfs-to-local`` generation of the live export), then mirrors the snapshot into the target (``rsync -a --delete``, with the shared ``<state>/backup`` root protected from deletion and never copied in). ``--no-safety-backup`` skips the unit run when the target holds nothing worth saving."
msgstr "Kør scriptet; det starter rollens indsat backup enhed (en frisk difference ``backup-nfs-to-local`` produktion af levende eksport), derefter spejle snapshot ind i målet (``rsync -a --delete``, med delt ``<state>/backup`` root beskyttet mod sletning og aldrig kopieret). ``--no-safety-backup`` springer enheden køre, når målet ikke har noget værd at redde."

# libretranslate
msgid "Run the script; it first starts the role’s deployed backup unit (a fresh differential baudolo generation of every volume and database), resolves the volume’s mountpoint and mirrors the snapshot into it (``rsync -a --delete``). ``--no-safety-backup`` skips the unit run when the target holds nothing worth saving."
msgstr "Kør scriptet; det starter rollens indsat backup enhed (en frisk differentialbaudolo generation af hver volumen og database), løser lydstyrkens stoppunkt og spejle snapshot ind i det (``rsync -a --delete``). ``--no-safety-backup`` springer enheden køre, når målet ikke har noget værd at redde."

