# libretranslate
msgid "Runs [__main__.py](../../../../cli/contributing/network/diagnose/__main__.py) inside the running `infinito` container and produces a structured DNS / TCP / TLS / PMTU report against the standard infrastructure hosts (`github.com`, `ghcr.io`, `registry-1.docker.io`, `auth.docker.io`, `pypi.org`, `files.pythonhosted.org`, `registry.npmjs.org`, `objects.githubusercontent.com`, `raw.githubusercontent.com`), separately for IPv4 and IPv6 when available. Extra hosts can be appended via `INFINITO_NET_DEBUG_HOSTS=\"example.com api.example.org\" make diagnose-network`."
msgstr "Runs [_ _ main _ _ .py](../../../../cli/contributing/network/diagnose/__main__.py) inde i løbeturen `infinito` container og producerer en struktureret DNS / TCP / TLS / PMTU rapport mod standard infrastruktur værter (`github.com`, `ghcr.io`, `registry-1.docker.io`, `auth.docker.io`, `pypi.org`, `files.pythonhosted.org`, `registry.npmjs.org`, `objects.githubusercontent.com`, `raw.githubusercontent.com`), særskilt for IPv4 og IPv6 hvis det er muligt. Ekstra værter kan tilføjes via `INFINITO_NET_DEBUG_HOSTS=\"example.com api.example.org\" make diagnose-network`."

