# libretranslate
msgid "Snipe‑IT is an open‑source asset management system designed to streamline hardware and software inventory tracking. This deployment provides an automated, containerized solution using Docker Compose, centralized MariaDB database integration, and secure, configurable environment settings, including robust SMTP email support and pending SAML authentication enhancements."
msgstr "Snipe Budding IT er en open source asset management system designet til at strømline hardware og software inventar sporing. Denne implementering giver en automatisk, containerized løsning ved hjælp af Docker Compose, centraliseret MariaDB database integration, og sikre, konfigurerbare miljø indstillinger, herunder robust SMTP e-mail support og afventer SAML godkendelse forbedringer."

# libretranslate
msgid "So `meta/services.yml` MUST NOT have a top-level `services:` key wrapping its content. `meta/volumes.yml` MUST NOT have a top-level `volumes:` key, and the same rule applies to `meta/server.yml`, `meta/rbac.yml`, `meta/users.yml`, and `meta/info.yml`. The filename alone fixes the path prefix in the materialised application tree, which keeps consumer paths short and predictable (no redundant `compose.…` prefixes)."
msgstr "Så `meta/services.yml` MÅ IKKE have et topniveau `services:` nøgleindpakning dens indhold. `meta/volumes.yml` MÅ IKKE have et topniveau `volumes:` og samme regel gælder for `meta/server.yml`, `meta/rbac.yml`, `meta/users.yml`, og `meta/info.yml`. Filnavnet alene løser stiens præfiks i det materialiserede applikationstræe, som holder forbrugernes stier korte og forudsigelige (ikke overflødig `compose.…` præfikser)."

# libretranslate
msgid "So a conditional `\"{{ 'web-app-matomo' in group_names }}\"` edge pulls its provider into the static closure regardless of whether `web-app-matomo` is actually selected. The closure is the co-deploy superset."
msgstr "Så en betinget `\"{{ 'web-app-matomo' in group_names }}\"` kant trækker sin udbyder ind i den statiske lukning, uanset om `web-app-matomo` er faktisk valgt. Lukningen er det fælles supersæt."

# libretranslate
