# libretranslate
msgid "Swap is a host-kernel resource; see [svc-opt-swapfile](../../../../../roles/svc-opt-swapfile/) for why the in-stack swap role is intentionally skipped inside containers."
msgstr "Swap er en host- kernel ressource; se [svc-opt-swapfile](../../../../../roles/svc-opt-swapfile/) for hvorfor in-stack swap rolle er bevidst skippet inde containere."

# libretranslate
msgid "Swap size is a **fixed constant**, not a \"free space minus buffer\" calculation. An earlier version took ~99 GB on a 145 GB root partition, leaving so little headroom that later Docker layer writes (Playwright test image pull) failed with `no space left on device`. A fixed cap is large enough to absorb the peertube spike and small enough that Docker layer writes keep succeeding throughout the 30+ min deploy."
msgstr "Swap størrelse er en **fast konstant**, ikke \"ledig plads minus buffer\" beregning. En tidligere version tog ~99 GB på a 145 GB root partition, efterlader så lidt headroom, at senere Docker lag skriver (Afspilningstest- billedtræk) mislykkedes med `no space left on device`. En fast cap er stor nok til at absorbere peertube spike og lille nok, at Docker lag skriver holde lykkes i hele 30+ min deployering."

# libretranslate
msgid "Swap step MUST run **after** `actions/checkout` because the script lives inside the repo."
msgstr "Swap trin SKAL køre **efter** `actions/checkout` Fordi manuskriptet bor inde i repo."

# libretranslate
msgid "Swap step MUST run **before** any `make compose-up` / container build step so the expanded swap is active when heavy-allocation work begins."
msgstr "Swap trin SKAL køre **før** alle `make compose-up` / container bygge trin, så den udvidede swap er aktiv, når svær- tildeling arbejde begynder."

# libretranslate
msgid "Swap step SHOULD run **after** `jlumbroso/free-disk-space` so the reclaimed disk on `/` is also a candidate target when `/mnt` is crowded."
msgstr "Swap trin SKAL køre **efter** `jlumbroso/free-disk-space` så den regenererede disk på `/` er også et kandidatmål, når `/mnt` er overfyldt."

