# libretranslate
msgid "Swarm-test only (called by the swarm matrix after provision). In swarm an embedded per-app database (``shared: false``) resolves to a per-app mariadb whose volume is NFS-backed with no placement pin — InnoDB on NFS plus a free-floating task is unsupported (locking, split-brain). Embedded DBs are a compose-only pattern. Flipping every consumer's DB service to ``shared: true`` routes it to the central svc-db-* provider (as the baseline variant does), so no per-app DB is scheduled in swarm."
msgstr "Kun Swarm- test (kaldes af sværmmatrix efter levering). I sværm en indlejret per- app database (``shared: false``) løser til en per- app mariadb hvis volumen er NFS- understøttet med ingen placering pin - InnoDB på NFS plus en gratis-flydende opgave er ikke understøttet (låsning, split- hjerne). Indlejrede DBs er en komposit- kun mønster. Flippe hver forbrugers DB service til ``shared: true`` ruterne den til den centrale svcdb-* udbyder (som basisvarianten gør), så ingen per- app DB er planlagt i sværm."

# libretranslate
msgid "Swarm: the device grant renders in compose mode only, matching the cadvisor precedent, because `docker stack deploy` drops `devices`. An embodied device is single-node by definition, so this is consistent rather than a gap, but the swarm path of the agent roles is never exercised with the robot role present."
msgstr "Swarm: enheden tilskud gør kun i komposition tilstand, der matcher cadvisors præcedens, fordi `docker stack deploy` dråber `devices`. En indbygget enhed er enkelt-node pr. definition, så dette er konsekvent snarere end et hul, men sværm sti agent roller er aldrig udøves med robotten rolle til stede."

# libretranslate
