# libretranslate
msgid "Sweep the remaining confirmed server roles one at a time, keeping each role's README, credentials schema, `meta/server.yml` routing/health, and variants aligned."
msgstr "Sweep de resterende bekræftede server roller en ad gangen, holde hver rolles README, legitimationsskema, `meta/server.yml` routing / sundhed, og varianter justeret."

# libretranslate
msgid "Sweep the remaining roles one at a time: odoo, nextcloud, wordpress, mediawiki, xwiki, joomla, matrix (bridges), discourse, pretix, mattermost, desk-chromium, desk-firefox, desk-gnome, and desk-gnome-extensions. Keep each role's README, variants, and tests aligned. Leave the out-of-scope `db-extension` roles (mobilizon, bookwyrm) untouched."
msgstr "Sweep de resterende roller en ad gangen: odoo, nextcloud, wordpress, mediawiki, xwiki, joomla, matrix (broer), diskurs, pretix, matrix, desk-chromium, desk-firefox, desk-gnome, og desk-gnome-extensions. Hold hver rolles README, varianter, og tests afstemt. Lad det ude-af-anvendelsesområdet `db-extension` roller (mobilizon, bookwyrm) uberørt."

