# libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover Docker-specific semantics (images, tags, compose-service configuration). Generic compose-structure rules MUST live under `tests/integration/compose/`, and backup-related checks MUST live under `tests/integration/backups/`."
msgstr "Test i denne mappe SKAL kun dække Docker- specifikke semantik (billeder, tags, kompositservicekonfiguration). Generiske kompositstrukturregler SKAL leve under `tests/integration/compose/`, og backup- relateret kontrol SKAL leve under `tests/integration/backups/`."

# libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover GitHub-side CI/CD artefacts (workflows, Dependabot, PR helpers). Tests for local `make` targets, role logic, or non-CI scripts MUST live elsewhere under `tests/integration/`."
msgstr "Test i denne mappe SKAL kun dække GitHub- side CI / CD artefakter (workflows, Independabot, PR-hjælpere). Test for lokale `make` mål, rolle logik, eller ikke-CI scripts SKAL leve andre steder under `tests/integration/`."

# libretranslate
#, no-python-format, python-brace-format
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover Jinja-level concerns (template parsing, `{% include %}` resolution, variable reference/definition symmetry). Filter-plugin tests MUST live under `tests/integration/filters/`."
msgstr "Test i denne mappe SKAL kun dække Jinja- niveau problemer (skabelonfortolkning `{% include %}` opløsning, variabel reference / definitionssymmetri). Filter- plugin test SKAL leve under `tests/integration/filters/`."

