# libretranslate
msgid "The AT Protocol PDS, OAuth identity, and the login-broker sidecar pattern. atmo's \"sign in with Bluesky\" points here. The multi-entity `services.yml` (pds/web/view/broker/api) is the template for atmo's appview + worker-runtime split."
msgstr "AT- protokollen PDS, OAuth identitet, og login- mægler sidevogn mønster. atmo 's \"login med Bluesky\" Points her. Multienheden `services.yml` (pds/web/view/broker/api) er skabelonen for atmo appview + worker- runtime split."

# libretranslate
msgid "The AT→AP direction has a clean trigger (firehose) and a clean sink (GraphQL). The reverse direction needs an AT identity to write records as, which is unresolved."
msgstr "AT → AP-retningen har en ren udløser (brandslange) og en ren vask (GraphQL)Den modsatte retning kræver en AT-identitet at skrive optegnelser som, hvilket er uløst."

# libretranslate
msgid "The AUR PKGBUILDs this project consumes carry a checksum on a git source, which makepkg can only reject; integrity rests on the pinned upstream tag fetched over HTTPS."
msgstr "AUR PKGBUILDs dette projekt bruger bære et checksum på en git kilde, som Makepkg kun kan afvise; integritet hviler på den fæstnet opstrøms tag hentet over HTTPS."

# libretranslate
msgid "The AUR is one origin host with no mirror pool behind it, so a flap there lasts minutes rather than the seconds a pool member needs to rotate out; EXTERNAL_FETCH's ~40s window has been observed losing to a single flap."
msgstr "AUR er en oprindelsesvært uden spejl pool bag det, så en klap der varer minutter snarere end de sekunder et pool medlem har brug for at rotere ud; EXTERNAL_FETCH#40s vindue er blevet observeret tabe til en enkelt klap."

# libretranslate
msgid "The Ansible-level `plugins/` directory (filters, lookups, modules) is a different concept from the application-level `addons` topic. See the [plugins README](../../../../../plugins/README.md) for the distinction."
msgstr "Ansibel- niveau `plugins/` mappe (filtre, opslag, moduler) er et andet begreb end ansøgningsniveauet `addons` emne. Se [plugins README](../../../../../plugins/README.md) for sondringen."

# libretranslate
msgid "The Argos package index behind LibreTranslate offers 49 languages paired with English. 47 of them are ISO 639-1 codes; `pb` (Brazilian Portuguese) and `zt` (Traditional Chinese) are not and are out of scope. The remaining ISO languages have no model."
msgstr "Argos-pakkeindekset bagud LibreTranslate tilbud 49 sprog parret med engelsk. 47 af dem er ISO 639-1 koder `pb` (Brasiliansk portugisisk) og `zt` (Traditionel kinesisk) er ikke og er ude af rækkevidde. De øvrige ISO-sprog har ingen model."

# libretranslate
msgid "The Bash auto-allow path trusts the OS sandbox to confine commands. A missing or broken sandbox backend would cause auto-allow to approve unconfined commands."
msgstr "Bash auto- tillader sti stoler OS sandkassen til at begrænse kommandoer. En mangler eller brudt sandkasse bagende ville forårsage auto- tillade at godkende ubegrænsede kommandoer."

