# libretranslate
msgid "The Keycloak group tree behind these paths is materialised by a per-application group-ldap-mapper (roles/web-app-keycloak/tasks/update/05_per_app_mappers.yml), anchored at `/<group_root>/<application_id>` with `group.name.ldap.attribute=description`."
msgstr "Den Keycloak gruppe træ bag disse stier er materialiseret af en per- ansøgning group- ldap- mapper (roles/web-app-keycloak/tasks/update/05_per_app_mappers.yml), forankret ved `/<group_root>/<application_id>` med `group.name.ldap.attribute=description`."

# libretranslate
msgid "The Keycloak group tree is built by **per-application** `group-ldap-mapper`s. Each deployed application gets one mapper anchored at `/roles/<application_id>` whose LDAP filter `(&(objectClass=groupOfNames)(cn=<application_id>-*))` surfaces only that application's role groups. The mapper uses the LDAP `description` attribute as the visible Keycloak group name, so the resulting group paths carry no redundant prefix."
msgstr "Den Keycloak gruppe træ er bygget af **per- application** `group-ldap-mapper`s. Hver indsat applikation får en mapper forankret på `/roles/<application_id>` hvis LDAP- filter `(&(objectClass=groupOfNames)(cn=<application_id>-*))` kun dækker denne applikations rollegrupper. Korteren bruger LDAP `description` attribut som synlig Keycloak gruppenavn, så den resulterende gruppe stier bærer ingen overflødige præfiks."

