# libretranslate
msgid "The SPOT declaration with the scope's override merged over it."
msgstr "SPOT-erklæringen med rækkevidden er slået sammen."

# libretranslate
msgid "The SPOT is ``meta/services.yml.<primary_entity>.architectures``, next to ``modes``: both state what the role CAN do, which is why the deploy matrix narrows a row by them. ``meta/tests.yml`` is the other kind of statement - what CI should skip exercising - and an image that exists for one architecture only is not a testing preference."
msgstr "SPOT er ``meta/services.yml.<primary_entity>.architectures``, ved ``modes``: både angive, hvad rollen KAN gøre, hvilket er grunden til at indsætte matrix indsnævrer en række af dem. ``meta/tests.yml`` er den anden form for erklæring - hvad CI bør springe udøve - og et billede, der eksisterer for en arkitektur kun er ikke en test præference."

# libretranslate
msgid "The SPOT is ``meta/services.yml.<primary_entity>.modes.<mode>.enabled``. A missing ``modes`` block, a missing ``<mode>`` entry, or a missing ``enabled`` key all mean the role participates in that mode (default ``True``)."
msgstr "SPOT er ``meta/services.yml.<primary_entity>.modes.<mode>.enabled``. En savnet ``modes`` blok, en mangler ``<mode>`` indgang eller mangler ``enabled`` nøgle alle betyder rollen deltager i denne tilstand (standard ``True``)."

# libretranslate
msgid "The SPOT is parsed with a plain-string line parser instead of PyYAML: the env build runs during bootstrap (make install-system-python) before any Python dependency exists, so this module must stay stdlib-only. Only plain ``KEY: \"value\"`` entries can be read this way; a Jinja expression or a missing key is a hard error."
msgstr "SPOT er fortolket med en plain-streng linje parser i stedet for PyYAML: env build kører under bootstrap (make install- system- python) før Python afhængighed eksisterer, så dette modul skal forblive stdlib-kun. Kun almindelig ``KEY: \"value\"`` poster kan læses på denne måde; et Jinja udtryk eller en manglende nøgle er en hård fejl."

# libretranslate
msgid "The SSE session travels through the shared Redis channel layer, so the stream and the message POST may land on different replicas."
msgstr "SSE-sessionen rejser gennem den delte Redis kanal lag, så strømmen og meddelelsen POST kan lande på forskellige replikker."

# libretranslate
msgid "The SSO (``sociallogin``) and LDAP (``user_ldap``) login surfaces are covered by the OIDC/LDAP Playwright specs (requirements 017/018)."
msgstr "SSO (``sociallogin``) og LDAP (``user_ldap``) login overflader er dækket af OIDC / LDAP Playwright specs (krav 017/018)."

# libretranslate
msgid "The SSO (`sociallogin`) and LDAP (`user_ldap`) login surfaces are covered by the OIDC/LDAP Playwright specs (requirements 017/018)."
msgstr "SSO (`sociallogin`) og LDAP (`user_ldap`) login overflader er dækket af OIDC / LDAP Playwright specs (krav 017/018)."

# libretranslate
msgid "The SSO back-channel pin, added automatically. On an onion deployment the OIDC endpoints handed to an application are public ``.onion`` authorities. That is right for the browser, which reaches them through Tor, but unroutable for the application's own server-side calls (code-to-token exchange, JWKS, userinfo): a container resolves ``.onion`` through Tor's resolver, not through DNS. Pinning the provider to a reachable address sends those calls over the local network to the proxy that already serves the vhost. Skipped unless the application has SSO enabled and the provider vhost is an ``.onion`` name, so it is a no-op on clearnet."
msgstr "SSO bagkanalstift, tilføjet automatisk. På et løg implementering OIDC endepunkter givet til en ansøgning er offentlige ``.onion`` myndigheder. Det er rigtigt for browseren, som når dem gennem Tor, men unroutable for programmets egne server- side opkald (code- to- token udveksling, JWKS, userinfo): en beholder løser ``.onion`` gennem Tors resolver, ikke gennem DNS. Pinning udbyderen til en tilgængelig adresse sender disse opkald over det lokale netværk til proxy, der allerede tjener vhost. Skippet, medmindre programmet har SSO aktiveret, og udbyderen vhost er en ``.onion`` navn, så det er en no- op på clearnet."

# libretranslate
msgid "The Sphinx configuration, extensions and generators live in [web-app-docs](../../roles/web-app-docs/). Deploy that role to build and serve the site."
msgstr "Sfinx konfiguration, udvidelser og generatorer lever i [web-app-docs](../../roles/web-app-docs/). Udsæt den rolle til at bygge og tjene stedet."

# libretranslate
msgid "The URL reachability check emits warning annotations for HTTP `429`, `500`, and `503` (rate-limited or temporarily unavailable) via [`utils.annotations.message`](../../../../utils/annotations/message.py)."
msgstr "Kontrol af URL-adgang udsender advarsler til HTTP `429`, `500`, og `503` (Rate- begrænset eller midlertidigt utilgængelig) via [`utils.annotations.message`](../../../../utils/annotations/message.py)."

# libretranslate
msgid "The URL reachability check skips template placeholders and reserved local or example hosts such as `localhost` and `*.example`."
msgstr "URL-adgang kontrollere skips skabelon pladsholdere og reserveret lokale eller eksempel værter såsom `localhost` og `*.example`."

# libretranslate
msgid "The URL reachability check treats HTTP `401`, `403`, and `405` as reachable (auth-gated or method-restricted servers, not dead links)."
msgstr "Kontrol af webadresse behandler HTTP `401`, `403`, og `405` som opnåelig (autoriserede eller metodebegrænsede servere, ikke døde links)."

# libretranslate
msgid "The URL reachability check treats read and connect timeouts as warnings."
msgstr "Den URL-adgang check behandler læse og forbinde timeouts som advarsler."

# libretranslate
msgid "The YAML key is the semantic short name. Each entry value MAY carry ``name`` (the docker volume name); when absent and ``type`` is ``volume``, callers default the docker name to the semantic key."
msgstr "YAML-nøglen er det semantiske kortnavn. Hver indgangsværdi MAJ bære ``name`` (docker lydstyrkenavn); når fraværende og ``type`` er ``volume``, opkald standard docker navn til den semantiske nøgle."

# libretranslate
msgid "The Zammad helpdesk role completes its single-sign-on schema unification, with the variant matrix and Playwright test suite brought in line with the new shape."
msgstr "Den Zammad helpdesk rolle fuldender sin single-sign-on skema forening, med variant matrix og Playwright test suite bragt i overensstemmelse med den nye form."

# libretranslate
msgid "The [GitHub Actions self-hosted runner](https://docs.github.com/en/actions/hosting-your-own-runners/managing-self-hosted-runners/about-self-hosted-runners) is an agent that runs GitHub Actions workflow jobs on your own infrastructure instead of GitHub-hosted machines."
