msgstr "Den `GitHub Actions self-hosted runner <https://docs.github.com/en/actions/hosting-your-own-runners/managing-self-hosted-runners/about-self-hosted-runners>`__ er en agent, der kører GitHub Handlinger workflow job på din egen infrastruktur i stedet for GitHub-hostede maskiner."

# libretranslate
