msgstr "Den ``API`` kortlægning som angivet i group_vars SPOT."

# libretranslate
msgid "The ``INFINITO_DOMAIN`` fallback declared in ``default.env``."
msgstr "Den ``INFINITO_DOMAIN`` fallback anmeldt i ``default.env``."

# libretranslate
msgid "The ``Options`` rule is what keeps a swarm host with NFS-backed volumes on the live copy (see `NFS-backed volumes <#nfs-backed-volumes>`__): such a volume is a separate filesystem, so a snapshot of the data root would capture it as an empty directory and the backup would succeed while holding nothing. The declaration is checked rather than the mount table, because docker mounts those volumes lazily and unmounts them when the last container stops."
msgstr "Den ``Options`` regel er, hvad holder en sværm vært med NFS- støttede mængder på live kopi (Se `NFS-backed volumes <#nfs-backed-volumes>`__): sådan et volumen er en separat filsystem, så et øjebliksbillede af dateroden ville fange det som en tom mappe og backup ville lykkes, mens du holder intet. Erklæringen kontrolleres snarere end monteringstabellen, fordi docker monterer disse mængder dovenligt og afmonterer dem, når den sidste beholder stopper."

# libretranslate
msgid "The ``RUNNER_DISTRIBUTION`` variable selects distro-specific package installation tasks (Debian, Ubuntu, Arch Linux, or Fedora/EL). The role is designed to be driven by the ``make runner-ci-deploy`` target; see the end-to-end guide below."
msgstr "Den ``RUNNER_DISTRIBUTION`` variabel vælger distro- specifikke pakkeinstallationsopgaver (Debian, Ubuntu, Arch Linux, eller Fedora / EL). Rollen er designet til at blive drevet af ``make runner-ci-deploy`` mål; se slut- til- end vejledningen nedenfor."

# libretranslate
msgid "The ``administrator`` persona is **not** blocked: `tasks/04_admin.yml <./tasks/04_admin.yml>`__ seeds a native OpenProject account whose password is the Keycloak administrator secret, so the journey runs in every variant. The ``biber`` persona is blocked only in the ``sso: false`` variants — OpenProject is seeded with the administrator alone, and ``biber`` is auto-provisioned exclusively through the oauth2-proxy trusted-header bridge onto the LDAP auth source, which those variants remove. Both flags are declared explicitly in `templates/playwright.env.j2 <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__."
msgstr "Den ``administrator`` persona is **ikke** blokeret: `tasks/04_admin.yml <./tasks/04_admin.yml>`__ frø en indfødte OpenProject konto, hvis adgangskode er Keycloak administrator hemmelighed, så rejsen kører i hver variant. Den ``biber`` persona er kun blokeret i ``sso: false`` varianter - OpenProject er sået med administratoren alene, og ``biber`` udelukkende er selvforsynende gennem2-proxy trusted- header bro til LDAP auth kilde, som disse varianter fjerne. Begge flag er udtrykkeligt angivet i `templates/playwright.env.j2 <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__."

# libretranslate
msgid "The ``administrator`` persona is additionally blocked because this role never creates a BookWyrm staff account. ``files/sso/header_auth.py`` provisions proxied identities with ``create_user(...)`` and no ``is_staff`` flag, and no task promotes an existing account, so the administrator arrives as an ordinary member with no admin surface to exercise."
msgstr "Den ``administrator`` persona er desuden blokeret, fordi denne rolle aldrig skaber en BookWyrm personalekonto. ``files/sso/header_auth.py`` bestemmelser, der bekræfter identiteter med ``create_user(...)`` og ng ``is_staff`` flag, og ingen opgave fremmer en eksisterende konto, så administratoren ankommer som et almindeligt medlem uden admin overflade til motion."

# libretranslate
msgid "The ``administrator`` persona is blocked because Decidim’s admin is a Devise account seeded by ``files/ruby/ensure_admin_user.rb`` and Devise signs in by e-mail address. The role’s Playwright env therefore exposes ``ADMIN_EMAIL`` and no ``ADMIN_USERNAME``, which is the variable the shared admin helper reads."
msgstr "Den ``administrator`` persona er blokeret fordi Decidim's admin is a Device account seeded by ``files/ruby/ensure_admin_user.rb`` og Device tegn i via e-mail-adresse. Rollen er Playwright env derfor udsætter ``ADMIN_EMAIL`` og ng ``ADMIN_USERNAME``, som er variablen den delte admin hjælper læser."

# libretranslate
msgid "The ``administrator`` persona is blocked only while SSO is off. In that configuration ``PROXY_HEADER_SSO`` is false, so the trusted-header bridge is inactive and the sole account is the Django superuser bootstrapped by ``tasks/01_manager_ops.yml`` via ``files/bootstrap_admin.py``, whose identifier is the ORM ``username`` rather than the e-mail Baserow’s own sign-in form asks for. With SSO enabled the header bridge supplies the session and the persona runs."
msgstr "Den ``administrator`` persona er kun blokeret, mens SSO er slukket. I denne konfiguration ``PROXY_HEADER_SSO`` er falsk, så trusted- header bro er inaktiv og den eneste konto er Django superuser bootstrapped af ``tasks/01_manager_ops.yml`` via ``files/bootstrap_admin.py``, hvis identifikator er ORM ``username`` I stedet for e-mailen BaserowDet er en selvfølge. Med SSO aktiveret header bro leverer sessionen og persona kører."

# libretranslate
msgid "The ``biber`` and ``administrator`` Playwright personas are gated on ``services.sso.enabled``. When SSO is off, ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ renders ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``. Two reasons:"
msgstr "Den ``biber`` og ``administrator`` Playwright personas er gated on ``services.sso.enabled``. Når SSO er slukket, ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ renders ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``To grunde:"

# libretranslate
msgid "The ``biber`` persona logs in through OIDC without trouble; what it cannot do is log out. Decidim’s sign-out is a ``data-method`` link inside the account dropdown, so the role’s own tests navigate to ``/users/sign_out`` directly rather than clicking a button the shared helper could find."
msgstr "Den ``biber`` persona logger ind gennem OIDC uden problemer; hvad det ikke kan gøre, er at logge ud. Decidims signal- ud er en ``data-method`` link inde i kontoen dropdown, så rollens egne tests navigere til ``/users/sign_out`` direkte i stedet for at klikke på en knap den delte hjælper kunne finde."

# libretranslate
msgid "The ``context_agent`` and ``contextagentmcp`` services in ```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__ render only while ``mcp.enabled`` is true. The first runs ``ghcr.io/nextcloud/context_agent``, listens on its internal port for AppAPI only, and shares ``credentials.context_agent_app_secret`` with the ExApp registration as ``APP_SECRET``. The second is the adapter sidecar, built from the staged ``svc-ai-mcp-adapter`` context, read-only with every capability dropped, and it is the only MCP endpoint clients are given."
msgstr "Den ``context_agent`` og ``contextagentmcp`` tjenesteydelser i ```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__ render only while ``mcp.enabled`` is true. The first runs ``ghcr.io/nextcloud/context_agent``, listens on its internal port for AppAPI only, and shares ``credentials.context_agent_app_secret`` with the ExApp registration as ``APP_SECRET``. The second is the adapter sidecar, built from the staged ``svc-ai-mcp-adapter`` kontekst, read- only med hver kapacitet faldt, og det er den eneste MCP endpoint klienter er givet."

# libretranslate
msgid "The ``dashboard`` service in ``meta/services.yml`` is only a consumer tile pointing at MIG’s canonical domain; it does not host MIG. The role’s contract is fully carried by the reachability, canonical-domain and content-type scenarios in ``files/playwright/playwright.spec.js``, plus the guest persona. The path back to the generic personas is an authenticated MIG surface, which upstream does not have."
msgstr "Den ``dashboard`` service i ``meta/services.yml`` er kun en forbruger flise peger på MIG's canonical domæne; det er ikke vært MIGRollens kontrakt er fuldt ud udført af casability, kanonisk-domæne og indholdstype scenarier i ``files/playwright/playwright.spec.js``, plus gæsten persona. Vejen tilbage til den generiske personas er en bekræftet MIG overflade, som opstrøms ikke har."

