# libretranslate
msgid "The `sys-front-inj-logout` Ansible role automatically embeds a lightweight JavaScript snippet into your web application's HTML responses. This script identifies logout links, buttons, forms, and other elements, overrides their target URLs, and ensures users are redirected to a central OIDC logout endpoint, providing a consistent single sign‑out experience."
msgstr "Den `sys-front-inj-logout` Ansibel rolle automatisk integrerer en letvægts JavaScript snippet i din webapplikations HTML-svar. Dette script identificerer logout links, knapper, formularer og andre elementer, tilsidesætter deres mål URL 'er, og sikrer, at brugerne omdirigeres til en central OIDC logout endpoint, hvilket giver en konsekvent enkelt tegn out oplevelse."

# libretranslate
