# libretranslate
msgid "The `version:` MUST stay pinned to an exact Playwright version and distro pair such as `v1.59.1-noble`. You MUST NOT switch this to a mutable tag such as `latest`, because mutable upstream tags are more vulnerable to CDN propagation delays and make flaky CI failures much harder to reason about."
msgstr "Den `version:` SKAL forblive fastgjort til en præcis Playwright version og distro par såsom `v1.59.1-noble`. Du må ikke skifte til et muterbart mærke som `latest`, fordi muterbare opstrøms tags er mere sårbare over for CDN formering forsinkelser og gøre flaky CI fejl meget sværere at ræsonnere om."

# libretranslate
msgid "The `🛡️ Trusted` label flips the build source to the PR head and unlocks the Docker Hub credentials; without it the safe base merge ref is built with no organization secrets. Restrict who may set the label via repository label permissions / branch protection so only maintainers can grant it."
msgstr "Den `🛡️ Trusted` label vender bygningskilden til PR hoved og låser Docker Hub legitimation; uden det den sikre base fletning ref er bygget uden organisation hemmeligheder. Begræns hvem der kan sætte etiketten via lagermærkets tilladelser / filialbeskyttelse, så kun vedligeholdere kan give det."

# libretranslate
msgid "The `🧩 Subset` label must exist in the repository's label set and is applied through the PR labels UI. Both the `pull_request` and `pull_request_target` events carry a `labeled` trigger, so adding it starts a fresh run."
msgstr "Den `🧩 Subset` Etiketten skal være i lagerets etikette og påføres via PR-etiketterne UI. Begge `pull_request` og `pull_request_target` hændelser `labeled` udløser, så tilføjelse det starter en frisk løbetur."

# libretranslate
msgid "The access token paired with `DOCKERHUB_USERNAME`."
msgstr "Adgang token parret med `DOCKERHUB_USERNAME`."

# libretranslate
msgid "The action masks its own result: the fact is the whole rendered tree with every application's credentials, so it never reaches a log regardless of `MASK_CREDENTIALS_IN_LOGS`."
msgstr "Handlingen dækker over sit eget resultat: Det er hele det afleverede træ med hver applikations legitimation, så det aldrig når en log uanset `MASK_CREDENTIALS_IN_LOGS`."

# libretranslate
msgid "The active window has a default retention of 7 entries. A higher count is fine for short bursts of releases, but the active changelog SHOULD stay short enough that scrolling it is cheap."
msgstr "Det aktive vindue har en standardretention af 7 poster. En højere optælling er fint til korte udbrud, men den aktive changeland SKAL forblive kort nok til at rulle det er billigt."

# libretranslate
msgid "The actual app deploy runs inside a **sealed throwaway Docker daemon** and is torn down on exit, so the host's own stack is never touched. Several runners can share one host (or coexist with other workloads) safely."
msgstr "Den faktiske app implementering kører inde i en **forseglet throwaway Docker daemon** og bliver revet ned ved udgangen, så værtens egen stak aldrig bliver rørt. Flere løbere kan dele en vært (eller sameksistere med andre arbejdsbelastninger) I sikkerhed."

# libretranslate
msgid "The adapter `digest` pins nothing today. All ten `implementation: adapter` roles carry the identical placeholder `sha256:` followed by sixty-four zeros, the schema only checks that prefix, and nothing outside the tests reads the field: the running image is resolved through `lookup('container_image', …)` from `services.mcp-adapter.image`. The immutable-source guarantee is therefore declared and not in force, so a lint that rejects a placeholder digest MUST land together with real digests rather than before them."
msgstr "Adapteren `digest` Det giver intet i dag. Alle ti `implementation: adapter` roller bærer den identiske pladsholder `sha256:` efterfulgt af seks-fire nuller, skemaet kun kontrollerer, at præfikset, og intet uden for testene læser feltet: det kørende billede er løst gennem `lookup('container_image', …)` fra `services.mcp-adapter.image`. Den uforanderlige kilde garanti er derfor erklæret og ikke i kraft, så en flint, der afviser en pladsholder fordøje SKAL jord sammen med reelle fordampere snarere end før dem."

# libretranslate
msgid "The adapter is what bounds that. [`files/mcp/tools.json`](./files/mcp/tools.json) names the nine read tools of `calendar`, `contacts` and `files` — the three categories whose upstream `is_available` is unconditional, so the set does not vary with which optional apps a deployment installs. `svc-ai-mcp-adapter` refuses any tool outside that list and any tool marked `mutating` while `mutating_tools_enabled` is false, and it refuses to start at all if the contract's `schema_sha256` does not match the file. The refusal happens in the sidecar, so it holds for every client regardless of what each renders locally."
msgstr "Adapteren er hvad der begrænser det. [`files/mcp/tools.json`](./files/mcp/tools.json) navne de ni læse værktøjer af `calendar`, `contacts` og `files` - de tre kategorier, hvis opstrøms `is_available` er ubetinget, så sættet ikke varierer med hvilke valgfri apps en implementering installerer. `svc-ai-mcp-adapter` nægter ethvert værktøj uden for denne liste og ethvert værktøj markeret `mutating` mens `mutating_tools_enabled` er falsk, og det nægter at starte på alle, hvis kontrakten er `schema_sha256` matcher ikke filen. Afvisningen sker i sidevognen, så det holder for hver klient uanset hvad hver giver lokalt."

# libretranslate
msgid "The adapter is what bounds that. ```files/mcp/tools.json`` <./files/mcp/tools.json>`__ names the nine read tools of ``calendar``, ``contacts`` and ``files`` — the three categories whose upstream ``is_available`` is unconditional, so the set does not vary with which optional apps a deployment installs. ``svc-ai-mcp-adapter`` refuses any tool outside that list and any tool marked ``mutating`` while ``mutating_tools_enabled`` is false, and it refuses to start at all if the contract’s ``schema_sha256`` does not match the file. The refusal happens in the sidecar, so it holds for every client regardless of what each renders locally."
msgstr "Adapteren er hvad der begrænser det. ```files/mcp/tools.json`` <./files/mcp/tools.json>`__ names the nine read tools of ``calendar``, ``contacts`` and ``files`` — the three categories whose upstream ``is_available`` is unconditional, so the set does not vary with which optional apps a deployment installs. ``svc-ai-mcp-adapter`` refuses any tool outside that list and any tool marked ``mutating`` while ``mutating_tools_enabled`` is false, and it refuses to start at all if the contract’s ``schema_sha256`` matcher ikke filen. Afvisningen sker i sidevognen, så det holder for hver klient uanset hvad hver giver lokalt."

# libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The adapter presents `ADAPTER_UPSTREAM_KEY` to the provider in the header named by `ADAPTER_UPSTREAM_AUTH_HEADER` (default `Authorization`), formatted by `ADAPTER_UPSTREAM_AUTH_FORMAT` (default `Bearer {key}`, where `{key}` is the credential)."
msgstr "Adapteren præsenterer `ADAPTER_UPSTREAM_KEY` til udbyderen i overskriften navngivet af `ADAPTER_UPSTREAM_AUTH_HEADER` (standard `Authorization`), formateret ved `ADAPTER_UPSTREAM_AUTH_FORMAT` (standard `Bearer {key}`, hvor `{key}` er kreditværdien)."

# libretranslate
