# libretranslate
msgid "The administrator journey is covered bespoke in ``files/playwright/auth.spec.js``, which drives the native form and the ``module=Login&action=logout`` sign-out. The same file owns the deny-probe proving biber cannot reach the admin surface — the provider-side assertion the persona helpers deliberately no longer duplicate. The path back to the generic personas is a Keycloak client for Matomo plus group-driven user provisioning."
msgstr "Administratoren rejse er dækket skræddersyet i ``files/playwright/auth.spec.js``, som driver den indfødte form og ``module=Login&action=logout`` Sign-out. Den samme fil ejer denysonden bevise biber kan ikke nå admin overflade - den udbyderside påstand persona hjælpere bevidst ikke længere duplikere. Vejen tilbage til den generiske personas er en Keycloak klient til Matomo plus group- drevet brugerforsyning."

# libretranslate
msgid "The administrator journey is covered bespoke in ``files/playwright/playwright.spec.js``: the integrated OIDC path is proven at the STS ``AssumeRoleWithWebIdentity`` tier, and the LDAP variant additionally drives the Console form login and logout. The path back to the generic administrator persona is a Console build that surfaces the configured IdP on its login form."
msgstr "Administratoren rejse er dækket skræddersyet i ``files/playwright/playwright.spec.js``: Den integrerede OIDC-sti er dokumenteret ved STS ``AssumeRoleWithWebIdentity`` niveau, og LDAP variant desuden driver Console form login og logout. Vejen tilbage til den generiske administrator persona er en Console bygge, der dækker den konfigurerede IdP på sin login form."

# libretranslate
msgid "The administrator journey is covered bespoke in `files/playwright/auth.spec.js`, which drives the native form and the `module=Login&action=logout` sign-out. The same file owns the deny-probe proving biber cannot reach the admin surface — the provider-side assertion the persona helpers deliberately no longer duplicate. The path back to the generic personas is a Keycloak client for Matomo plus group-driven user provisioning."
msgstr "Administratoren rejse er dækket skræddersyet i `files/playwright/auth.spec.js`, som driver den indfødte form og `module=Login&action=logout` Sign-out. Den samme fil ejer denysonden bevise biber kan ikke nå admin overflade - den udbyderside påstand persona hjælpere bevidst ikke længere duplikere. Vejen tilbage til den generiske personas er en Keycloak klient til Matomo plus group- drevet brugerforsyning."

# libretranslate
msgid "The administrator journey is covered bespoke in `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`: the integrated OIDC path is proven at the STS `AssumeRoleWithWebIdentity` tier, and the LDAP variant additionally drives the Console form login and logout. The path back to the generic administrator persona is a Console build that surfaces the configured IdP on its login form."
msgstr "Administratoren rejse er dækket skræddersyet i `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`: Den integrerede OIDC-sti er dokumenteret ved STS `AssumeRoleWithWebIdentity` niveau, og LDAP variant desuden driver Console form login og logout. Vejen tilbage til den generiske administrator persona er en Console bygge, der dækker den konfigurerede IdP på sin login form."

