# libretranslate
msgid "The broader CI debugging workflow is documented in [ci.md](../../../contributing/actions/debugging/ci.md). You MUST NOT proceed with partial coverage."
msgstr "Den bredere CI debugging arbejdsgang er dokumenteret i [ci.md](../../../contributing/actions/debugging/ci.md). Du må ikke fortsætte med delvis dækning."

# libretranslate
msgid "The broker MUST receive `X-Forwarded-User`, `X-Forwarded-Preferred-Username`, and `X-Forwarded-Email` from `oauth2-proxy`. On a user's first authenticated visit the broker calls the PDS `com.atproto.server.createAccount` endpoint with a synthesised app-password, encrypts that password with AES-256-GCM under a key from the project's credentials vault, and caches the ciphertext in the broker's in-process `sessionCache` keyed by Keycloak username. Subsequent visits decrypt the cached password in-broker, exchange it for a PDS session via `com.atproto.server.createSession`, and seed `localStorage[\"BSKY_STORAGE\"]` so the social-app finds an authenticated session at boot. A broker restart drops the cache; the next SSO visit triggers a fresh `createAccount` and the previous app-password remains valid in PDS until rotated."
msgstr "Mægleren skal modtage `X-Forwarded-User`, `X-Forwarded-Preferred-Username`, og `X-Forwarded-Email` fra `oauth2-proxy`. På en brugers første autentificerede besøg ringer mægleren til PDS `com.atproto.server.createAccount` endepunkt med et syntetiseret app- password, krypterer dette password med AES-256-GCM under en nøgle fra projektets legitimationsboks, og caches cifertekst i mæglerens in- proces `sessionCache` keyed by Keycloak brugernavn. Efterfølgende besøg dekryptere cached password in- mægler, udveksle det til en PDS session via `com.atproto.server.createSession`, og frø `localStorage[\"BSKY_STORAGE\"]` så social- app 'en finder en bekræftet session på boot. En mægler genstarte falder cachen; det næste SSO besøg udløser en frisk `createAccount` og den tidligere app- adgangskode forbliver gyldig i PDS indtil roteret."

