msgid "The config-bearing Nextcloud apps are declared in ```meta/addons/`` <./meta/addons/>`__ under the unified addon contract (requirement 026). Each declaration carries its full ``occ config:app:set`` payload under ``config:``. The enable-only appstore apps stay under ``nextcloud.plugins`` in ```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__."
msgstr "Konfigurationen Nextcloud apps deklareres i ```meta/addons/`` <./meta/addons/>`__ under the unified addon contract (requirement 026). Each declaration carries its full ``occ config:app:set`` payload under ``config:``. The enable-only appstore apps stay under ``nextcloud.plugins`` in ```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`Det er en god idé."

# libretranslate
msgid "The configured relay host, the loopback address, the container's alias for its host, or a swarm manager."
msgstr "Den konfigurerede relævært, smutmadressen, containerens alias for sin vært, eller en sværm manager."

# libretranslate
msgid "The constructor stage renders once through the [applications_carrier](../../../../../../plugins/action/applications_carrier.py) action and parks the result together with its cache key in the host fact `_INFINITO_APPLICATIONS_RENDERED` (the action calls `lookup('applications', carrier=True)`). Every later worker inherits that fact at fork time; `get_merged_applications` serves it whenever the key still matches and renders only when it does not (a changed `applications`, `users`, `DOMAIN_PRIMARY` or `SYSTEM_EMAIL_DOMAIN`)."
msgstr "Konstruktorscenen gør en gang gennem [applications_carrier](../../../../../../plugins/action/applications_carrier.py) handling og parkerer resultatet sammen med sin cache nøgle i værten faktum `_INFINITO_APPLICATIONS_RENDERED` (Aktionen kalder `lookup('applications', carrier=True)`)Hver senere arbejder arver dette faktum ved gaffeltid; `get_merged_applications` tjener det, når nøglen stadig matcher og giver kun, når det ikke (a ændret `applications`, `users`, `DOMAIN_PRIMARY` eller `SYSTEM_EMAIL_DOMAIN`)."

# libretranslate
msgid "The consumer role asserts only that `/metrics` is reachable at the documented path (where applicable). Prometheus admin-reach, biber denial, and per-consumer `up=1` verification live in `web-app-prometheus/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` only, parameterised over `PROMETHEUS_TARGET_ROLES_JSON`."
msgstr "Forbrugerens rolle hævder kun, at `/metrics` kan nås på den dokumenterede sti (i givet fald). Prometheus admin- reach, biber benægtelse, og per- forbruger `up=1` verificering `web-app-prometheus/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` Kun til parameterbehandlet `PROMETHEUS_TARGET_ROLES_JSON`."

# libretranslate
msgid "The consumer role asserts only that the matomo tracking snippet is in the HTML and that navigation generates the expected `/matomo.php` request (covered by `assertCspInjections` in the persona-helper). Matomo admin-reach, biber denial, and per-consumer tracker-site registration live in `web-app-matomo/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` only."
msgstr "Forbrugeren rolle hævder kun, at matomo tracking snippet er i HTML, og at navigation genererer den forventede `/matomo.php` anmodning (omfattet af `assertCspInjections` i personhjælperen). Matomo admin- reach, biber benægtelse, og per- forbruger tracker-site registrering live i `web-app-matomo/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` Kun."

# libretranslate
msgid "The consumer role's spec does NOT exercise the dashboard tile. `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` parameterises one tile-reachability test per consumer over `DASHBOARD_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` and delegates the body to `runDashboardCardScenario(page, context, target)` from the sibling `dashboard-card-flow.js` SPOT (tile visibility, click → `#main iframe` embed, header \"Tab\" button → new browser tab). Consumer specs MUST NOT reimplement any tile / iframe / tab assertions."
msgstr "Forbrugerens rolle spec udøver IKKE instrumentbrættets flise. `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` parameterises one tile- reachability test per consumer over `DASHBOARD_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` og uddelegerer organet til `runDashboardCardScenario(page, context, target)` fra søskende `dashboard-card-flow.js` SPOT (flise synlighed, klik → `#main iframe` indlejret, header \"Tab\" knap → ny browser- faneblad). Forbrugerspecs må ikke genimplementere nogen flise / iframe / fane påstande."

# libretranslate
msgid "The consumer's ``services.<engine>`` block (or empty)."
msgstr "Forbrugerens ``services.<engine>`` blok (eller tom)."

# libretranslate
msgid "The container name and DNS alias within the `central_mariadb` network. Used by other services (like Moodle) to connect."
msgstr "Beholderens navn og DNS alias i `central_mariadb` netværk. Bruges af andre tjenester (som Moodle) at forbinde."

# libretranslate
msgid "The control databases are dropped: they exist in every cluster and are not deployed as applications, so nothing consumes them."
msgstr "Kontroldatabaserne droppes: De findes i alle klynger og anvendes ikke som applikationer, så intet forbruger dem."

