# libretranslate
msgid "The current `roles/web-app-matrix/` ships a self-contained compose stack with Synapse, Element, a handful of bridges and a ChatGPT bot. Adding a new bridge or service today means hand-rolling its compose service, env file, postgres seed, well-known entries and Playwright coverage inside this repo — the marginal cost per bridge is high, and the matrix-docker-ansible-deploy (MDAD) upstream community already maintains all of that under one umbrella role."
msgstr "Den aktuelle `roles/web-app-matrix/` sender en selvbehersket komposition stack med Synapse, Element, en håndfuld broer og en ChatGPT bot. Tilføjelse af en ny bro eller service i dag betyder hånd- rullende sin komposition service, env-fil, postgres frø, velkendte poster og Playwright dækning inde i denne repo - den marginale omkostninger pr. bro er høj, og matrix- docker-ansible- deployering (MDAD) Opstrøms samfund allerede opretholder alt dette under én paraply rolle."

# libretranslate
msgid "The current statement that Flowise lacks an instance-level registry is incorrect for the pinned version and MUST be removed from requirement 025 and the role README. The deployment MUST use the authenticated `/api/v1/custom-mcp-servers` routes with a scoped API identity whose workspace permissions are limited to the required `tools:create`, `tools:view`, `tools:update`, and `tools:delete` operations."
msgstr "Den nuværende erklæring, at Flowise mangler en instance-level register er forkert for den fæstede version og SKAL fjernes fra kravet 025 og rollen som README. Indsættelsen SKAL bruge den godkendte `/api/v1/custom-mcp-servers` ruter med en scoped API identitet, hvis arbejdsrumstilladelse er begrænset til det krævede `tools:create`, `tools:view`, `tools:update`, og `tools:delete` operationer."

# libretranslate
msgid "The dashboard sits behind proxy + Keycloak OIDC (Decision #9); voice/chat connectors are the follow-up (Decision #10)."
msgstr "Dashboardet sidder bag proxy + Keycloak OIDC (Afgørelse #9); voice / chat-konnektorer er opfølgningen (Afgørelse #10)."

# libretranslate
msgid "The dashboard's `web-app-dashboard/lookup_plugins/docker_cards.py` reads `logo.class` and `display` from this location, while `description` and `galaxy_tags` continue to come from `galaxy_info` (Galaxy-spec fields)."
msgstr "Dashboardens `web-app-dashboard/lookup_plugins/docker_cards.py` læser `logo.class` og `display` fra dette sted, mens `description` og `galaxy_tags` fortsat kommer fra `galaxy_info` (Galaxy- spec- felter)."

