msgid "The declared codes, empty when the app declares none for this domain."
msgstr "De angivne koder, tomme når appen erklærer ingen for dette domæne."

# libretranslate
msgid "The declared keys mapped to their codes, dropping keys that declare nothing usable."
msgstr "De erklærede nøgler kortlagt til deres koder, droppe nøgler, der erklærer intet brugbart."

# libretranslate
msgid "The dedicated oauth2-proxy provider role (its directory under *roles/*) is deleted; the 5 sidecar templates and the per-consumer render task fold into **web-app-keycloak** (*templates/sso_proxy/*, *tasks/sso_proxy.yml*). **web-app-keycloak** now declares **provides: sso**."
msgstr "Den dedikerede oauth2-proxy udbyder rolle (dens mappe under *roller /*) udgår. 5 sidekar skabeloner og per- forbruger gøre opgave fold ind **web-app-keycloak** (*Skabeloner /sso_proxy/*, *tasks/sso_proxy.yml*). **web-app-keycloak** erklærer nu **giver: sso**."

# libretranslate
msgid "The default `gh api` verb is GET (read-only). Specifying `-X` or `--method` always indicates a write (POST/PATCH/DELETE/PUT), so the prompt forces a per-call review. PUT and DELETE are blocked outright by `deny`; POST and PATCH land here."
msgstr "Standard `gh api` verbum er GET (read- only). Specificerer `-X` eller `--method` angiver altid en skrive (POST/PATCH/DELETE/PUT), så prompten tvinger en per- call gennemgang. PUT og DELETE blokeres direkte af `deny`; POST og PATCH land her."

# libretranslate
msgid "The default configuration in ``meta/services.yml`` builds the Hugo documentation:"
msgstr "Standardkonfigurationen i ``meta/services.yml`` bygger Hugo dokumentation:"

