# libretranslate
msgid "The generic playwright biber and administrator personas are blocked via `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true` in `templates/playwright.env.j2` (req 019 Rule 11 explicit opt-out). Bluesky's social-app is a mobile-first SPA whose logout / account control sits behind a profile menu the auth-surface check cannot reach. The bespoke \"OIDC: oauth2-proxy + login-broker drop a Bluesky session into social-app via Keycloak (variant A+)\" test and its LDAP-variant counterpart in `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` already verify both personas authenticate correctly (BSKY_STORAGE.accessJwt is present after the broker handoff). Once a stable selector for the social-app profile menu lands upstream, drop the opt-outs and let the persona helpers drive the dashboard → app → logout journey end-to-end."
msgstr "Den generiske playwright biber og administrator personas er blokeret via `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` og `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true` til `templates/playwright.env.j2` (req 019 Artikel 11 eksplicit opt- out). Blueskys sociale-app er en mobil-første SPA, hvis logout / konto kontrol sidder bag en profilmenu auth- overflade check ikke kan nå. Den bespoke \"OIDC: oauth2-proxy + login- mægler drop a Bluesky session i social-app via Keycloak (variant A +)\" test og dens LDAP- variant modstykke i `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` allerede kontrollere begge personas autentificering korrekt (BSKY_STORAGE.accessJwt er til stede efter mægleroverdragelsen). Når en stabil vælger for den sociale-app profil menu lander opstrøms, drop opt- outs og lad persona hjælpere køre dashboard → app → logout rejse end-to-end."

