# libretranslate
msgid "The journey itself is not dropped. [`files/playwright/test-admin-native.js`](./files/playwright/test-admin-native.js) drives it through Shopware's own selectors: an authenticated backend assertion, then logout through the user-actions toggle and back to the login form. `SSO_SERVICE_ENABLED` selects how it signs in — through the `a.heptacom-admin-open-auth--button` provider link that AdminOpenAuth appends into `.sw-login__content` when SSO is on, through the native password form when it is off. The `guest` persona and the role-local reachability, TLS and HSTS assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "Selve rejsen er ikke tabt. [`files/playwright/test-admin-native.js`](./files/playwright/test-admin-native.js) Kører det igennem Shopwareegne vælger: en bekræftet bagende påstand, derefter logge ud gennem bruger- handlinger skifte og tilbage til login form. `SSO_SERVICE_ENABLED` vælger hvordan det signalerer i - gennem `a.heptacom-admin-open-auth--button` udbyder link, som Administrer OpenAuth afhænger `.sw-login__content` når SSO er tændt, gennem den indfødte kodeord form, når det er slukket. Den `guest` persona og de role- lokale modtagelighed, TLS og HSTS påstande kører betingelsesløst."

# libretranslate
msgid "The journey itself is not dropped. [`files/playwright/test-native-login.js`](./files/playwright/test-native-login.js) drives both personas through Funkwhale's own chain: `/login`, the Keycloak round trip whenever the proxy gates that route, then Funkwhale's own sign-in form, an authenticated-surface assertion, and sign-out back to the anonymous state. It is skipped when `services.ldap.enabled` is false, because no persona holds a Funkwhale account in that variant. The `guest` persona and the baseline assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "Selve rejsen er ikke tabt. [`files/playwright/test-native-login.js`](./files/playwright/test-native-login.js) Kører både personas igennem Funkwhaleegen kæde: `/login`, Keycloak rundtur, når proxy gates denne rute, så FunkwhaleDet er en bekræftet påstand og et tegn tilbage til den anonyme stat. Det er sprunget over når `services.ldap.enabled` er falsk, fordi ingen persona holder en Funkwhale konto i den variant. Den `guest` persona og baseline påstande kører betingelsesløst."

