# libretranslate
msgid "The persona flags are declared in [templates/playwright.env.j2](./templates/playwright.env.j2). `administrator` is blocked only in the `sso: false` variants: as described above, Postmarks' sole native credential is the single shared `ADMIN_KEY` password form, which is not the Keycloak administrator secret the persona types, so without the trusted-header bridge there is no admin login to drive. `biber` is blocked in every variant — the oauth2-proxy admits only the application's administrator RBAC group and the bridge re-checks `X-Forwarded-Groups`, so `biber` is denied before Postmarks is reached, and with SSO off the only credential left belongs to no user account."
msgstr "Persona flag er angivet i [templates/playwright.env.j2](./templates/playwright.env.j2). `administrator` er kun blokeret i `sso: false` varianter: som beskrevet ovenfor Postmarks'enlig native credential er den fælles `ADMIN_KEY` password form, som ikke er Keycloak administrator hemmelige persona typer, så uden trusted- header bro er der ingen admin login til at køre. `biber` er blokeret i hver variant - den oauth2-proxy indrømmer kun ansøgningens administrator RBAC gruppe og broen re- checks `X-Forwarded-Groups`, så `biber` er nægtet før Postmarks er nået, og med SSO off den eneste kredit venstre tilhører ingen brugerkonto."

# libretranslate
msgid "The persona flags are declared in `templates/playwright.env.j2 <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__. ``administrator`` is blocked only in the ``sso: false`` variants: as described above, Postmarks’ sole native credential is the single shared ``ADMIN_KEY`` password form, which is not the Keycloak administrator secret the persona types, so without the trusted-header bridge there is no admin login to drive. ``biber`` is blocked in every variant — the oauth2-proxy admits only the application’s administrator RBAC group and the bridge re-checks ``X-Forwarded-Groups``, so ``biber`` is denied before Postmarks is reached, and with SSO off the only credential left belongs to no user account."
msgstr "Persona flag er angivet i `templates/playwright.env.j2 <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__. ``administrator`` er kun blokeret i ``sso: false`` varianter: som beskrevet ovenfor Postmarks'enlig native credential er den fælles ``ADMIN_KEY`` password form, som ikke er Keycloak administrator hemmelige persona typer, så uden trusted- header bro er der ingen admin login til at køre. ``biber`` er blokeret i hver variant - den oauth2-proxy indrømmer kun ansøgningens administrator RBAC gruppe og broen re- checks ``X-Forwarded-Groups``, så ``biber`` er nægtet før Postmarks er nået, og med SSO off den eneste kredit venstre tilhører ingen brugerkonto."

# libretranslate
msgid "The persona scenarios MUST drive the journey from [Three personas, fixed flow](#three-personas-fixed-flow-) end to end. Per-service contract tests MUST exercise the [per-service assertion catalogue](#per-service-assertion-catalogue-) entry that matches their gated service. The [test_no_stub_tests.py](../../../../../tests/lint/ansible/roles/web-app/playwright/test_no_stub_tests.py) lint hard-fails the build when a stub is detected, so the rule is enforced automatically."
