# libretranslate
msgid "The repository prefers many focused parts over one giant playbook."
msgstr "Lageret foretrækker mange fokuserede dele frem for en kæmpe spillebog."

# libretranslate
msgid "The repository snapshot evaluated for this requirement contains 172 roles with a literal `application_id` and 18 role-local `mcp:` blocks. The audit below classifies every one of those 172 roles exactly once. The snapshot is planning evidence, not a second runtime registry: implemented surfaces remain authoritative in each role's `meta/services.yml`, while a generated lint test MUST prove that every current `application_id` still has a disposition."
msgstr "Depositsnapshot, der er evalueret for dette krav, indeholder 172 roller med en bogstavelig `application_id` og 18 role-local `mcp:` blokke. Revisionen nedenfor klassificerer hver enkelt af disse 172 roller præcis én gang. Snapshot er planlægning beviser, ikke en anden runtime register: implementerede overflader forbliver autoritative i hver rolles `meta/services.yml`, mens en genereret flinttest SKAL bevise, at hver strøm `application_id` Har stadig en disposition."

# libretranslate
msgid "The repository working tree stays clean (no `vendor/` checked in) and the host MUST NOT need a PHP or Composer installation."
msgstr "Lageret arbejder træ forbliver ren (ng `vendor/` markeret i) og værten må IKKE have brug for en PHP- eller Komponist installation."

# libretranslate
msgid "The repository working tree. Required for any code change."
msgstr "Lageret arbejder på træet. Krævet for alle kodeændringer."

