msgstr ""

# libretranslate
msgid "The resolved block replaces the mapping rather than being written into it. ``_build_role_base_config`` parks the YAML cache's own object under ``mcp``, so an in-place write would inject these keys into every later raw read of ``meta/mcp.yml``."
msgstr "Den løste blok erstatter kortlægningen i stedet for at blive skrevet ind i den. ``_build_role_base_config`` parkerer YAML cache 's eget objekt under ``mcp``, så en in- sted skrive ville injicere disse nøgler i hver senere rå læse af ``meta/mcp.yml``."

# libretranslate
msgid "The result MUST be visually appealing and pleasant for humans to look at."
msgstr "Resultatet SKAL være visuelt tiltalende og behageligt for mennesker at se på."

# libretranslate
msgid "The result MUST feel like one coherent brand theme, not a collection of unrelated overrides."
msgstr "Resultatet SKAL føles som et sammenhængende mærke tema, ikke en samling af uafhængige tilsidesættelser."

# libretranslate
msgid "The result feeds the web-svc-mirror privacy proxy: the mirror's nginx vhost whitelists exactly these hosts as proxy upstreams, and the body-filter rewrite maps `https://<host>/...` to `<mirror>/<host>/...` in served HTML."
msgstr "Resultatet fodrer web-svc-mirror privacy proxy: spejlet 's nginx vhost whitelists præcis disse værter som proxy upstreams, og body- filter omskrive kort `https://<host>/...` til `<mirror>/<host>/...` i serveret HTML."

# libretranslate
msgid "The result is a complete, reproducible domain rollout in a single playbook task."
msgstr "Resultatet er en komplet, reproducerbar domæne udrulning i en enkelt playbook opgave."

# libretranslate
msgid "The result is canonical_domains_map(applications, DOMAIN_PRIMARY). Per-app domain declarations live in `applications.<app>.domains` (canonical/aliases) and flow through the regular applications-merge pipeline."
msgstr "Resultatet er canonical_domains_map(ansøgninger DOMAIN_PRIMARY). Per- app domæneerklæringer live i `applications.<app>.domains` (kanoniske / aliaser) og strømme gennem den regelmæssige applications- fletning rørledning."

# libretranslate
msgid "The resulting snippets cover every shared provider in the variant's closure, so the deploy stage finds the required `applications.<provider>.secrets.credentials` block in the inventory and `lookup('config', '<provider>', 'secrets.credentials.<key>')` succeeds."
msgstr "De resulterende snuppets dækker hver delt udbyder i variantens lukning, så deployering fase finder det nødvendige `applications.<provider>.secrets.credentials` blok i fortegnelsen og `lookup('config', '<provider>', 'secrets.credentials.<key>')` Det lykkes."

# libretranslate
msgid "The resume offset a retrigger computes names a `role#variant` and carries no axes, because every axis rotates with the sweep number and a retrigger receives a fresh one."
msgstr "CV 'et opvejer en genudløser beregner navne a `role#variant` og bærer ingen økser, fordi hver akse roterer med fejenummeret og en genudløser modtager en ny."

# libretranslate
msgid "The returned token names a place in the ranking, so it carries no axes, and neither does the membership test behind it (:func:`proven_rows`): the source run recorded its combinations under its own sweep number and the retrigger gets a fresh one, so comparing them row by row is the only comparison that survives the rotation."
msgstr "Den returnerede token navngiver en plads i ranglisten, så det bærer ingen akser, og heller ikke medlemskab test bag det (:func:`proven_rows`): Kilden køre registreret sine kombinationer under sit eget feje nummer og genudløser får en ny, så sammenligning dem række for række er den eneste sammenligning, der overlever rotation."

# libretranslate
msgid "The reusable generator logic lives in `utils/domains/list.py`"
msgstr "Den genanvendelige generator logik lever i `utils/domains/list.py`"

# libretranslate
msgid "The reverse closure is fail-safe: any seed that is not modellable in the resolver (no `application_id` and not referenced by any role's `run_after`) MUST trigger a fall-back to a full deploy, as MUST any resolver runtime error. The closure MUST NOT silently shrink the deploy matrix on partial information. The variant narrowing follows the same rule: a role reached only through a `run_after` edge (which the round closure does not follow) keeps every variant, and so does a seed role itself, whose own files changed."
msgstr "Den omvendte lukning er fejlsikret: ethvert frø, der ikke kan moduleres i resolveren (ng `application_id` og ikke refereret af nogen rolles `run_after`) SKAL udløse et fald-tilbage til en fuld implementering, som SKAL alle resolver runtime fejl. Lukningen må ikke dæmpe deployeringsmatrixen i stilhed ved delvis information. Varianten indsnævring følger samme regel: en rolle nået kun gennem en `run_after` kant (som den runde lukning ikke følger) holder hver variant, og så gør en frø rolle selv, hvis egne filer ændret."

# libretranslate
msgid "The reverse closure is implemented in [affected resolver](../../../../cli/meta/roles/applications/resolution/affected/__main__.py) and invoked from [affected_roles.sh](../../../../scripts/meta/resolve/diff/affected_roles.sh). The workflow glue lives in [effective_whitelist.sh](../../../../scripts/github/resolve/effective_whitelist.sh)."
msgstr "Den modsatte lukning er gennemført i [berørt resolver](../../../../cli/meta/roles/applications/resolution/affected/__main__.py) og påberåbt fra [affected_roles.sh](../../../../scripts/meta/resolve/diff/affected_roles.sh). Arbejdsgangen lim bor i [effective_whitelist.sh](../../../../scripts/github/resolve/effective_whitelist.sh)."

# libretranslate
msgid "The right choice should be easiest."
msgstr "Det rigtige valg bør være lettest."

# libretranslate
msgid "The role MUST NOT solve internal connectivity by globally disabling SSRF protection for all flow authors. If the exact pinned Flowise release cannot keep `HTTP_SECURITY_CHECK=true` for internal service DNS, the MCP workspace MUST be admin-only, egress MUST be restricted to a fixed-target MCP proxy, redirects MUST be disabled, DNS resolution MUST be revalidated at connection time, and network policy MUST prevent access to loopback, link-local metadata, unrelated application networks, and the container control plane."
msgstr "Rollen SKAL IKKE løse intern forbindelse ved globalt at deaktivere SSRF beskyttelse for alle flow forfattere. Hvis Flowise frigivelse kan ikke holde `HTTP_SECURITY_CHECK=true` For intern service DNS, MCP arbejdsområde skal admin- only, egress SKAL være begrænset til en fixed- target MCP proxy, omdirigeringer skal være deaktiveret, DNS opløsning skal revalideres på tilslutningstidspunktet, og netværkspolitik skal forhindre adgang til smutback, link-lokale metadata, uafhængige applikationsnetværk, og containerkontrolplanet."

# libretranslate
msgid "The role MUST build its own Flowise image from the pinned npm package. The published `flowiseai/flowise` tags `3.1.3`, `3.1.4` and `latest` all ship the `flowise` package at version 3.1.2, which serves none of the `custom-mcp-servers`, `mcp-server` or `mcp-endpoint` routes; upstream's Dockerfile runs an unpinned `npm install -g flowise` whose layer the release CI reuses across builds. The deployed version therefore MUST come from `npm install -g flowise@<version>`, and the served route set MUST be verified rather than inferred from the tag."
msgstr "Rollen SKAL bygge sin egen Flowise billede fra npm-pakken. Den offentliggjorte udgave `flowiseai/flowise` mærker `3.1.3`, `3.1.4` og `latest` alle skibe `flowise` pakke i version 3.1.2, som ikke tjener nogen af de `custom-mcp-servers`, `mcp-server` eller `mcp-endpoint` ruter; opstrøms Dockerfile kører en unfilled `npm install -g flowise` hvis lag udgivelsen CI genbruger på tværs bygger. Den valgte version SKAL derfor komme fra `npm install -g flowise@<version>`, og den serverede rute sæt SKAL kontrolleres snarere end udledes fra mærket."

# libretranslate
msgid "The role MUST deploy cleanly under all four variants on a fresh box. V1 (ansible all-on) MUST additionally pass the biber + administrator Playwright personas plus the new `test-element-call` + `test-bridge-roster` specs."
msgstr "Rollen SKAL indsættes rent under alle fire varianter på en frisk boks. V1 (ansible all- on) SKAL desuden passere biber + administrator Playwright personas plus den nye `test-element-call` + `test-bridge-roster` specs."

# libretranslate
msgid "The role MUST deploy cleanly under all three variants on a fresh box. V1 (sso + ldap) and V3 (ldap-only) additionally MUST pass the biber + administrator Playwright personas."
msgstr "Rollen SKAL indsættes rent under alle tre varianter på en frisk boks. V1 (sso + ldap) og V3 (Alda- kun) desuden SKAL passere biber + administrator Playwright personas."

# libretranslate
msgid "The role MUST follow the standard role-meta layout described in [layout.md](../contributing/design/role/services/layout.md) (`meta/services.yml`, `meta/secrets.yml`, `meta/volumes.yml`, `meta/variants.yml`, `meta/info.yml`, `meta/main.yml`). [web-app-openproject](../../roles/web-app-openproject/) is the closest structural model — it combines PostgreSQL, a Redis `cache` service, background workers, an internal proxy, Keycloak SSO and LDAP — and SHOULD be used as the primary reference; [web-app-taiga](../../roles/web-app-taiga/) and [web-app-confluence](../../roles/web-app-confluence/) are secondary references."
msgstr "Rollen SKAL følge standard role- meta layout beskrevet i [layout.md](../contributing/design/role/services/layout.md) (`meta/services.yml`, `meta/secrets.yml`, `meta/volumes.yml`, `meta/variants.yml`, `meta/info.yml`, `meta/main.yml`). [web-app-openproject](../../roles/web-app-openproject/) er den nærmeste strukturelle model - den kombinerer PostgreSQL, a Redis `cache` service, baggrundsarbejdere, en intern stedfortræder Keycloak SSO og LDAP - OG MÅ anvendes som primær reference; [web-app-taiga](../../roles/web-app-taiga/) og [web-app-confluence](../../roles/web-app-confluence/) er sekundære referencer."

