msgstr "Rollen er en systemd service og timer, der udfører CSP kravler regelmæssigt mod alle NGINX domæner."

# libretranslate
msgid "The role configures and deploys a containerized PhpMyAdmin instance using Docker Compose. It optionally integrates with a central database and uses dynamic Ansible variables to support flexible deployments in both production and homelab environments."
msgstr "Rollen er og implementerer en containerized PhpMyAdmin instans, der bruger Docker ComposeDen integrerer eventuelt med en central database og bruger dynamiske Anible variabler til at understøtte fleksible installationer i både produktions- og homelab-miljøer."

# libretranslate
msgid "The role deploys a single ``registry:2`` instance in pull-through proxy mode on its inventory group’s host. Because the group typically holds exactly one host (the swarm manager), ``DEPLOYMENT_MODE`` resolves to ``compose`` for the role; multi-host fan-out for the cache itself is out of scope for v1."
msgstr "Den rolle, som en enkelt ``registry:2`` tilfælde i pull- through proxy mode på sin beholdning gruppens vært. Fordi gruppen typisk har præcis én vært (sværmbestyrer), ``DEPLOYMENT_MODE`` Beslutter ``compose`` for rollen; multi-host fan- out for cache selv er ude af stand til at v1."

# libretranslate
msgid "The role deploys a single `registry:2` instance in pull-through proxy mode on its inventory group's host. Because the group typically holds exactly one host (the swarm manager), `DEPLOYMENT_MODE` resolves to `compose` for the role; multi-host fan-out for the cache itself is out of scope for v1."
