# libretranslate
msgid "The role installs a systemd unit that snapshots each configured source directory into `<backups>/<machine-hash>/backup-secrets-to-local/<generation>/files/<name>`, hard-linked against the previous generation. Optional sources are skipped when absent (the CA in Let's Encrypt mode, ACME/certbot in self-signed mode). The generation joins the same backup tree the pull and device roles consume, so it flows to the backup host and the encrypted device automatically."
msgstr "Rollen installerer en systemd enhed, der snapshots hver konfigureret kildemappe i `<backups>/<machine-hash>/backup-secrets-to-local/<generation>/files/<name>`, hårdt forbundet med den foregående generation. Valgfrie kilder er sprunget over, når de mangler (CA i Let 's Krypttilstand, ACME / certbot i selvsigneret tilstand). Generationen slutter sig til samme backup træ træk og enhedsroller forbruge, så det flyder til backup vært og den krypterede enhed automatisk."

