msgid "The scope of this folder is installation and bootstrap. Lint execution, build workflows, and test orchestration should stay in their dedicated script directories."
msgstr "Omfanget af denne mappe er installation og bootstrap. Lint udførelse, bygge arbejdsgange, og test orkestrering bør forblive i deres dedikerede script mapper."

# libretranslate
msgid "The scope of this folder is lint execution. Tool installation belongs in `scripts/install`, while build and test workflows should stay in their dedicated script directories."
msgstr "Omfanget af denne mappe er lint udførelse. Værktøjsinstallation hører til i `scripts/install`, mens bygge og teste arbejdsgange bør forblive i deres dedikerede scriptmapper."

# libretranslate
msgid "The scope of this folder is missing-state resolution. Image build, release, and workflow orchestration should stay in their dedicated script or workflow locations."
