# libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys Taiga in a Docker-based environment, allowing fast, reproducible, and secure installations. Authentication defaults to Taiga's own OpenID Connect integration against Keycloak, which federates users from OpenLDAP."
msgstr "Denne ansible rolle Taiga i et Docker- baseret miljø, der tillader hurtige, reproducerbare og sikre installationer. Godkendelse standard til Taigaegen OpenID Connect integration mod Keycloak, som føderaerer brugere fra OpenLDAP."

