# libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys the ONLYOFFICE Document Server in Docker to provide real-time, in-browser editing for documents, spreadsheets, and presentations. It automates the setup of the Document Server container, NGINX reverse proxy configuration, network isolation via Docker networks, and environment variable management for secure integration with Nextcloud or other WOPI-compatible platforms."
msgstr "Denne Ansible rolle implementerer ONLYOffice Document Server i Docker til at give real- tid, in- browser redigering for dokumenter, regneark og præsentationer. Det automatiserer opsætningen af Document Server container, NGINX reverse proxy konfiguration, netværk isolation via Docker netværk, og miljø variabel styring for sikker integration med Nextcloud eller andre WOPI-kompatible platforme."

# libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role ensures **consistent global theming** across all NGINX-served applications by injecting CSS files."
msgstr "Denne Ansible rolle sikrer **konsekvent global tema** på tværs af alle NGINX- serverede applikationer ved at injicere CSS-filer."

# libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role ensures **consistent global theming** across all NGINX-served applications by injecting CSS files.   The role leverages [`colorscheme-generator`](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/colorscheme-generator/) to generate a dynamic, customizable color palette for light and dark mode, compatible with popular web tools like **Bootstrap**, **Keycloak**, **Nextcloud**, **Taiga**, **Mastodon**, and many more."
msgstr "Denne Ansible rolle sikrer **konsekvent global tema** på tværs af alle NGINX- serverede applikationer ved at injicere CSS-filer. Rollen levner [`colorscheme-generator`](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/colorscheme-generator/) at generere en dynamisk, brugervenlig farvepalet til lys og mørk tilstand, kompatibel med populære web-værktøjer som **Bootstrap**, **Keycloak**, **Nextcloud**, **Taiga**, **Mastodon**, og mange flere."

# libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role ensures that [.profile](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bourne_shell#Startup_scripts) is sourced in both [Bash](https://www.gnu.org/software/bash/) and [Zsh](https://www.zsh.org/) environments. It enables consistent environment variable loading across different login shells by linking shell-specific profile files (`.bash_profile`, `.zprofile`) to a centralized `.profile`."
msgstr "Denne Ansible rolle sikrer, at [.profilName](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bourne_shell#Startup_scripts) er indkøbt i begge [Bash](https://www.gnu.org/software/bash/) og [Zsh](https://www.zsh.org/) miljøer. Det gør det muligt konsekvent miljø variabel lastning på tværs af forskellige login skaller ved at forbinde shell- specifikke profilfiler (`.bash_profile`, `.zprofile`) til en centraliseret `.profile`."

# libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role ensures that `.profile <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bourne_shell#Startup_scripts>`__ is sourced in both `Bash <https://www.gnu.org/software/bash/>`__ and `Zsh <https://www.zsh.org/>`__ environments. It enables consistent environment variable loading across different login shells by linking shell-specific profile files (``.bash_profile``, ``.zprofile``) to a centralized ``.profile``."
msgstr "Denne Ansible rolle sikrer, at `.profile <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bourne_shell#Startup_scripts>`__ er indkøbt i begge `Bash <https://www.gnu.org/software/bash/>`__ og `Zsh <https://www.zsh.org/>`__ miljøer. Det gør det muligt konsekvent miljø variabel lastning på tværs af forskellige login skaller ved at forbinde shell- specifikke profilfiler (``.bash_profile``, ``.zprofile``) til en centraliseret ``.profile``."

# libretranslate
