# libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role provides a central RabbitMQ message broker that many roles share. It runs the broker inside a Docker container and isolates each consumer with its own virtual host and user, making it suitable for production or local development."
msgstr "Denne Ansible rolle giver en central RabbitMQ besked mægler, som mange roller deler. Det kører mægleren inde i en Docker container og isolerer hver forbruger med sin egen virtuelle vært og bruger, hvilket gør det egnet til produktion eller lokal udvikling."

# libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role provides a generic, reusable Playwright end-to-end (E2E) test runner for the Infinito.Nexus ecosystem."
msgstr "Denne Ansible rolle giver en generisk, genanvendelig Playwright end-to-end (DK2DK) testløber for Infinito.Nexus økosystem."

# libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role provisions a centralized database system in your Docker Compose environment. It supports both MariaDB and PostgreSQL, providing a robust, scalable, and low-maintenance database solution. Whether you're consolidating your application's data or creating a dedicated central storage, this role simplifies setup and integration."
msgstr "Denne Ansible rolle indeholder en central database system i din Docker Compose miljø. Det understøtter begge MariaDB og PostgreSQL, giver en robust, skalerbar, og lav-vedligeholdelse database løsning. Uanset om du konsoliderer din applikations data eller opretter en dedikeret central lagring, forenkler denne rolle opsætning og integration."

# libretranslate
