# libretranslate
msgid "This containerized YOURLS solution is built on robust Docker Compose and Ansible automation. It simplifies the deployment process by integrating with centralized MariaDB management and providing pre‑configured health checks and environment settings. Whether you're looking to quickly generate memorable links or need detailed analytics, this deployment supports your digital strategy seamlessly."
msgstr "Denne container YOURLS Opløsning er bygget på robust Docker Compose og Ansibel automatisering. Det forenkler ibrugtagningsprocessen ved at integrere med centraliserede MariaDB forvaltning og levering af forud konfigureret sundhedskontrol og miljø indstillinger. Uanset om du søger at hurtigt generere mindeværdige links eller har brug for detaljerede analytics, denne implementering understøtter din digitale strategi problemfrit."

# libretranslate
msgid "This containerized YOURLS solution is built on robust Docker Compose and Ansible automation. It simplifies the deployment process by integrating with centralized MariaDB management and providing pre‑configured health checks and environment settings. Whether you’re looking to quickly generate memorable links or need detailed analytics, this deployment supports your digital strategy seamlessly."
msgstr "Denne container YOURLS Opløsning er bygget på robust Docker Compose og Ansibel automatisering. Det forenkler ibrugtagningsprocessen ved at integrere med centraliserede MariaDB forvaltning og levering af forud konfigureret sundhedskontrol og miljø indstillinger. Uanset om du søger at hurtigt generere mindeværdige links eller har brug for detaljerede analytics, denne implementering understøtter din digitale strategi problemfrit."

# libretranslate
msgid "This decision is **load-bearing**: openresty owns the `sys-front-inj-*` Lua body-rewriting pipeline (CSP-meta stripping, Matomo / CSS / JavaScript / Dashboard / Logout snippet injection). Migrating to Traefik in v1 would silently drop that pipeline — it has no equivalent in Traefik without a non-trivial Yaegi-plugin port. Traefik migration is tracked as a Future Extension once edge-HA becomes worth the porting effort."
msgstr "Denne beslutning er **belastning-leje**: openresty ejer `sys-front-inj-*` Lua body- rewriting pipeline (CSP- meta-stripning Matomo / CSS / JavaScript / Dashboard / Logout snippet injektion). Migrering til Traefik in v1 ville stille droppe denne rørledning - det har ingen tilsvarende i Traefik uden en ikke-triviel Yaegi- plugin port. Traefik migration spores som en fremtidig forlængelse, når edge- HA bliver værd porting indsats."

# libretranslate
msgid "This declares two variants. Variant 0 pins every dynamic service-key from `meta/services.yml` to `enabled: true, shared: true` so the maximum-footprint baseline is explicit. Variant 1 keeps the same dynamic flags on and additionally flips Multisite on against three canonical domains."
msgstr "Dette erklærer to varianter. Variant 0 pins hver dynamisk service-key fra `meta/services.yml` til `enabled: true, shared: true` Så den maksimale-fodaftryk baseline er eksplicit. Variant 1 holder de samme dynamiske flag på og derudover flips Multisite på mod tre kanoniske domæner."

# libretranslate
msgid "This deployment simplifies LDAP management by presenting a modern web interface that lets you search, modify, and manage directory entries easily. It supports integration with external LDAP servers and works seamlessly behind a reverse proxy, allowing administrators to focus on core directory tasks rather than deployment intricacies."
msgstr "Denne implementering forenkler LDAP-styring ved at præsentere en moderne webgrænseflade, der lader dig søge, ændre og administrere mappe- indgange nemt. Det understøtter integration med eksterne LDAP-servere og arbejder problemfrit bag en omvendt proxy, så administratorerne kan fokusere på centrale mappe- opgaver i stedet for implementeringsdetaljer."

# libretranslate
