msgid "This major release migrates every role to the new meta/ layout with explicit per-role networks, ports, run_after, and info.yml metadata, introduces a variant-aware matrix-deploy planner, ships a process-wide YAML / file / registry caching stack, promotes 13+ apps from alpha to beta, and adds a lint corpus that pins the new conventions in CI."
msgstr "Denne store udgivelse migrerer enhver rolle til den nye meta / layout med eksplicitte perrollenetværk, havne, run_after, og info.yml metadata, introducerer en variant- aware matrix- deployering planner, skibe en proces- wide YAML / fil / registreringsdatabasen caching stak, fremmer 13+ apps fra alfa til beta, og tilføjer en lint corpus, der passer til de nye konventioner i CI."

# libretranslate
msgid "This makes Home Assistant a natural [025](025-mcp-role-integration.md) **MCP server role** and the concrete backend for the isolated-home-assistant scenario in [032](032-agent-employees-firecracker.md): the agent stays kernel-isolated and reaches the home only through this MCP surface, never through host access. Home Assistant runs natively on `arm64`/Raspberry Pi, so it co-locates with the Pi agent story."
msgstr "Dette gør Home Assistant en naturlig [025](025-mcp-role-integration.md) **MCP- server- rolle** og den konkrete bagende for det isolerede hjem-assistent scenario i [032](032-agent-employees-firecracker.md): agenten forbliver kernel- isoleret og når hjem kun gennem denne MCP overflade, aldrig gennem vært adgang. Hjem Assistent kører indfødt på `arm64`/ Raspberry Pi, så det samtidig lokaliserer med Pi agent historien."

