# libretranslate
msgid "This page documents the rules that govern the top-level [compose.yml](../../../../compose.yml) and the environment variables it consumes. For general documentation rules (links, writing, RFC 2119 keywords), see [documentation.md](../../documentation.md). For CI debugging workflows that use these variables, see [ci.md](../../actions/debugging/ci.md)."
msgstr "Denne side dokumenterer de regler, der styrer topniveauet [compose.yml](../../../../compose.yml) og de miljøvariabler, det forbruger. Regler for generel dokumentation (links, skrivning, RFC 2119 Nøgleord), se [documentation.md](../../documentation.md). For CI debugging arbejdsgange, der bruger disse variabler, se [ci.md](../../actions/debugging/ci.md)."

# libretranslate
msgid "This page enumerates the trust assumptions that the Claude Code configuration in [`.claude/settings.json`](../../../../../.claude/settings.json) relies on. If any assumption becomes false on a given host, the corresponding rule in [settings.md](settings.md) or [sandbox.md](sandbox.md) MUST be re-evaluated before Claude Code is started. This file is the single reference for the architectural reasoning. Per-rule tables in the neighbouring pages summarise the mechanics and link here for the full argument."
msgstr "Denne side opregner de tillid antagelser, at Claude Code konfiguration i [`.claude/settings.json`](../../../../../.claude/settings.json) Stoler på. Hvis nogen antagelse bliver falsk på en given vært, den tilsvarende regel i [settings.md](settings.md) eller [sandbox.md](sandbox.md) Skal revurderes, før Claude Code startes. Denne fil er den eneste reference til det arkitektoniske ræsonnement. Per- regel tabeller på nabosiderne sammenfatter mekanikken og link her for det fulde argument."

