# libretranslate
msgid "This playbook, ``desk-docker``, is part of a larger collection housed within the ``infinito`` repository. It is specifically tailored for setting up Docker and Docker Compose on personal computers (PCs) used for development purposes. The primary goal is to facilitate a development environment on individual workstations rather than configuring servers for hosting or distributing Docker images."
msgstr "Denne playbook, ``desk-docker``, er en del af en større samling, der er placeret i ``infinito`` lager. Det er specielt skræddersyet til oprettelse af Docker og Docker Compose på personlige computere (PC 'er) anvendes til udviklingsformål. Det primære mål er at fremme et udviklingsmiljø på individuelle arbejdsstationer i stedet for at konfigurere servere til hosting eller distribution af Docker-billeder."

# libretranslate
msgid "This playbook, `desk-docker`, is part of a larger collection housed within the `infinito` repository. It is specifically tailored for setting up Docker and Docker Compose on personal computers (PCs) used for development purposes. The primary goal is to facilitate a development environment on individual workstations rather than configuring servers for hosting or distributing Docker images."
