# libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the deployment of Odoo in a containerized Docker environment with PostgreSQL database integration, OIDC/LDAP authentication support, and full Infinito.Nexus stack integration including reverse proxy, CSP configuration, and centralized identity management."
msgstr "Denne rolle automatiserer deployeringen af Odoo i en containerized Docker miljø med PostgreSQL database integration, OIDC / LDAP autentificering support, og fuld Infinito.Nexus stack integration, herunder omvendt proxy, CSP konfiguration, og centraliseret identitetsstyring."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the installation of Jrnl using the ``community.general.pacman`` module for systems that support the Pacman package manager, ensuring that Jrnl is installed and up to date."
msgstr "Denne rolle automatiserer installationen af Jrnl ved at bruge ``community.general.pacman`` modul til systemer, der understøtter Pacman pakkehåndtering, der sikrer, at Jrnl er installeret og opdateret."

