# libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the installation of fakeroot via the OS package manager, ensuring that users can simulate superuser operations without requiring elevated privileges."
msgstr "Denne rolle automatiserer installationen af fakeroot via OS-pakkehåndteringen, hvilket sikrer, at brugerne kan simulere superbrugeroperationer uden at kræve forhøjede privilegier."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the installation of micro, a CLI text editor, on Pacman‑based systems. It uses the ``community.general.pacman`` module to ensure the editor is installed and up to date."
msgstr "Denne rolle automatiserer installationen af mikro, en CLI tekst editor, på Pacman baseret systemer. Det bruger ``community.general.pacman`` modul for at sikre at editoren er installeret og opdateret."

