# libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the management and balancing of Btrfs file systems. It clones the latest version of the [auto-btrfs-balancer](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/auto-btrfs-balancer.git) repository and configures a systemd service and timer to run the balancing script automatically."
msgstr "Denne rolle automatiserer forvaltningen og balanceringen af Btrfs filsystemer. Det kloner den seneste version af [selv- btrfs- balancer](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/auto-btrfs-balancer.git) lagre og konfigurerer en systemd-tjeneste og timer til at køre balanceringsscriptet automatisk."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the management and balancing of Btrfs file systems. It clones the latest version of the `auto-btrfs-balancer <https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/auto-btrfs-balancer.git>`__ repository and configures a systemd service and timer to run the balancing script automatically."
msgstr "Denne rolle automatiserer forvaltningen og balanceringen af Btrfs filsystemer. Det kloner den seneste version af `auto-btrfs-balancer <https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/auto-btrfs-balancer.git>`__ lagre og konfigurerer en systemd-tjeneste og timer til at køre balanceringsscriptet automatisk."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the process of setting up and running the Infinito.Nexus presentation in a Docker container, ensuring a reproducible and isolated environment for displaying the content."
msgstr "Denne rolle automatiserer etableringen og driften af Infinito.Nexus præsentation i en Docker container, der sikrer et reproducerbart og isoleret miljø til visning af indholdet."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the removal of orphaned Docker volumes that consume unnecessary disk space. It is especially useful in backup, CI/CD, or maintenance routines."
msgstr "Denne rolle automatiserer fjernelsen af forældreløse Docker mængder, der forbruger unødvendig diskplads. Det er især nyttigt i backup, CI / CD, eller vedligeholdelse rutiner."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the restart process for Docker Compose instances within a specified directory. It deploys a Python script that checks for the presence of compose.yml files and restarts the associated services. A hard restart is applied for certain directories if needed."
msgstr "Denne rolle automatiserer genstart processen for Docker Compose tilfælde i en angivet mappe. Det udsender en Python script, der kontrollerer for tilstedeværelsen af compose.yml filer og genstarter de tilknyttede tjenester. Der anvendes en hård genstart for visse mapper, hvis det er nødvendigt."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the retrieval of [Let's Encrypt](https://letsencrypt.org/) SSL/TLS certificates using [Certbot](https://certbot.eff.org/) for domains served via NGINX. It supports both single-domain and wildcard certificates, and can use either the DNS or webroot ACME challenge methods."
msgstr "Denne rolle automatiserer hentning af [Lad os kryptere](https://letsencrypt.org/) SSL / TLS-certifikater, der anvender [Certbot](https://certbot.eff.org/) for domæner, der betjenes via NGINX. Det understøtter både single- domæne og wildcard certifikater, og kan bruge enten DNS eller webroot ACME udfordring metoder."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the retrieval of `Let’s Encrypt <https://letsencrypt.org/>`__ SSL/TLS certificates using `Certbot <https://certbot.eff.org/>`__ for domains served via NGINX. It supports both single-domain and wildcard certificates, and can use either the DNS or webroot ACME challenge methods."
msgstr "Denne rolle automatiserer hentning af `Let’s Encrypt <https://letsencrypt.org/>`__ SSL / TLS-certifikater, der anvender `Certbot <https://certbot.eff.org/>`__ for domæner, der betjenes via NGINX. Det understøtter både single- domæne og wildcard certifikater, og kan bruge enten DNS eller webroot ACME udfordring metoder."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the setup of an automatic [Let's Encrypt](https://letsencrypt.org/) certificate renewal system for NGINX using [Certbot](https://certbot.eff.org/). It ensures that SSL/TLS certificates are renewed seamlessly in the background and that NGINX reloads automatically after successful renewals."
msgstr "Denne rolle automatiserer opsætningen af en automatisk [Lad os kryptere](https://letsencrypt.org/) system til fornyelse af certifikater for NGINX ved brug af [Certbot](https://certbot.eff.org/). Det sikrer, at SSL / TLS-certifikater fornyes problemfrit i baggrunden, og at NGINX automatisk genindlæser efter succesfulde fornyelser."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the setup of an automatic `Let’s Encrypt <https://letsencrypt.org/>`__ certificate renewal system for NGINX using `Certbot <https://certbot.eff.org/>`__. It ensures that SSL/TLS certificates are renewed seamlessly in the background and that NGINX reloads automatically after successful renewals."
msgstr "Denne rolle automatiserer opsætningen af en automatisk `Let’s Encrypt <https://letsencrypt.org/>`__ system til fornyelse af certifikater for NGINX ved brug af `Certbot <https://certbot.eff.org/>`__. Det sikrer, at SSL / TLS-certifikater fornyes problemfrit i baggrunden, og at NGINX automatisk genindlæser efter succesfulde fornyelser."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role bakes the upstream release artefact into a small ``nginx:alpine`` image and supports **multiple walls per deployment**: every entry under ```meta/services.yml.fediwall.walls`` <meta/services.yml>`__ materializes as its own path under ``https://fediwall.<DOMAIN_PRIMARY>/<slug>/`` with its own baked-in ``wall-config.json``. The root ``/`` shows a link list of all configured walls."
msgstr "Denne rolle bager opstrøms udgivelse artefakt i en lille ``nginx:alpine`` billede og understøtninger **flere vægge pr. deployering**: hver post under ```meta/services.yml.fediwall.walls`` <meta/services.yml>`__ materializes as its own path under ``https://fediwall.<DOMAIN_PRIMARY>/<slug>/`` with its own baked-in ``wall-config.json``. The root ``/`` viser en linkliste over alle konfigurerede vægge."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role bakes the upstream release artefact into a small `nginx:alpine` image and supports **multiple walls per deployment**: every entry under [`meta/services.yml.fediwall.walls`](meta/services.yml) materializes as its own path under `https://fediwall.<DOMAIN_PRIMARY>/<slug>/` with its own baked-in `wall-config.json`. The root `/` shows a link list of all configured walls."
msgstr "Denne rolle bager opstrøms udgivelse artefakt i en lille `nginx:alpine` billede og understøtninger **flere vægge pr. deployering**: hver post under [`meta/services.yml.fediwall.walls`](meta/services.yml) materialiserer som sin egen sti under `https://fediwall.<DOMAIN_PRIMARY>/<slug>/` med sin egen baged- in `wall-config.json`. Roden `/` viser en linkliste over alle konfigurerede vægge."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role bootstraps **per-domain NGINX configuration**: it requests TLS certificates, applies global modifiers, deploys a ready-made vHost file, and can optionally lock down access via OAuth2."
msgstr "Denne rolle bootstropper **per- domæne NGINX konfiguration**: det anmoder om TLS certifikater, anvender globale modifikatorer, implementerer en ready- made vHost fil, og kan eventuelt låse adgang ned via OAuth2."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role bootstraps and manages a Docker Swarm cluster across the hosts in the Ansible group ``svc-swarm-node``. The manager is the single host in ``svc-swarm-manager``; every other group member joins as a worker. Membership is expressed via group membership only, never via duplicated lists in ``group_vars``. Inventory node labels are pushed to the cluster after the join phase."
msgstr "Denne rolle bootstropper og forvalter en Docker Swarm klynge på tværs af værter i Ansible gruppe ``svc-swarm-node``. Bestyreren er den eneste vært i ``svc-swarm-manager``; alle andre gruppemedlemmer bliver ansat som arbejdstagere. Medlemskab udtrykkes kun via gruppemedlemskab, aldrig via duplikerede lister i ``group_vars``. Optagelsesknudeetiketter skubbes til klyngen efter tilmeldingsfasen."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role bootstraps and manages a Docker Swarm cluster across the hosts in the Ansible group `svc-swarm-node`. The manager is the single host in `svc-swarm-manager`; every other group member joins as a worker. Membership is expressed via group membership only, never via duplicated lists in `group_vars`. Inventory node labels are pushed to the cluster after the join phase."
msgstr "Denne rolle bootstropper og forvalter en Docker Swarm klynge på tværs af værter i Ansible gruppe `svc-swarm-node`. Bestyreren er den eneste vært i `svc-swarm-manager`; alle andre gruppemedlemmer bliver ansat som arbejdstagere. Medlemskab udtrykkes kun via gruppemedlemskab, aldrig via duplikerede lister i `group_vars`. Optagelsesknudeetiketter skubbes til klyngen efter tilmeldingsfasen."

msgid "This role builds Postmarks from source into a custom image, wires it to the standard reverse proxy, and persists its SQLite data. Postmarks is single-user: there are no accounts, only \"the owner\". The upstream login is a single shared-secret password form that flips one session boolean (`req.session.loggedIn`)."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role builds Postmarks from source into a custom image, wires it to the standard reverse proxy, and persists its SQLite data. Postmarks is single-user: there are no accounts, only “the owner”. The upstream login is a single shared-secret password form that flips one session boolean (``req.session.loggedIn``)."
msgstr ""

# libretranslate
msgid "This role builds and runs Bridgy Fed as a Docker container behind the project's front-proxy. An optional Firestore-emulator sidecar in Datastore mode provides the storage backend for non-production deployments."
msgstr "Denne rolle bygger og kører Bridgy Fed som en Docker container bag projektets frontproxy. En valgfri Firestoreemulator sidevogn i Datastoretilstand giver lager motor for ikke-produktion installationer."

