# libretranslate
msgid "This role builds its own Moodle image from upstream Moodle source on top of the official ``php:8.3-fpm`` base."
msgstr "Denne rolle bygger sine egne Moodle billede fra opstrøms Moodle kilde oven på tjenestemanden ``php:8.3-fpm`` base."

