# libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys GitLab from the official Cloud Native GitLab (CNG) CE images at ``registry.gitlab.com/gitlab-org/build/cng/`` as separate services: ``webservice`` (puma), ``sidekiq``, ``workhorse`` (sole HTTP entry point), ``gitaly``, ``shell`` (gitlab-sshd) and a one-shot ``migrations`` job. All images share a single version pin (``services.webservice.version``). PostgreSQL, Redis and S3-compatible object storage are wired through the platform lookups (central or sidecar), OIDC and SMTP through the platform SSO and email services. The front proxy terminates TLS and forwards HTTP to workhorse."
msgstr "Denne rolle udspiller sig GitLab fra den officielle Cloud Native GitLab (CNG) CE-billeder på ``registry.gitlab.com/gitlab-org/build/cng/`` som særskilte tjenester: ``webservice`` (puma), ``sidekiq``, ``workhorse`` (eneste HTTP-indgangspunkt), ``gitaly``, ``shell`` (gitlab- sshd) og et one-shot ``migrations`` job. Alle billeder deler en enkelt version pin (``services.webservice.version``). PostgreSQL Redis og S3-kompatibel objekt opbevaring er kappet gennem platformen opslag (central eller sidevogn), OIDC og SMTP gennem platformen SSO og e-mail-tjenester. Den forreste proxy afslutter TLS og frem HTTP til arbejdshest."

