# libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Jenkins on Docker Compose. It builds a custom Jenkins image that pre-installs the ``oic-auth``, ``ldap``, ``role-strategy``, and ``configuration-as-code`` plugins, then mounts a JCasC YAML file that wires the security realm against Keycloak (variant 0, OIDC) or ``svc-db-openldap`` (variant 1, LDAP). The setup wizard is skipped via ``JAVA_OPTS=-Djenkins.install.runSetupWizard=false`` so the JCasC config takes over from first boot."
msgstr "Denne rolle udspiller sig Jenkins om Docker ComposeDen bygger en skik Jenkins billede, der præ- installerer ``oic-auth``, ``ldap``, ``role-strategy``, og ``configuration-as-code`` plugins, derefter monterer en JCasC YAML fil, der wire sikkerhed rige mod Keycloak (variant 0, OIDC) eller ``svc-db-openldap`` (variant 1, LDAP). Opsætningsguiden er sprunget over via ``JAVA_OPTS=-Djenkins.install.runSetupWizard=false`` Så JCasC config overtager fra første støvle."

