# libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Joomla on Docker Compose. It builds a custom Joomla image that bakes in Composer for runtime extension builds, runs the Joomla CLI installer with the role's database, and installs the in-role `plg_system_keycloak` plugin so the site speaks OIDC against Keycloak with RBAC group mapping. A matrix-deploy variant flips the role to LDAP via Joomla's core LDAP authentication plugin instead."
msgstr "Denne rolle udspiller sig Joomla om Docker ComposeDen bygger en skik Joomla billede, der bages i Komponist til runtime forlængelse bygger, kører Joomla CLI installering med rollens database, og installerer in- rolle `plg_system_keycloak` plugin så webstedet taler OIDC mod Keycloak med RBAC gruppe mapping. En matrix- deployere variant vender rollen til LDAP via Joomla's centrale LDAP godkendelse plugin i stedet."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Joomla on Docker Compose. It builds a custom Joomla image that bakes in Composer for runtime extension builds, runs the Joomla CLI installer with the role’s database, and installs the in-role ``plg_system_keycloak`` plugin so the site speaks OIDC against Keycloak with RBAC group mapping. A matrix-deploy variant flips the role to LDAP via Joomla’s core LDAP authentication plugin instead."
msgstr "Denne rolle udspiller sig Joomla om Docker ComposeDen bygger en skik Joomla billede, der bages i Komponist til runtime forlængelse bygger, kører Joomla CLI installering med rollens database, og installerer in- rolle ``plg_system_keycloak`` plugin så webstedet taler OIDC mod Keycloak med RBAC gruppe mapping. En matrix- deployere variant vender rollen til LDAP via Joomla's centrale LDAP godkendelse plugin i stedet."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys KIX as an Infinito.Nexus web app behind the project's standard `sys-stk-front-proxy` and `web-app-keycloak`'s SSO-proxy sidecar chain. The upstream `kix-on-premise` proxy, backend, and frontend containers ship from `docker-registry.kixdesk.com/public/`. The backend initialises its schema (`scripts/database/kix-schema.xml`) against the central `svc-db-postgres` cluster, or against the embedded postgres sidecar when no central provider is in the inventory, with `pg_trgm` pre-activated via `services.postgres.extensions`; the cache is the role-local passwordless redis sidecar (the frontend ignores `REDIS_CACHE_PASSWORD`). Initial admin credentials are seeded via `INITIAL_ADMIN_PW` on first start (see `meta/secrets.yml`)."
msgstr "Denne rolle udspiller sig KIX som en Infinito.Nexus webapp bag projektets standard `sys-stk-front-proxy` og `web-app-keycloak`SSO- proxy sidevognskæde. Opstrøms `kix-on-premise` proxy, backend, og frontend containere skib fra `docker-registry.kixdesk.com/public/`. Bagenden initialiserer sit skema (`scripts/database/kix-schema.xml`) mod den centrale `svc-db-postgres` klynge, eller mod den indlejrede postgres sidevogn, når ingen central udbyder er i fortegnelsen, med `pg_trgm` præ- aktiveret via `services.postgres.extensions`; Cachen er den role- lokale passorless rød sidevogn (frontend ignorerer `REDIS_CACHE_PASSWORD`). Indledende admin legitimation er seeded via `INITIAL_ADMIN_PW` ved første start (Se `meta/secrets.yml`)."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys KIX as an Infinito.Nexus web app behind the project’s standard ``sys-stk-front-proxy`` and ``web-app-keycloak``\\ ’s SSO-proxy sidecar chain. The upstream ``kix-on-premise`` proxy, backend, and frontend containers ship from ``docker-registry.kixdesk.com/public/``. The backend initialises its schema (``scripts/database/kix-schema.xml``) against the central ``svc-db-postgres`` cluster, or against the embedded postgres sidecar when no central provider is in the inventory, with ``pg_trgm`` pre-activated via ``services.postgres.extensions``; the cache is the role-local passwordless redis sidecar (the frontend ignores ``REDIS_CACHE_PASSWORD``). Initial admin credentials are seeded via ``INITIAL_ADMIN_PW`` on first start (see ``meta/secrets.yml``)."
msgstr "Denne rolle udspiller sig KIX som en Infinito.Nexus webapp bag projektets standard ``sys-stk-front-proxy`` og ``web-app-keycloak``\\ 's SSO- proxy sidevognskæde. Opstrøms ``kix-on-premise`` proxy, backend, og frontend containere skib fra ``docker-registry.kixdesk.com/public/``. Bagenden initialiserer sit skema (``scripts/database/kix-schema.xml``) mod den centrale ``svc-db-postgres`` klynge, eller mod den indlejrede postgres sidevogn, når ingen central udbyder er i fortegnelsen, med ``pg_trgm`` præ- aktiveret via ``services.postgres.extensions``; Cachen er den role- lokale passorless rød sidevogn (frontend ignorerer ``REDIS_CACHE_PASSWORD``). Indledende admin legitimation er seeded via ``INITIAL_ADMIN_PW`` ved første start (Se ``meta/secrets.yml``)."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Keycloak in a Docker environment, integrating it with a PostgreSQL database and enabling operation behind a reverse proxy such as NGINX. It manages container orchestration and configuration via Docker Compose and environment variable templates, ensuring a secure and scalable identity management solution."
msgstr "Denne rolle udspiller sig Keycloak i et Docker miljø, integrere det med en PostgreSQL database og muliggør operation bag en omvendt proxy såsom NGINX. Det administrerer containerorkestrering og konfiguration via Docker Compose og miljø variable skabeloner, der sikrer en sikker og skalerbar identitet management løsning."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys LAM in a Docker environment and integrates it with an NGINX reverse proxy to provide secure access. It leverages environment variable templates to configure LDAP connection settings and administrative credentials, ensuring a smooth and customizable installation of LDAP Account Manager."
msgstr "Denne rolle udspiller sig LAM i et Docker miljø og integrerer det med en NGINX reverse proxy for at give sikker adgang. Det bruger miljøvariable skabeloner til at konfigurere LDAP-tilslutningsindstillinger og administrative legitimationer, hvilket sikrer en smidig og brugervenlig installation af LDAP Account Manager."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys LM Studio as a headless model server in a single container, in both Docker Compose and Docker Swarm deployments. The server listens on port 1234 on the internal container network and is not published through the reverse proxy, while downloaded models and server settings persist in a dedicated volume. The role downloads its declared models at deploy time and the LiteLLM Gateway publishes them under the same aliases Ollama uses, so a consumer asks for one model name and reaches whichever backend the deployment provides."
msgstr "Denne rolle udspiller sig LM Studio som hovedløs modelserver i en enkelt beholder, i begge Docker Compose og Docker Swarm deployeringer. Serveren lytter på port 1234 på det interne containernetværk og er ikke offentliggjort via den omvendte proxy, mens downloadede modeller og serverindstillinger fortsætter i et dedikeret volumen. Rollen downloader sine erklærede modeller på deployeringstid og LiteLLM Gateway offentliggør dem under samme kaldenavne Ollama bruger, så en forbruger beder om et modelnavn og når den bagende, indsættelsen giver."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Listmonk using Docker, ensuring a robust and scalable setup for your newsletter management needs. Listmonk’s architecture supports a dedicated PostgreSQL database and integration with an NGINX reverse proxy for secure access. To configure and manage your instance, use the provided configuration files:"
msgstr "Denne rolle udspiller sig Listmonk bruge Docker, sikre en robust og skalerbar opsætning til dit nyhedsbrev management behov. Listmonks arkitektur understøtter en dedikeret PostgreSQL database og integration med en NGINX reverse proxy for sikker adgang. For at konfigurere og administrere din instans, skal du bruge de medfølgende indstillingsfiler:"

# libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys LiteLLM as a shared gateway container in Compose and Swarm deployments, backed by the central PostgreSQL service. The gateway is headless: it binds its HTTP port on the container host and claims no domain of its own, and the browser-facing surface is published separately by the LiteLLM Admin UI. It renders the model list from the interchangeable local backends available on the host, Ollama and LM Studio, and adds the OpenAI, Anthropic and OpenRouter entries whose API key is configured. Once the gateway is up, it provisions one virtual key per consuming application through the gateway admin API."
msgstr "Denne rolle udmønter LiteLLM som en delt gateway container i Compose og Swarm installationer, støttet af den centrale PostgreSQL service. Gateway er hovedløs: det binder sin HTTP-port på containeren vært og hævder intet domæne af sin egen, og browser- vender overflade er offentliggjort separat af LiteLLM Admin UIDet gør modellisten fra de udskiftelige lokale bagdele tilgængelige på værten, Ollama og LM Studio, og tilføjer OpenAI, Anthropic og OpenRouter poster, hvis API Nøglen er konfigureret. Når porten er oppe, det leverer en virtuel nøgle per forbrugende program gennem gateway admin API."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Mastodon using Docker, streamlining the installation and configuration of a full-featured social networking platform. Mastodon is built to support federation across multiple instances, offering robust content moderation, real-time updates, and flexible API integrations. Its advanced architecture includes separate services for the web frontend, streaming API, and background job processing, ensuring high performance and scalability for large communities."
msgstr "Denne rolle udspiller sig Mastodon ved hjælp af Docker, strømline installationen og konfigurationen af en komplet social netværksplatform. Mastodon er bygget til at støtte føderation på tværs af flere tilfælde, tilbyder robust indhold moderation, real- tid opdateringer, og fleksibel API Integration. Dens avancerede arkitektur omfatter separate tjenester til web frontend, streaming API, og baggrund jobbehandling, der sikrer høj ydeevne og skalerbarhed for store samfund."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Matomo using Docker, automating the setup of your analytics platform along with its underlying database. With support for health checks, persistent storage for configuration and data, and integration with an NGINX reverse proxy, Matomo is configured to provide reliable and scalable analytics for your digital presence."
msgstr "Denne rolle udspiller sig Matomo bruge Docker, automatisere opsætningen af din analytics platform sammen med dens underliggende database. Med støtte til sundhedstjek, vedvarende opbevaring for konfiguration og data, og integration med en NGINX omvendt proxy, Matomo er konfigureret til at levere pålidelig og skalerbar analytics til din digitale tilstedeværelse."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys MediaWiki using Docker, automating the setup of your wiki instance along with its underlying MariaDB database. It handles generating the essential configuration file (LocalSettings.php) from a seeded template and integrates with an NGINX reverse proxy for secure, efficient web access."
msgstr "Denne rolle udspiller sig MediaWiki ved hjælp af Docker, automatisere opsætningen af din wiki instans sammen med dens underliggende MariaDB database. Det håndterer generering af den væsentlige konfiguration fil (LocalSettings.php) fra en sået skabelon og integrerer med en NGINX omvendt proxy for sikker, effektiv web-adgang."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Mobilizon using Docker, automating the setup of your event management platform along with its underlying database. With support for health checks, persistent storage for uploads and configuration, and seamless integration with an NGINX reverse proxy, Mobilizon is configured to provide reliable and scalable event hosting for your community."
msgstr "Denne rolle udspiller sig Mobilizon ved hjælp af Docker, automatisere opsætningen af din event management platform sammen med dens underliggende database. Med støtte til sundhedskontrol, vedvarende opbevaring af uploads og konfiguration og problemfri integration med en NGINX reverse proxy, Mobilizon er konfigureret til at give pålidelig og skalerbar begivenhed hosting for dit samfund."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Moodle using Docker, automating the setup of both the Moodle application and its underlying MariaDB database. It integrates with an NGINX reverse proxy to ensure secure and efficient web access and uses persistent storage to safeguard your data and configuration."
msgstr "Denne rolle udspiller sig Moodle ved hjælp af Docker, automatisere opsætningen af begge Moodle anvendelse og dens underliggende MariaDB database. Det integrerer med en NGINX reverse proxy for at sikre sikker og effektiv web-adgang og bruger vedvarende lagring for at beskytte dine data og konfiguration."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Ollama as a local model server using Docker Compose. It integrates with Open WebUI for chat and Flowise for AI workflow automation, and configures local model caching so models can be reused across sessions or run fully offline."
msgstr "Denne rolle udspiller sig Ollama som en lokal modelserver der bruger Docker ComposeDet integrerer med Open WebUI til chat og Flowise for AI workflow automatisering, og fx. lokal model caching så modeller kan genbruges på tværs af sessioner eller køre helt offline."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys OpenBao as an Infinito.Nexus application at ``openbao.<domain>``, behind the platform’s HTTPS reverse proxy. Humans sign in through Keycloak with OIDC and receive exactly the privileges their RBAC group grants; machines authenticate separately through AppRole. State lives in OpenBao’s own raft store on a persistent volume, and a static seal auto-unseals the node on every restart so no operator has to intervene after a redeploy."
msgstr "Denne rolle udspiller sig OpenBao som en Infinito.Nexus ansøgning ``openbao.<domain>``, bag platformens HTTPS omvendte proxy. Mennesker logger ind Keycloak med OIDC og modtage præcis de privilegier deres RBAC gruppe tilskud; maskiner autentificere separat gennem AppRole. Staten bor i OpenBaoEn statisk forsegling afspærrer nuden på hver genstart, så ingen skal gribe ind efter en omdeployering."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys OpenBao as an Infinito.Nexus application at `openbao.<domain>`, behind the platform's HTTPS reverse proxy. Humans sign in through Keycloak with OIDC and receive exactly the privileges their RBAC group grants; machines authenticate separately through AppRole. State lives in OpenBao's own raft store on a persistent volume, and a static seal auto-unseals the node on every restart so no operator has to intervene after a redeploy."
