# libretranslate
msgid "This role installs a systemd service that sends notifications via both [sys-ctl-alm-telegram](../sys-ctl-alm-telegram/README.md) and [sys-ctl-alm-email](../sys-ctl-alm-email/README.md) when any service fails."
msgstr "Denne rolle installerer en systemd-tjeneste, der sender meddelelser via begge [sys-ctl-alm-telegram](../sys-ctl-alm-telegram/README.md) og [sys-ctl-alm-email](../sys-ctl-alm-email/README.md) når en tjenesteydelse mislykkes."

# libretranslate
