# libretranslate
msgid "This role installs an NFS server in one of two flavors, the distro kernel server or userspace nfs-ganesha, selected per deployment. Both export the swarm state path to the resolved addresses of the ``svc-swarm-node`` group and to an additional CIDR allow-list; ganesha also exports the export base and squashes root there. Export options come from ``vars/main.yml`` for the kernel flavor and from the ganesha configuration template for ganesha. NFS server HA, Kerberos integration, and client-side mounting are out of scope; client mounts are handled by ``svc-storage-nfs-client``."
msgstr "Denne rolle installerer en NFS-server i en af to varianter, den ditro kernel server eller userspace nfs- ganesha, udvalgt pr. implementering. Begge eksportere sværm stat sti til de løses adresser på ``svc-swarm-node`` og til en yderligere CIDR-liste; ganesha eksporterer også eksportbasen og squashrod der. Eksportmuligheder kommer fra ``vars/main.yml`` for kernen smag og fra ganesha konfiguration skabelon for ganesha. NFS server HA, Kerberos integration, og klient- side montering er ude af rækkevidde; klientophæng håndteres af ``svc-storage-nfs-client``."

# libretranslate
