# libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the `sudo <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo>`__ package and deploys a default sudoers file to ensure secure and consistent privilege escalation on the target system. It uses a preconfigured sudoers file that follows best practices and includes directives to read drop-in files from ``/etc/sudoers.d``."
msgstr "Denne rolle integrerer `sudo <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo>`__ pakke og implementerer en standard sudoers fil for at sikre sikker og konsekvent rettighedsforøgelse på målsystemet. Det bruger en forudkonfigureret sudoers fil, der følger bedste praksis og indeholder direktiver til at læse drop-in filer fra ``/etc/sudoers.d``."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the backup script and the systemd service that drives it on the configured schedule (`SYS_SCHEDULE_BACKUP_NFS_TO_LOCAL`), and serialises the run against the rest of the manipulation group via [sys-lock](../sys-lock/). The source path is the NFS export base resolved from the [svc-storage-nfs-server](../svc-storage-nfs-server/) services SPOT; deploy the role on the host that serves the export. Deploy [sys-ctl-cln-bkps](../sys-ctl-cln-bkps/) to keep the snapshot tree bounded and [user-backup](../user-backup/) so downstream hosts can pull the tree."
msgstr "Denne rolle installerer backup script og systemd service, der driver det på den konfigurerede tidsplan (`SYS_SCHEDULE_BACKUP_NFS_TO_LOCAL`), og serialiserer løbet mod resten af manipulation gruppe via [sys-lock](../sys-lock/). Kildestien er NFS eksport base løst fra [svc-storage-nfs-server](../svc-storage-nfs-server/) tjenester SPOT; anvende den rolle på værten, der tjener eksporten. Opsætning [sys-ctl-cln-bkps](../sys-ctl-cln-bkps/) at holde snapshot træet afgrænset og [user-backup](../user-backup/) Så downstream værter kan trække træet."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the backup script and the systemd service that drives it on the configured schedule (``SYS_SCHEDULE_BACKUP_NFS_TO_LOCAL``), and serialises the run against the rest of the manipulation group via `sys-lock <../sys-lock/>`__. The source path is the NFS export base resolved from the `svc-storage-nfs-server <../svc-storage-nfs-server/>`__ services SPOT; deploy the role on the host that serves the export. Deploy `sys-ctl-cln-bkps <../sys-ctl-cln-bkps/>`__ to keep the snapshot tree bounded and `user-backup <../user-backup/>`__ so downstream hosts can pull the tree."
msgstr "Denne rolle installerer backup script og systemd service, der driver det på den konfigurerede tidsplan (``SYS_SCHEDULE_BACKUP_NFS_TO_LOCAL``), og serialiserer løbet mod resten af manipulation gruppe via `sys-lock <../sys-lock/>`__. Kildestien er NFS eksport base løst fra `svc-storage-nfs-server <../svc-storage-nfs-server/>`__ tjenester SPOT; anvende den rolle på værten, der tjener eksporten. Opsætning `sys-ctl-cln-bkps <../sys-ctl-cln-bkps/>`__ at holde snapshot træet afgrænset og `user-backup <../user-backup/>`__ Så downstream værter kan trække træet."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the distro-appropriate NFS client packages on every host in the Ansible group ``svc-swarm-node`` and probe-mounts the configured ``storage.nfs.server`` and the export base from the svc-storage-nfs-server services.yml SPOT to confirm reachability and writability at deploy time. The actual docker volume mounts happen later, driven by the Docker engine at container start."
msgstr "Denne rolle installerer NFS-klientpakker på alle værter i Ansible Group ``svc-swarm-node`` og probe- monterer den indstillede ``storage.nfs.server`` og eksportgrundlaget fra svc-storage-nfs-server services.yml SPOT til at bekræfte adgang og skrivbarhed på deployeringstid. Den faktiske docker volumen monteringer ske senere, drevet af Docker motor ved container start."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the distro-appropriate NFS client packages on every host in the Ansible group `svc-swarm-node` and probe-mounts the configured `storage.nfs.server` and the export base from the svc-storage-nfs-server services.yml SPOT to confirm reachability and writability at deploy time. The actual docker volume mounts happen later, driven by the Docker engine at container start."
msgstr "Denne rolle installerer NFS-klientpakker på alle værter i Ansible Group `svc-swarm-node` og probe- monterer den indstillede `storage.nfs.server` og eksportgrundlaget fra svc-storage-nfs-server services.yml SPOT til at bekræfte adgang og skrivbarhed på deployeringstid. Den faktiske docker volumen monteringer ske senere, drevet af Docker motor ved container start."

# libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "This role is a generic GNOME-extension installer driven by ``services.gnome-extensions.plugins``, a 3-tuple list (``action``, ``uuid``, ``url``) consumed by ``cli-gnome-extension-manager``. It ships no concrete extensions of its own and reads no ``meta/addons/`` files. Roles that ship concrete GNOME extensions, such as `desk-gnome <../desk-gnome/>`__, declare them through the unified addon contract under ``meta/addons/`` (requirement 026), with one file per extension (``mechanism: extension``, ``source: upstream``, ``config: { uuid, url }``); see that role for the per-file example."
msgstr "Denne rolle er en generisk GNOME- udvidelse installatør drevet af ``services.gnome-extensions.plugins``, a 3-tuple list (``action``, ``uuid``, ``url``) forbrugt af ``cli-gnome-extension-manager``. Det sender ingen konkrete udvidelser af sin egen og læser ingen ``meta/addons/`` filer. Roller, at skibet beton GNOME udvidelser, såsom `desk-gnome <../desk-gnome/>`__, erklærer dem gennem den samlede addon kontrakt ``meta/addons/`` (krav 026), med en fil pr. forlængelse (``mechanism: extension``, ``source: upstream``, ``config: { uuid, url }``); se denne rolle for per- fil eksempel."

