msgid "This role provisions a complete Nextcloud deployment using Docker Compose. It automates the setup of the Nextcloud application along with its underlying MariaDB database and configures the system for secure public access via an NGINX reverse proxy. The deployment includes automated configuration merging into ``config.php``, health check routines, and integrated support for backup and recovery operations."
msgstr "Denne rolle indeholder en komplet Nextcloud implementering ved hjælp af Docker ComposeDet automatiserer opsætningen af Nextcloud anvendelse sammen med dens underliggende MariaDB database og anbefaler systemet til sikker offentlig adgang via en NGINX reverse proxy. Implementeringen omfatter automatisk konfiguration fletning i ``config.php``, sundhedstjek rutiner, og integreret støtte til backup og inddrivelse operationer."

