msgstr "To forskellige betydninger af \"bridge\" Må ikke blandes:"

# libretranslate
msgid "Two helpers, both pure: `_resolve_variant_payloads` picks the variant payload for each app in a round's include set, and `_bake_overrides` merges those payloads under `applications:` inside the `--vars` JSON the inventory provision step consumes. Caller-supplied `extra_vars` always win over the variant bake — that's the documented \"user vars always win\" rule."
msgstr "To hjælpere, begge rene: `_resolve_variant_payloads` vælger varianten nyttelast for hver app i et sæt med runde, og `_bake_overrides` fusionerer disse nyttelast under `applications:` inden for `--vars` JSON den opgørelse levering trin forbruger. Caller- leveret `extra_vars` altid vinde over variant bage - det er den dokumenterede \"bruger vars altid vinde\" Regel."

# libretranslate
msgid "Two host- and swarm-level facts constrain the design and are settled below: swarm's stack deploy drops the compose `runtime:` key, so the runtime has to become a node-wide default, and every deploy path in this repository runs inside a privileged container, so a hypervisor-backed runtime cannot be exercised here at all."
msgstr "To host- og swarm- niveau fakta begrænset design og er fastsat nedenfor: swarm stack implementering dråber komponenten `runtime:` Nøgle, så runtime er nødt til at blive en nodewide standard, og hver implementering sti i dette lager kører inde i en privilegeret container, så en hypervisor- bakkes runtime kan ikke udøves her overhovedet."

