# libretranslate
msgid "When ``svc-net-tor`` is deployed, the node’s ``DOMAIN_PRIMARY`` is the minted ``.onion`` address, so the whole stack (web vhosts, Keycloak SSO, LDAP, CA) resolves onion domains consistently. The Tor daemon runs as a host-network compose sidecar and maps one hidden service to the host OpenResty (``HiddenServicePort 80 -> 127.0.0.1:80``); per-app subdomains (``<app>.<node>.onion``) are routed by the ``Host`` header. TLS is off on the onion side (onion v3 already provides transport encryption + server authentication); apps still receive ``X-Forwarded-Proto: https`` because ``.onion`` is a browser Secure Context."
msgstr "Hvornår ``svc-net-tor`` er indsat, knuden er ``DOMAIN_PRIMARY`` er den minted ``.onion`` adresse, så hele stakken (webværter Keycloak SSO, LDAP, CA) løser løg domæner konsekvent. Tor dæmonen kører som et host- netværk komponere sidevogn og kort en skjult service til værten OpenResty (``HiddenServicePort 80 -> 127.0.0.1:80``); per- app underdomæner (``<app>.<node>.onion``) er drevet af ``Host`` Header. TLS er slukket på løg side (løg v3 allerede giver transport kryptering + server autentificering); apps stadig modtager ``X-Forwarded-Proto: https`` fordi ``.onion`` er en browser Sikker sammenhæng."

# libretranslate
msgid "When ``svc-net-tor`` is in the deploy, mint (or reuse) the node onion and set ``applications.svc-net-tor.services.tor.node`` in the host_vars."
msgstr "Hvornår ``svc-net-tor`` er i deployering, mynte (eller genbrug) node løg og sæt ``applications.svc-net-tor.services.tor.node`` i host_vars."

# libretranslate
msgid "When ``tor_node`` is set (svc-net-tor deployed) and the URL's host is the ``primary_domain`` or a subdomain of it, swap that suffix for ``tor_node`` and force the ``http`` scheme (onion services are plaintext-only). Anything else — empty inputs, a host not under ``primary_domain``, an unparseable value — is returned unchanged, so the filter is a safe no-op on clearnet."
msgstr "Hvornår ``tor_node`` er sat (svc-net-tor indsat) og URL 'ens vært er ``primary_domain`` eller et underdomæne af det, bytte dette suffiks for ``tor_node`` og tvinge ``http`` Ordningen (løg tjenester er klartext- kun)Alt andet - tomme indgange, en vært ikke under ``primary_domain``, en unparseable værdi - returneres uændret, så filteret er en sikker no- op på klarnet."

# libretranslate
msgid "When ``version`` is unset (no services value, no override), the lookup returns the bare ``<image>`` (unpinned) and emits a ``display.warning`` so the operator notices the unpinned reference without aborting the play."
msgstr "Hvornår ``version`` er frakoblet (ingen tjenesteværdi, ingen override), lookup returnerer den bare ``<image>`` (ufastgjort) og afgiver a ``display.warning`` så operatøren bemærker den udelte reference uden at afbryde stykket."

