# libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD group them by dependency family such as `tests/external/update/` or `tests/external/github/` when more than one test exists."
msgstr "Du SKAL gruppere dem efter afhængighed familie såsom `tests/external/update/` eller `tests/external/github/` når der findes mere end én test."

