msgid "You SHOULD set `INFINITO_MEMSWAP_LIMIT` to the same value as `INFINITO_MEM_LIMIT` to disable swap inflation. Allowing swap masks OOM conditions that the real runner would hit."
msgstr "Du skal sætte `INFINITO_MEMSWAP_LIMIT` til samme værdi som `INFINITO_MEM_LIMIT` at deaktivere swapinflation. Tillader swap masker OOM betingelser, som den rigtige runner ville ramme."

