# libretranslate
msgid "[ ] Creating an agent optionally provisions a dedicated platform user account via the existing `users`/LDAP/Keycloak mechanism; the agent authenticates as that account (OIDC dashboard login, MCP `auth_subject: user`), and deploying against an existing account instead also works. **Partly done:** the account half is implemented and linted (see [Agent identity](#agent-identity)); the MCP half is **blocked** on no deployed provider offering per-user OAuth, which is the bar [035](035-mcp-proxy-expansion.md) sets before `auth_subject: user` may be declared."
msgstr "[ ] Oprettelse af en agent kan eventuelt levere en dedikeret platform bruger konto via den eksisterende `users`/ LDAP /Keycloak mekanisme; agenten autentificerer som denne konto (OIDC dashboard login, MCP `auth_subject: user`), og at anvende mod en eksisterende konto i stedet virker også. **Delvist udført:** kontoen er implementeret og lintet (Se [Agent identitet](#agent-identity)); MCP halvdelen er **blokeret** på ingen indsat udbyder tilbyder per- bruger OAuth, som er baren [035](035-mcp-proxy-expansion.md) sæt før `auth_subject: user` kan erklæres."

# libretranslate
msgid "[ ] Credentials and secret URL components are absent from logs, generated non-secret configuration, API responses, task output, Playwright traces, and exception text. **Three of the six surfaces are held statically:** logs and task output by [test_mcp_secrets_are_masked.py](../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_secrets_are_masked.py), which requires `no_log` or `mask_values` on any MCP task that both handles a secret and prints; Playwright traces by [test_mcp_secret_not_in_playwright.py](../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_secret_not_in_playwright.py), which forbids a `playwright.env.j2` from rendering `mcp_credential`, a `credentials.mcp_*` secret or a `key_credential` URL component. Generated non-secret configuration needs a secret/non-secret classification of rendered files that does not exist yet; API responses and exception text are runtime observations for the deploy phase."
msgstr "[ ] Valgt og hemmelige URL-komponenter er fraværende fra logfiler, genereret ikke-hemmelig konfiguration, API reaktioner, opgave output, Playwright spor, og undtagelse tekst. **Tre af de seks overflader holdes statisk:** logs og opgave output af [test_mcp_secrets_are_masked.py](../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_secrets_are_masked.py), som kræver `no_log` eller `mask_values` på enhver MCP-opgave, der både håndterer en hemmelighed og fingeraftryk Playwright spor efter [test_mcp_secret_not_in_playwright.py](../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_secret_not_in_playwright.py), som forbyder a `playwright.env.j2` fra fremvisning `mcp_credential`, a `credentials.mcp_*` hemmelig eller en `key_credential` URL komponent. Genereret ikke-hemmelig konfiguration kræver en hemmelig / ikke-hemmelig klassificering af udleverede filer, der ikke findes endnu; API-svar og exception tekst er runtime observationer for implementering fase."

