# libretranslate
msgid "[ ] Logout terminates the OpenBao session and integrates with the `logout` service when enabled. *The integration half is done and verified: the deploy activates the logout proxy for the openbao vhost, injects the universal-logout code with its CSP hash, and includes openbao in `LOGOUT_DOMAINS`. The termination half is **not** asserted, and an attempt to assert it surfaced a finding now recorded in the README — navigating to `/ui/vault/logout` leaves the session intact (the UI returns to `/ui/vault/secrets`, since the Ember app restores its token from browser storage). Proving termination needs the UI's own logout control driven from an authenticated session, which the persona blocks make awkward; the assertion was reverted rather than left failing.*"
msgstr "[ ] Logout afslutter OpenBao Det drejer sig om en række spørgsmål, der skal behandles. `logout` service når aktiveret. *Integrationen halvdel er gjort og verificeret: deployeringen aktiverer logout proxy for openbao vhost, indsætter universallogout kode med sin CSP hash, og omfatter openbao i `LOGOUT_DOMAINS`. Opsigelsen halvdelen er **ikke** hævdede, og et forsøg på at hævde det dukkede op et resultat nu registreret i README - navigering til `/ui/vault/logout` lader sessionen være intakt (UI vender tilbage til `/ui/vault/secrets`, da Ember app genopretter sin token fra browser opbevaring). Beviser opsigelse har brug for UI 's egen logoout kontrol drevet fra en bekræftet session, som persona blokke gør akavet; påstanden blev vendt tilbage snarere end venstre fiasko.*"

