# libretranslate
msgid "[006 - Service-gated Playwright tests](README.md#archive) established the `skipUnlessServiceEnabled(<service>)` contract: scenarios gate on `<SERVICE>_SERVICE_ENABLED` flags so a deploy with `disable=<service>` reports `skipped` instead of `failed`. [004 - Generic RBAC auto-provisioning](README.md#archive) plus [017 - Biber RBAC coverage](017-playwright-biber-rbac-coverage.md) extend that contract to RBAC-aware non-admin scenarios."
msgstr "[006 - Service- gated Playwright tests](README.md#archive) etableret `skipUnlessServiceEnabled(<service>)` kontrakt: scenarier gate på `<SERVICE>_SERVICE_ENABLED` flag så en deployering med `disable=<service>` rapporter `skipped` i stedet for `failed`. [004 - Generisk RBAC automatisk hensættelse](README.md#archive) plus [017 - Biber RBAC dækning](017-playwright-biber-rbac-coverage.md) udvide kontrakten til at omfatte RBAC-bevidste ikke-admin scenarier."

