msgid "[CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS) styles the user-facing surfaces of web applications across the deployment. This role registers `css` as a canonical service in the deployment's service registry so consumer roles can declare CSS as a runtime dependency."
msgstr "[CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS) stiller brugervendte overflader af web-applikationer på tværs af indsættelsen. Denne rolle registrerer `css` som en kanonisk tjeneste i deployeringens serviceregister, så forbrugerroller kan erklære CSS som en runtime afhængighed."

# libretranslate
msgid "[Caveman](https://github.com/JuliusBrussee/caveman) is a token-compression plugin installed via `make install-skills`. It reduces output token consumption through progressively terser communication styles. `make install-skills` copies the skills from the repository pinned as `INFINITO_SKILLS_REPOSITORY` in the generated `.env` (override via `custom.env`, see `docs/contributing/customize.md`); the [skills](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/skills) repository pins every skill in its `skills-lock.json` and also supports global installs via its own `make install`. This works universally across all supported agents: Claude Code, Codex, Gemini CLI, Cursor, Copilot, Windsurf, Cline, and more."
msgstr "[Caveman](https://github.com/JuliusBrussee/caveman) er et plugin til komprimering installeret via `make install-skills`. Det reducerer output token forbrug gennem gradvis termer kommunikation stilarter. `make install-skills` kopierer de færdigheder fra lageret fastgjort som `INFINITO_SKILLS_REPOSITORY` i den genererede `.env` (override via `custom.env`, se `docs/contributing/customize.md`); [færdigheder](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/skills) Depot pins alle færdigheder i sin `skills-lock.json` og også støtter globale installationer via sine egne `make install`. Dette virker universelt på tværs af alle understøttede agenter: Claude Code, Codex, Gemini CLI, Cursor, Copilot, Windsurf, Cline og meget mere."

