msgid "[Hermes Agent](https://hermes-agent.nousresearch.com/) is an agent runtime from Nous Research that runs tool-using agent sessions against OpenAI-compatible model backends. In gateway mode it serves an OpenAI-compatible HTTP API, where clients address the agent with the same request shape they use for a plain model."
msgstr "[Hermes Agent](https://hermes-agent.nousresearch.com/) er en agent runtime fra Nous Research, der kører tool- bruger agent sessioner mod OpenAI- kompatible model backends. I gateway-tilstand bruges en OpenAI- kompatibel HTTP API, hvor kunderne henvender sig til agenten med samme anmodningsform, som de bruger til en almindelig model."

# libretranslate
msgid "[Hermes Agent](https://hermes-agent.nousresearch.com/) is an autonomous agent runtime. This role runs it in embodied mode: on a machine that is dedicated to it, with direct access to the hardware of that machine. Where the container roles put a kernel boundary between the agent and its host, here the boundary is the device itself."
msgstr "[Hermes Agent](https://hermes-agent.nousresearch.com/) er en selvstændig agent runtime. Denne rolle kører det i legemlig tilstand: på en maskine, der er dedikeret til det, med direkte adgang til hardware af denne maskine. Hvor containerrollerne sætter en kerne grænse mellem agenten og dens vært, her er grænsen selve enheden."

# libretranslate
msgid "[Hermes Agent](roles/web-app-hermes/)"
msgstr "[Hermes Agent](roles/web-app-hermes/)"

