msgid "[Home Assistant](https://www.home-assistant.io/) is an open-source home automation platform that connects smart-home devices from many vendors behind a single local interface. It keeps device state, dashboards, and automation rules on the machine that runs it, and exposes them through a web interface, a REST API, and a built-in MCP server."
msgstr "[Hjemmeassistent](https://www.home-assistant.io/) er en opensource home automation platform, der forbinder smarthome enheder fra mange leverandører bag en enkelt lokal grænseflade. Det holder enhed tilstand, dashboards, og automatisering regler på den maskine, der kører det, og udsætter dem gennem en web-interface, en REST API, og en bygning-i MCP server."

