# libretranslate
msgid "[LiteLLM](https://docs.litellm.ai/) is an LLM gateway that puts a single OpenAI-compatible API in front of many model providers. Its admin UI is the gateway's built-in web interface for virtual API keys, teams, budgets and rate limits, model routing, and request and spend logs."
msgstr "[LiteLLM](https://docs.litellm.ai/) er en LLM gateway, der sætter en enkelt OpenAI- kompatibel API foran mange modeludbydere. Dens admin UI er gateways build- in web interface til virtuelle API nøgler, hold, budgetter og sats grænser, model routing, og anmode om og bruge logs."

