msgstr "[x] Klonen respekterer den rolevide CA- trust env så HTTPS klon arbejder bag den lokale CA terminator."

# libretranslate
msgid "[x] The compose flavor's deprecated status is surfaced in `roles/web-app-matrix/README.md` (lifecycle/`meta/info.yml::deprecated` is not part of the schema; the deprecation contract lives in the README and the `tasks/main.yml` dispatch comment)."
msgstr "[x] Den komponere smag er forældet status er dukket op i `roles/web-app-matrix/README.md` (livscyklus /`meta/info.yml::deprecated` er ikke en del af skemaet; determinationskontrakten bor i README og `tasks/main.yml` Afsendelsesbemærkning)."

# libretranslate
msgid "[x] The container healthcheck uses `sealedcode=200&uninitcode=200` so a freshly created, not-yet-initialised container becomes healthy enough for the init task to run, while the monitoring probe keeps the strict codes. Both halves asserted by `test-seal-status.js`; the deploy's init step only ran because the pre-init container reported healthy."
msgstr "[x] Beholderen helbredstjek bruger `sealedcode=200&uninitcode=200` Så en nyskabt, ikke-initialiseret beholder bliver sund nok til, at init-opgaven kan køre, mens overvågningssonden beholder de strenge koder. Begge halvdele hævdet af `test-seal-status.js`; deployeringen init trin kun kørte, fordi præ-init container rapporteret sund."

# libretranslate
msgid "[x] The dashboard at `/de/` shows the German translation of at least one card description and one menu category."
msgstr "[x] Dashboardet `/de/` viser den tyske oversættelse af mindst én kort beskrivelse og en menu kategori."

# libretranslate
msgid "[x] The declarative user configuration can assign `mcp` to one application without assigning it to any other application."
msgstr "[x] Den deklarative brugerkonfiguration kan tildele `mcp` til en ansøgning uden at tildele den til en anden ansøgning."

# libretranslate
msgid "[x] The deploy fails when a role declares the AI surface enabled while its configuration still carries an empty or unresolved API key, so a silently unauthenticated surface cannot reach a green deploy."
msgstr "[x] deployeringen mislykkes, når en rolle erklærer AI overflade aktiveret, mens dens konfiguration stadig bærer en tom eller uløst API nøgle, så en lydløst ubekræftet overflade ikke kan nå en grøn deployering."

# libretranslate
msgid "[x] The deploy resolves `DEPLOYMENT_MODE` per role from inventory: `swarm` iff `len(groups[application_id]) > 1`, else `compose`. Topology is the single source of truth; there is no per-role mode flag."
msgstr "[x] Opsætning løser `DEPLOYMENT_MODE` pr. rolle fra opgørelsen: `swarm` iff `len(groups[application_id]) > 1`, i øvrigt `compose`. Topologi er sandhedens eneste kilde; der er ikke noget flag for perrolletilstand."

# libretranslate
msgid "[x] The existing [svc-prx-openresty](../../roles/svc-prx-openresty/) remains the reverse proxy under BOTH `DEPLOYMENT_MODE: compose` AND `DEPLOYMENT_MODE: swarm`. No new reverse-proxy role is introduced by this requirement. This preserves the full `sys-front-inj-*` frontend-injection pipeline ([roles/sys-front-inj-all/templates/body_filter.lua.j2](../../roles/sys-front-inj-all/templates/body_filter.lua.j2)) — CSP-meta stripping, head/body snippet injection for Matomo / CSS / JavaScript / Dashboard / Logout — which is openresty-Lua-specific and has no equivalent in Traefik without a non-trivial plugin port."
msgstr "[x] De eksisterende [svc-prx-openresty](../../roles/svc-prx-openresty/) forbliver den omvendte proxy under BOTH `DEPLOYMENT_MODE: compose` OG `DEPLOYMENT_MODE: swarm`. Ingen ny omvendt-proxy rolle er indført med dette krav. Dette bevarer den fulde `sys-front-inj-*` rørledning ([roles/sys-front-inj-all/templates/body_filter.lua.j2](../../roles/sys-front-inj-all/templates/body_filter.lua.j2)) - CSP- meta stripping, hoved / krop snippet injektion til Matomo / CSS / JavaScript / Dashboard / Logout - som er åben-Lua- specifik og har ingen tilsvarende i Traefik uden en ikke-triviel plugin port."

# libretranslate
msgid "[x] The existing backup documentation gains an NFS section covering: snapshot semantics on the NFS server, restore procedure, and interaction with the existing `svc-bkp-*` roles."
msgstr "[x] Den eksisterende backup dokumentation får en NFS sektion, der dækker: snapshot semantik på NFS server, gendanne procedure, og interaktion med de eksisterende `svc-bkp-*` roller."

# libretranslate
