msgstr "[x] Den indfødte `mcp_server` integration er aktiveret og erklæret i `meta/services.yml` som `direction: server`, `implementation: native`, `transport: streamable_http`, svarende til [025](025-mcp-role-integration.md) skema og lint."

# libretranslate
msgid "[x] The operational metadata stays role-local: authoritative source, transport, authentication, real credential subject, read/write scope, tool allowlist, proposed implementation, selected consumers, and blocker all live in the role's own `meta/mcp.yml`, and [test_mcp_schema.py](../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_schema.py) enforces their shape there. A generated report aggregating them was removed: scope and credential subject were identical for every role, so the table restated its sources instead of deriving anything from them."
msgstr "[x] De operationelle metadata forbliver role- lokale: autoritativ kilde, transport, autentificering, reelle crediential emne, læse / skrive omfang, værktøj allolist, foreslået implementering, udvalgte forbrugere, og blocker alle lever i rollen egen `meta/mcp.yml`, og [test_mcp_schema.py](../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_schema.py) håndhæver deres form der. En genereret rapport, der aggregerede dem, blev fjernet: omfang og creditial emne var identiske for hver rolle, så tabellen gentog sine kilder i stedet for at udlede noget fra dem."

# libretranslate
