# libretranslate
msgid "`.env` (gitignored) is generated by `make dotenv`, which delegates to `python -m cli.meta.env`. It combines `default.env` with runtime-resolved values (selected distro, GHA/Act flags, df/meminfo-derived cache sizes, sha256 secrets, repository owner, ...). Each line in `.env` is preceded by its own comment, so the file is self-describing. Open it after `make dotenv` to inspect the effective value-set together with its documentation."
msgstr "`.env` (gitignored) genereres af `make dotenv`, som uddelegerer til `python -m cli.meta.env`. Den kombinerer `default.env` med runtime- setted værdier (valgt distro, GHA / Act flag, df / meminfo- afledte cache størrelser, sha256 hemmeligheder, lagerejer,...). Hver linje i `.env` Forud for sin egen kommentar, så filen er selvbeskrivende. Åbn den efter `make dotenv` at inspicere det effektive værdisæt sammen med dets dokumentation."

# libretranslate
msgid "`.env` is consumed by bash `source` and docker-compose `--env-file`, neither of which round-trips multi-line values; the writer therefore rejects them. Other NIX_CONFIG settings (`accept-flake-config`, `experimental-features`, …) belong in `/etc/nix/nix.conf` (Dockerfile injects them inside the dev container; host operators set them once in `~/.config/nix/nix.conf`)."
msgstr "`.env` forbruges af bash `source` og docker- komponér `--env-file`, ingen af hvilke rundture multi-line værdier; forfatteren derfor afviser dem. Andre varer NIX_CONFIG indstillinger (`accept-flake-config`, `experimental-features`,...) tilhører i `/etc/nix/nix.conf` (Dockerfile injicerer dem inde i dev container; vært operatører indstille dem én gang i `~/.config/nix/nix.conf`)."

# libretranslate
msgid "`.github/workflows/call-test-deploy.yml` runs the replay as the job's last step, after the row's own deploy and after the swarm teardown: the replay deploys the role a second time and needs the runner's ports. It calls `scripts/tests/deploy/distros.sh scripts/github/guide/one.sh` with `GUIDE_ROLE` set to the row's app and `GUIDE_MODE` to the mode the marker carries, which is independent of the deploy mode the rotation gave the row. A swarm row therefore still replays a `compose` guide."
msgstr "`.github/workflows/call-test-deploy.yml` kører replay som jobbets sidste skridt, efter rækken egen implementering og efter sværm teardown: replay giver rollen en anden gang og har brug for runner havne. Det kalder `scripts/tests/deploy/distros.sh scripts/github/guide/one.sh` med `GUIDE_ROLE` indstillet til rækken app og `GUIDE_MODE` til den tilstand markøren bærer, som er uafhængig af deployeringstilstand rotationen gav rækken. En sværm række derfor stadig spiller en `compose` vejledning."

