# libretranslate
msgid "`INCLUDE_PATHS` — newline-separated workflow paths, the members of the concurrency group being backed up. Without it the helpers would also cancel runs the group never governed, such as the `cron-*` workflows that listen on `push`. Derive the list from the `concurrency:` blocks, not from what looks related: `entry-delete-branch.yml` keys its group on the *deleted* ref, so it is not a member of a push's group, and listing it would make a push to `main` cancel an unrelated branch cleanup. A value that lists no path at all aborts rather than silently matching nothing."
msgstr "`INCLUDE_PATHS` - nye, adskilte arbejdsgange, hvor medlemmerne af koncurrencegruppen bakkes op. Uden den ville hjælpere også annullere kører gruppen aldrig styret, såsom `cron-*` arbejdsgange, der lytter til `push`. Forfærdelig listen fra `concurrency:` blokke, ikke fra hvad ser relateret til: `entry-delete-branch.yml` Den Europæiske Union *slettet* ref, så det er ikke medlem af et push gruppe, og en liste det ville gøre et skub til `main` annullerer en ikke-relateret grenrydning. En værdi, der ikke viser nogen vej på alle aborts snarere end lydløst matchende ingenting."

