# libretranslate
msgid "``ansible`` (default) wraps `matrix-docker-ansible-deploy <https://github.com/spantaleev/matrix-docker-ansible-deploy>`__ (MDAD). MDAD runs ~70 upstream sub-roles to deliver Synapse, Element, every supported bridge, Element Call, and Jitsi. Infinito.Nexus pins MDAD by commit, renders an MDAD inventory from ``services.matrix.*`` knobs, and disables MDAD’s bundled Traefik / Postgres / Redis so the central Infinito services back the stack."
msgstr "``ansible`` (standard) wraps `matrix-docker-ansible-deploy <https://github.com/spantaleev/matrix-docker-ansible-deploy>`__ (MDAD). MDAD kører ~70 opstrøms underroller til at levere Synapse, Element, hver understøttet bro, Element Call, og Jitsi. Infinito.Nexus Pins MDAD ved commit, gør en MDAD opgørelse fra ``services.matrix.*`` knopper og deaktiverer MDAD 's bundtede Traefik / Postgres / Redis Så den centrale Infinito service tilbage stakken."

