# libretranslate
msgid "``priority`` IS the retrigger: it names what failed. ``offset`` is recomputed rather than carried, but from the carried value up: the source run got a stretch behind its own offset green before its budget ran out, so the regular line resumes behind that stretch (:func:`cli.administration.deploy.ci.selections.resume_offset`) instead of repeating it, and never falls back behind where that run started. Everything else is carried verbatim, including ``whitelist``, so a retrigger of a scoped run stays inside that scope instead of quietly widening to the whole repository."
msgstr "``priority`` IS genudløser: Det navngiver, hvad der mislykkedes. ``offset`` er genberegnet snarere end båret, men fra den medfølgende værdi op: kilden køre fik en strækning bag sin egen offset grøn før dens budget løb ud, så den regelmæssige linje genoptager bag denne strækning (:func:`cli.administration.deploy.ci.selections.resume_offset`) I stedet for at gentage det, og aldrig falde tilbage bag, hvor det løb startede. Alt andet er transporteret ordret, herunder ``whitelist``, så en genudløser af en scoped run forbliver inden for dette omfang i stedet for roligt udvide til hele lageret."

