msgid "`skipped` counts as passed, so an empty chunk never blocks the chain. After fixing what broke a sweep, `resume_from_chunk` re-enters at that index instead of re-running the green chunks. Both are inputs on `entry-manual-steer.yml`; the other entry points take the defaults. A retrigger carries the source run's `chunk_gate` over unless `infinito administration deploy ci trigger --chunk-gate false` overrides it; the `i8ciallon` alias is `i8ciall` with that override, for sweeps that should report every chunk before anyone looks."
msgstr "`skipped` tæller som bestået, så et tomt stykke aldrig blokerer kæden. Efter at have ordnet, hvad der brød en sweep, `resume_from_chunk` re- indtaster på dette indeks i stedet for re- kører de grønne stykker. Begge er input på `entry-manual-steer.yml`; de andre indgange tager standardværdierne. En genudløser bærer kildeløbets `chunk_gate` over medmindre `infinito administration deploy ci trigger --chunk-gate false` Overdriver det; `i8ciallon` alias er `i8ciall` med overriden, for sweeps, der skal rapportere hver stykke før nogen ser."

