# libretranslate
msgid "`transport` accepts `streamable_http` and `sse` only. A stdio MCP server is a local process the client spawns, so it inherits the client container's filesystem and network with no endpoint to authenticate, no proxy to route through, and nothing for a probe to reach. Every property the other rules rely on (`auth`, `exposure`, `endpoint`) is undefined for it. Clients that support stdio are pinned away from it in their own role: Flowise sets `CUSTOM_MCP_PROTOCOL=sse` so no flow can spawn a command."
msgstr "`transport` accepterer `streamable_http` og `sse` Kun. En stdio MCP server er en lokal proces klienten spowns, så det arver klientcontainerens filsystem og netværk uden endpoint til at autentificere, ingen proxy til rute gennem, og intet for en sonde at nå. Hver ejendom de andre regler stole på (`auth`, `exposure`, `endpoint`) er udefineret for det. Klienter, der understøtter stdio er fastgjort væk fra det i deres egen rolle: Flowise sæt `CUSTOM_MCP_PROTOCOL=sse` Så intet flow kan udgive en kommando."

