# libretranslate
msgid "ejabberd's `mod_admin` HTTP UI is the only Playwright-testable surface; XMPP client login itself runs over 5222/5269 and MUST be exercised by an XMPP-aware client outside the Playwright test loop."
msgstr "Ejaberd 's `mod_admin` HTTP UI er den eneste Playwright- testable overflade; XMPP klient login selv kører over 5222/5269 og SKAL udøves af XMPP-bevidst klient uden for Playwright test loop."

# libretranslate
msgid "ejabberd's only HTTP surface is `ejabberd_web_admin` on `/admin` (see [`templates/configuration.yml.j2`](./templates/configuration.yml.j2)). It authenticates a bare JID against LDAP over HTTP Basic, so there is no Keycloak redirect to follow and no in-app logout control to click; client authentication itself runs over ports 5222/5269 and stays outside the Playwright loop, as noted under Watch Points. `acl.admin` additionally lists only the administrator JID, so the web admin refuses every other account outright. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) therefore declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`; the `guest` persona and the baseline reachability assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "ejabberds eneste HTTP-overflade er `ejabberd_web_admin` om `/admin` (Se [`templates/configuration.yml.j2`](./templates/configuration.yml.j2)). Det autentificerer en bare JID mod LDAP over HTTP Basic, så der er ingen Keycloak omdirigere at følge og ingen in- app logout kontrol til at klikke; klient autentificering selv kører over porte 5222/5269 og forbliver uden for Playwright loop, som bemærket under Watch Points. `acl.admin` desuden lister kun administratoren JID, så web admin afviser alle andre konto direkte. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) Derfor erklærer `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` og `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`; `guest` persona og basislinjens påstande om, at de kan nås, løber betingelsesløst."

# libretranslate
msgid "ejabberd’s ``mod_admin`` HTTP UI is the only Playwright-testable surface; XMPP client login itself runs over 5222/5269 and MUST be exercised by an XMPP-aware client outside the Playwright test loop."
msgstr "Ejaberd 's ``mod_admin`` HTTP UI er den eneste Playwright- testable overflade; XMPP klient login selv kører over 5222/5269 og SKAL udøves af XMPP-bevidst klient uden for Playwright test loop."

