msgid "⚠️ **Do not paste that expression into a workflow that listens on `pull_request_target`.** There `github.ref` is the *base* branch, so `github.ref_name` is literally `main` and the rule collapses to a constant `false` — every pull request would stop cancelling its predecessor. `entry-pr-change-orchestrate.yml` therefore declares `cancel-in-progress: true` outright."
