# libretranslate
msgid "🔑 **OIDC login via Keycloak (Option B, default on):** [`taiga-contrib-oidc-auth`](https://github.com/taigaio/taiga-contrib-oidc-auth) enables SSO via Keycloak → LDAP. **Note:** The OIDC plugin is not published on PyPI and requires a custom `taiga-front` image with the frontend plugin built in (CoffeeScript/Gulp). Without the custom frontend image the SSO button will not appear in the UI."
msgstr "🔑 **OIDC login via Keycloak (Valgmulighed B, standard den):** [`taiga-contrib-oidc-auth`](https://github.com/taigaio/taiga-contrib-oidc-auth) aktiverer SSO via Keycloak → LDAP. **Bemærk:** OIDC plugin er ikke offentliggjort på PyPI og kræver en brugerdefineret `taiga-front` billede med frontend plugin indbygget (CoffeeScript / Gulp). Uden brugerdefinerede frontend billede SSO-knappen vil ikke vises i UI."

# libretranslate
msgid "🔑 **OIDC login via Keycloak (Option B, default on):** ```taiga-contrib-oidc-auth`` <https://github.com/taigaio/taiga-contrib-oidc-auth>`__ enables SSO via Keycloak → LDAP. **Note:** The OIDC plugin is not published on PyPI and requires a custom ``taiga-front`` image with the frontend plugin built in (CoffeeScript/Gulp). Without the custom frontend image the SSO button will not appear in the UI."
